8T23:24:06.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T20:43:07.000Z","description":"As of Saturday, a three-day ceasefire will apply between Ukraine and Russia. US President Donald Trump just announced on his platform \"Truth Social.\" Prisoners will also be exchanged. Selenskyj and Putin's foreign policy advisor confirmed the announcement. US President Donald Trump, according to his own statements, convinced Russia and Ukraine of a three-day ceasefire from tomorrow, which will include the suspension of all fighting and the excha…","originalDescription":"Ab Samstag soll zwischen der Ukraine und Russland ein dreitägiger Waffenstillstand gelten. Das teilte US-Präsident Donald Trump soeben auf seiner Plattform „Truth Social“ mit. Außerdem sollen Gefangene ausgetauscht werden. Selenskyj und ein außenpolitischer Berater Putins bestätigten die Verkündung. US-Präsident Donald Trump hat nach eigenen Angaben Russland und die Ukraine von einer ab dem morgigen Samstag geltenden dreitägigen Waffenruhe überz…","lang":"de","paywall":"no","refId":"124d0a49-0acb-4df9-925c-d5095144396d","sortData":{"locality":{"index":196,"labelData":"international","flag":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/flags/120_120/AT.png"},"bias":{"index":285,"labelData":"right"},"date":{"index":392,"labelData":"2026-05-08T20:43:07.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Ukraine: Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire","originalTitle":"Ukraine: Trump kündigt dreitägige Waffenruhe an","url":"https://www.krone.at/4134982","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"right","biasRatings":[{"reviewerId":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","politicalBias":"right","referenceUrl":"https://mediabiasfactcheck.com/kronen-zeitung-bias/","sourceInfoId":"e7ec33de-6a17-469a-aca0-d1f27818d5e3","reviewer":{"id":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","name":"Media Bias/Fact Check","icon":"https://b-cdn.ground.news/assets/external_source_reviewer_icons/mediaBiasFactCheck.png"}}],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/[7b7]/74367454a2c9249e72a