e74d5","sortData":{"locality":{"index":106,"labelData":"international","flag":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/flags/120_120/CA.png"},"bias":{"index":23,"labelData":"leanLeft"},"date":{"index":165,"labelData":"2026-05-08T18:28:15.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump says Russia and Ukraine have agreed to his request for a 3-day ceasefire and a prisoner swap","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.coastreporter.net/world-news/trump-says-russia-and-ukraine-have-agreed-to-his-request-for-a-3-day-ceasefire-and-a-prisoner-swap-12256998","wireStoryId":"72434a09-f786-417c-a537-a31c4217cb53","sourceInfo":{"bias":"leanLeft","biasRatings":[{"reviewerId":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","politicalBias":"leanLeft","referenceUrl":"https://mediabiasfactcheck.com/sechelt-coast-reporter-bias/","sourceInfoId":"83e2e022-83be-4e9e-b0c9-ba97e5eb4868","reviewer":{"id":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","name":"Media Bias/Fact Check","icon":"https://b-cdn.ground.news/assets/external_source_reviewer_icons/mediaBiasFactCheck.png"}}],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/4ddcffc6fa86b6c7d5e43d719b210e91b8dcce39.jpg","id":"83e2e022-83be-4e9e-b0c9-ba97e5eb4868","interestId":"5c4a0d61-9f5c-4f3b-8ca0-4f949042cd5d","location":{"lat":49.47535,"lon":-123.758345},"name":"Coast Reporter","paywall":"no","place":[{"id":"Sechelt,SunshineCoast,BC,CA","name":"Sechelt","type":"locality"},{"id":"SunshineCoast,BC,CA","name":"Sunshine Coast","type":"administrative_area_level_2"},{"id":"BC,CA","name":"British Columbia","type":"administrative_area_level_1"},{"id":"CA","name":"Canada","type":"country"}],"placeId":"Sechelt,SunshineCoast,BC,CA","storyCount":145975,"slug":"coast-reporter","factuality":"high","owners":[{"id":183,"category":"mediaConglomerate","name":"Glacier Media"}]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T23:01:40.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:17:00.000Z","description":"The US President announced a three-day truce between Ukraine and Russia. He wrote about this on social media. “I am happy to announce the introduction of a three-day truce from May 9 to May 11 in the “conflict” between Russia and Ukraine. In Russia, this holiday is dedicated to Victory Day,” Trump said. He explained that the truce would include the cessation of all hostilities, as well as the exchange of prisoners — 1,000 people from each countr…","originalDescription":"Президент США объявил о трехдневном перемирии между Украиной и Россией. Об этом он написал в соцсети. \"Я рад объявить о введении трехдневного перемирия с 9 по 11 мая в \"конфликте\" между Россией и Украиной. В России этот праздник посвящен Дню победы\", – заявил Трамп. Он пояснил, что перемирие будет включать прекращение всех боевых действий, а также обмен пленными — по 1000 человек из каждой страны. \nВАС ЗАИНТЕРЕСУЕТ \nВ Польше считают \"абсурдом\" п…","lang":"ru","paywall":"no","refId":"c516a561-8abe-4de6-ba1c-4da836d0ed60","sortData":{"locality":{"index":215,"labelData":"international","flag":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/flags/120_120/UA.png"},"bias":{"index":323,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":81,"labelData":"2026-05-08T18:17:00.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announced a Three-Day Truce Between Ukraine and the Russian Federation","originalTitle":"Трамп анонсировал перемирие между Украиной и РФ на три дня","url":"https://zn.ua/usa/tramp-anonsiroval-peremirie-mezhdu-ukrainoj-i-rf-na-tri-dnja.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/379204712999760983b798f46e7a2736f40cc0b9.jpg","id":"1c4b5834-9e54-438a-b67a-282aba1856c1","interestId":"d9b76c69-da9e-4d9b-bcd3-2def6f4c7e80","location":{"lat":50.454849,"lon":30.542772},"name":"ZN.UA Зеркало недели","paywall":"no","place":[{"id":"Kyiv,KyivCity,UA","name":"Kyiv","type":"locality"},{"id":"KyivCity,Kyivcity,UA","name":"Kyiv City Municipality","type":"administrative_area_level_2"},{"id":"Kyivcity,UA","name":"Kyiv City Region","type":"administrative_area