236,"category":"mediaConglomerate","name":"Nine Entertainment Co."}]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T21:06:58.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:20:00.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump announced that a three-day truce had been agreed in the war between Ukraine and Russia and stated that there would be another exchange of war weapons.","originalDescription":"Američki predsednik Donald Tramp saopštio je da dogovoreno trodnevno primirje u ratu između Ukrajine i Rusije i naveo da će doći do još jedne razmene ratnih zar","lang":"sr","paywall":"no","refId":"8c9bf2f8-db56-475d-92e5-9b81d8d40933","sortData":{"locality":{"index":209,"labelData":"international","flag":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/flags/120_120/RS.png"},"bias":{"index":439,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":326,"labelData":"2026-05-08T19:20:00.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump: Agreed Three-Day Truce in Ukraine","originalTitle":"Tramp: Dogovoreno trodnevno primirje u Ukrajini","url":"https://n1info.rs/svet/tramp-dogovoreno-trodnevno-primirje-u-ukrajini/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/letterIcons/square/00BFA5/N.png","id":"eb7d5365-6b7c-4ee7-8c70-7d0725cb9bdf","interestId":"2244e7df-31e0-4d45-a18e-b31da766ca8c","location":{"lat":44.810868,"lon":20.38158},"name":"n1info.rs","paywall":"no","place":[{"id":"NoviBeograd,BG,CityofBelgrade,RS","name":"Novi Beograd","type":"locality"},{"id":"BG,CityofBelgrade,RS","name":"Belgrade","type":"locality"},{"id":"CityofBelgrade,RS","name":"City of Belgrade","type":"administrative_area_level_2"},{"id":"RS","name":"Serbia","type":"country"}],"placeId":"NoviBeograd,BG,CityofBelgrade,RS","storyCount":101474,"slug":"n1infors","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:30:28.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:52:23.000Z","description":"Donald Trump announced a three-day truce in the war between Russia and Ukraine on Friday, from May 9 to 11, coinciding with Victory Day, Russia's major commemoration of the defeat of Nazi Germany in World War II. The US president stated on his social media platform, Truth Social, that the ceasefire would include a suspension of all \"kinetic activity\" and an exchange of 1,000 prisoners of war for each side. According to Trump, the request was mad…","originalDescription":"Donald Trump anunció este viernes una tregua de tres días en la guerra entre Rusia y Ucrania, del 9 al 11 de mayo , coincidiendo con el Día de la Victoria, la gran conmemoración rusa de la derrota de la Alemania nazi en la Segunda Guerra Mundial. El presidente de Estados Unidos aseguró en su red Truth Social que el alto el fuego incluirá la suspensión de toda «actividad cinética» y un intercambio de 1.000 prisioneros por cada lado.Según Trump, l…","lang":"es","paywall":"yes","refId":"06798988-b0c7-487d-96a9-29af3c409ec9","sortData":{"locality":{"index":151,"labelData":"international","flag":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/flags/120_120/ES.png"},"bias":{"index":227,"labelData":"leanRight"},"date":{"index":263,"labelData":"2026-05-08T18:52:23.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Truce in Ukraine for Russian Victory Day","originalTitle":"Trump anuncia una tregua de tres días en Ucrania para el Día de la Victoria rusa","url":"https://www.abc.es/internacional/trump-anuncia-tregua-tres-dias-ucrania-dia-20260508205218-nt.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"leanRight","biasRatings":[{"reviewerId":"0b06b55d-d3d4-4653-b4db-b22c77d812f7","politicalBias":"center","referenceUrl":"https://www.adfontesmedia.com/","sourceInfoId":"c2564188-df2d-4a69-a8dd-bd65cddc7a69","reviewer":{"id":"0b06b55d-d3d4-4653-b4db-b22c77d812f7","name":"Ad Fontes Media","icon":"https://b-cdn.ground.news/assets/external_source_reviewer_icons/adFontes.png"}},{"reviewerId":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","politicalBias":"leanRight","referenceUrl":"https://mediabiasfactcheck.com/abc-spain/","sour