ription":"A significant development in the Ukraine-Russia conflict has been announced. US President Donald Trump revealed that both nations have agreed to a three-day truce commencing Saturday. This ceasefire is expected to be accompanied by a mutual exchange of 1,000 prisoners each.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"a45ec892-3bba-4f35-ac1d-fe363cb94159","sortData":{"locality":{"index":285,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":335,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":103,"labelData":"2026-05-08T18:21:00.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Donald Trump announces three-day Ukraine-Russia ceasefire","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://m.economictimes.com/news/international/world-news/donald-trump-announces-three-day-ukraine-russia-ceasefire/articleshow/130965811.cms","wireStoryId":"73deb6b7-0007-418d-ae29-b6cdef2cb4dd","sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/d66139e4e1d3e2d2990d4c2044fe30f8b4dfb060.jpg","id":"9ba68206-f5cf-4452-8032-5084c7a59b59","interestId":"9c63c7db-8774-41ed-81f8-5e26713929fd","location":null,"name":"The Economic Times","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":89507,"slug":"the-economic-times","factuality":"unknown","owners":[{"id":227,"category":"billionaire","name":"Sahu Jain family"}]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:35:44.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:10:41.000Z","description":"The Ukrainian population has been living in uncertainty for over four years due to Russian terror. Peace talks have yielded little results so far, and the fighting continues. Follow the latest developments regarding the war in Ukraine in our live blog.","originalDescription":"De Oekraïense bevolking leeft al ruim vier jaar in onzekerheid door de Russische terreur. Vredesgesprekken leverden tot nu toe weinig op, de gevechten gaan door. Volg de laatste ontwikkelingen rond de oorlog in Oekraïne in ons liveblog.","lang":"nl","paywall":"yes","refId":"ed798c50-