:09:30.000Z","description":"The announcement of the US President comes at a time when the Kremlin unilaterally declared a suspension of hostilities on the occasion of the celebration of the 1945 victory. On Friday, Ukraine reported more than 800 shots of Russian drones, while Russia claims to have destroyed more than 260 Ukrainian sides.","originalDescription":"L’annonce du président américain intervient alors que le Kremlin avait déclaré unilatéralement une suspension des hostilités à l’occasion de la célébration de la victoire de 1945. Ce vendredi, l’Ukraine a rapporté plus de 800 tirs de drones russes, tandis que la Russie dit en avoir détruit plus de 260 côté ukrainiens.","lang":"fr","paywall":"yes","refId":"52b6c771-68de-4431-aa98-64ca8295de26","sortData":{"locality":{"index":143,"labelData":"international","flag":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/flags/120_120/FR.png"},"bias":{"index":39,"labelData":"leanLeft"},"date":{"index":295,"labelData":"2026-05-08T19:09:30.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"War in Ukraine: After Moscow, Trump Announces a Cease-Fire, Starting on Saturday","originalTitle":"Guerre en Ukraine : après Moscou, Trump annonce à son tour un cessez-le-feu, à partir de samedi","url":"https://www.liberation.fr/international/europe/ukraine-zelensky-accuse-moscou-de-ne-pas-respecter-la-treve-la-russie-affirme-quelle-ne-fait-que-riposter-20260508_52HBTD4KA5CU3PGC2V5GXOZY34/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"leanLeft","biasRatings":[{"reviewerId":"0b06b55d-d3d4-4653-b4db-b22c77d812f7","politicalBias":"leanLeft","referenceUrl":"https://www.adfontesmedia.com/","sourceInfoId":"857e37a6-84a0-4491-97de-929f9e948d1c","reviewer":{"id":"0b06b55d-d3d4-4653-b4db-b22c77d812f7","name":"Ad Fontes Media","icon":"https://b-cdn.ground.news/assets/external_source_reviewer_icons/adFontes.png"}},{"reviewerId":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","politicalBias":"leanLeft","referenceUrl":"https://mediabiasfactcheck.com/liberation-paris-bias/","sourceInfoId":