d it’: Trump pushes Russia-Ukraine war as his ‘10th peace deal’","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://english.mathrubhumi.com/news/world/trump-russia-ukraine-ceasefire-may-2026-kntuja6v","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/c33919e67ebda7908319639361e06fb6142faa4f.jpg","id":"4ef954dc-a70a-4aab-a8bb-858fd140296f","interestId":"5981baf7-e1c7-452e-9fa7-c3f38222cf56","location":{"lat":11.07878,"lon":76.398648},"name":"Mathrubhumi","paywall":"no","place":[{"id":"KL,IN","name":"Kerala","type":"administrative_area_level_1"},{"id":"IN","name":"India","type":"country"}],"placeId":"KL,IN","storyCount":81629,"slug":"mathrubhumi","factuality":"unknown","owners":[{"id":462,"category":"billionaire","name":"M. P. Veerendra Kumar"}]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T11:07:40.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:26:54.000Z","description":"U.S. President Donald Trump said Friday that his counterparts from Russia and Ukraine, Vladimir Putin and Volodimir Zelenski, have agreed to a ceasefire between May 9 and 11, which includes suspending all attacks and an exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each country.Continue reading...","originalDescription":"El presidente de Estados Unidos, Donald Trump, aseguró este viernes que sus homólogos de Rusia y Ucrania, Vladímir Putin y Volodímir Zelenski, han acordado un alto el fuego entre el 9 y 11 de mayo que incluye suspender todo ataque y un intercambio de mil prisioneros de cada país.Seguir leyendo....","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"84226d6b-b08a-43d1-94c1-c4d6ae57912f","sortData":{"locality":{"index":181,"labelData":"international","flag":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/flags/120_120/ES.png"},"bias":{"index":116,"labelData":"center"},"date":{"index":158,"labelData":"2026-05-08T18:26:54.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Russian-Ukrainian Ceasefire May 9-11","originalTitle":"Trump anuncia un alto el fuego entre Rusia y Ucrania del 9 al 11 de mayo","url":"https://www.elperiodico.com/es/internacional/20260508/trump-anuncia-alto-fuego-rusia-ucrania-9-11-mayo-130018021","wireStoryId":"df440355-92c2-4f35-8a7c-c1b63d29ccf6","sourceInfo":{"bias":"center","biasRatings":[{"reviewerId":"0b06b55d-d3d4-4653-b4db-b22c77d812f7","politicalBias":"center","referenceUrl":"https://www.adfontesmedia.com/","sourceInfoId":"980056cf-d866-4fba-b901-778e4c3ff8c6","reviewer":{"id":"0b06b55d-d3d4-4653-b4db-b22c77d812f7","name":"Ad Fontes Media","icon":"https://b-cdn.ground.news/assets/external_source_reviewer_icons/adFontes.png"}}],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/aac746df82844ae5d3ecc0afe431188c6487f0ea.jpg","id":"980056cf-d866-4fba-b901-778e4c3ff8c6","interestId":"46f2a4b9-5083-42ea-9d7f-5069280c8f60","location":{"lat":41.379021,"lon":2.182923},"name":"El Periódico","paywall":"no","place":[{"id":"Barcelona,CT,ES","name":"Barcelona","type":"locality"},{"id":"CT,ES","name":"Catalonia","type":"administrative_area_level_1"},{"id":"ES","name":"Spain","type":"country"}],"placeId":"Barcelona,CT,ES","storyCount":81504,"slug":"el-periodico","factuality":"high","owners":[{"id":359,"category":"mediaConglomerate","name":"Grupo Zeta"}]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T02:41:05.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T22:09:12.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump announced a three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine on May 9-10-11. The ceasefire, which came into effect before Victory Day celebrations, will halt all attacks and include a mutual exchange of 1,000 prisoners of war. Trump's statement, \"This could be the beginning of the end of the war,\" made headlines around the world.","originalDescription":"ABD Başkanı Donald Trump, Rusya ile Ukrayna arasında 9-10-11 Mayıs tarihlerinde üç günlük ateşkes ilan edileceğini açıkladı. Zafer Günü kutlamaları öncesi devreye giren ateşkes kararının tüm saldırıları durduracağı ve tarafların karşılıklı biner savaş esiri takası yapacağı belirtilirken, Trump’ın “Bu savaşın sonunun başlangıcı olabilir” sözleri dünya gündemine damga vurdu.","lang":"tr","paywall":"no","refId":"8c07ad40-9cf5-4c69-b8f8-3b9cba12552e","sortData":{"locality":{"index":230,"labelData":"international","flag":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/flags/120_120/TR.png"},"bias":{"index":338,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":430,"labelData":"2026-05-08T22:09:12.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Halts Russia-Ukraine War for 72 Hours!","originalTitle":"Trump’tan Rusya-Ukrayna savaşına 72 saatlik fren!","url":"https://www.ahaber.com.tr/dunya/2026/05/09/trumptan-rusya-ukrayna-savasina-72-saatlik-fren","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/2218ddf6dbe08e70ab3d9a1a43e86e484e92ce6e.jpg","id":"b4138172-bc37-4a2b-a727-51ee2eb1be84","interestId":"ddca8379-3b19-4d7c-9487-5ad922ddf867","location":{"lat":38.178194,"lon":35.908379},"name":"A Haber","paywall":"no","place":[{"id":"TR","name":"Turkey","type":"country"}],"placeId":"TR","storyCount":81353,"slug":"ahabercomtr","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:13:51.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:46:52.000Z","description":"According to Trump, military operations will be completely suspended during the ceasefire that will last until Monday, and the two countries will also exchange thousands of prisoners of war.","originalDescription":"Trump szerint a hétfőig tartó tűzszünet alatt teljesen felfüggesztik a katonai műveleteket, emellett a két ország ezer-ezer hadifoglyot is kicserél.","lang":"hu","paywall":"no","refId":"e7348952-2187-4ca7-8690-f52ac89fb0d9","sortData":{"locality":{"index":288,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":40,"labelData":"leanLeft"},"date":{"index":247,"labelData":"2026-05-08T18:46:52.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Donald Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire Between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":"Háromnapos tűzszünetet jelentett be Donald Trump Ukrajna és Oroszország között","url