 of all military activity and an exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each country. I made this request directly and I greatly appreciate your acceptance by President Vladimir Putin an…","originalDescription":"El presidente de Estados Unidos, Donald Trump, ha anunciado este viernes un alto el fuego de tres días, 9, 10 y 11 de mayo, con motivo del Día de Victoria después de que sus homólogos ruso y ucraniano, Vladimir Putin y Volodymyr Zelensky, hayan aceptado la propuesta.“Este alto el fuego incluirá la suspensión de toda actividad militar y un intercambio de 1.000 prisioneros de cada país. Esta solicitud la hice directamente yo y agradezco enormement…","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"b6bbebda-7aab-4065-9aa1-b1a81bc7ed9d","sortData":{"locality":{"index":207,"labelData":"international","flag":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/flags/120_120/CL.png"},"bias":{"index":236,"labelData":"leanRight"},"date":{"index":325,"labelData":"2026-05-08T19:19:40.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine on Victory Day · Global Voices","originalTitle":"Trump anuncia un alto el fuego de tres días entre Rusia y Ucrania con motivo del Día de la Victoria","url":"https://www.latercera.com/mundo/noticia/trump-anuncia-un-alto-el-fuego-de-tres-dias-entre-rusia-y-ucrania-con-motivo-del-dia-de-la-victoria/","wireStoryId":"f06b658a-3fa8-4b94-a97d-607a80ee413b","sourceInfo":{"bias":"leanRight","biasRatings":[{"reviewerId":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","politicalBias":"leanRight","referenceUrl":"https://mediabiasfactcheck.com/la-tercera-bias-and-credibility/","sourceInfoId":"01283f84-648d-4595-a09e-04fd499e5dae","reviewer":{"id":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","name":"Media Bias/Fact Check","icon":"https://b-cdn.ground.news/assets/external_source_reviewer_icons/mediaBiasFactCheck.png"}}],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/7cf62c256080dfbe7322f52ea1fd1d661d5821e9.jpg","id":"01283f84-648d-4595-a09e-04fd499e5dae","