,{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:21:18.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:10:24.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump has announced a three-day ceasefire in Russia's war against Ukraine, to last from May 9 to 11. The ceasefire includes an exchange of around 1,000 prisoners on each side.","originalDescription":"Americký prezident Donald Trump oznámil třídenní příměří ve válce Ruska proti Ukrajině. Trvat má od 9. do 11. května. Součástí příměří je výměna tisícovky zajatců na každé straně.","lang":"cs","paywall":"no","refId":"25864cb6-3c12-4f3e-ac03-b03d98807f9b","sortData":{"locality":{"index":293,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":43,"labelData":"leanLeft"},"date":{"index":49,"labelData":"2026-05-08T18:10:24.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire in Russia's War Against Ukraine","originalTitle":"Trump oznámil třídenní příměří ve válce Ruska proti Ukrajině","url":"https://www.novinky.cz/clanek/valka-na-ukrajine-trump-oznamil-tridenni-primeri-ve-valce-ruska-proti-ukrajine-40577299","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"leanLeft","biasRatings":[{"reviewerId":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","politicalBias":"leanLeft","referenceUrl":"https://mediabiasfactcheck.com/novinky-cz-pravo/","sourceInfoId":"bf6b4a27-118c-4290-b608-723eb540301c","reviewer":{"id":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","name":"Media Bias/Fact Check","icon":"https://b-cdn.ground.news/assets/external_source_reviewer_icons/mediaBiasFactCheck.png"}}],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/2b92996212c2f05938b7c05be3c743745b4b00ca.jpg","id":"bf6b4a27-118c-4290-b608-723eb540301c","interestId":"00752498-f1ae-4b26-a2df-8ccc43c85b6c","location":null,"name":"Novinky.cz","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":71710,"slug":"novinkycz","factuality":"high","owners":[{"id":1451,"category":"corporation","name":"Seznam.cz"}]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T21:27:17.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:41:00.000Z","descrip