Data":"2026-05-09T03:08:44.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Will the Ceasefire in the War in Ukraine Last Longer than Three Days? It's Possible, Says Trump","originalTitle":"Bude prímerie vo vojne na Ukrajine dlhšie ako tri dni? Možné to je, tvrdí Trump","url":"https://hnonline.sk/svet/96280093-bude-primerie-vo-vojne-na-ukrajine-dlhsie-ako-tri-dni-mozne-to-je-tvrdi-trump","wireStoryId":"98835fca-0291-4526-b4b1-6aa5a172815e","sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/b14f6302f77208f46fc5b48a5ab048b54b91996a.jpg","id":"37704cb7-ff2f-4803-8af7-d9898fdcde84","interestId":"4417adcf-4b8f-4357-ba04-c12db3cc9add","location":{"lat":48.318038,"lon":17.186683},"name":"Hospodárske Noviny","paywall":"no","place":[{"id":"BratislavaRegion,SK","name":"Bratislava Region","type":"administrative_area_level_1"},{"id":"SK","name":"Slovakia","type":"country"}],"placeId":"BratislavaRegion,SK","storyCount":71520,"slug":"hnonlinesk","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T08:21:43.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:07:56.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump has announced a three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia. The ceasefire applies to May 9, 10, and 11, according to Trump on Truth Social. He states that Russia and Ukraine have agreed.","originalDescription":"De Amerikaanse president Donald Trump heeft aangekondigd dat er een driedaags bestand komt tussen Oekraïne en Rusland. Het staakt-het-vuren geldt op 9, 10 en 11 mei, aldus Trump op Truth Social. Hij stelt dat Rusland en Oekraïne hebben ingestemd.","lang":"nl","paywall":"no","refId":"9eeca61b-6381-4378-b559-16a2ce314397","sortData":{"locality":{"index":149,"labelData":"international","flag":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/flags/120_120/NL.png"},"bias":{"index":344,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":43,"labelData":"2026-05-08T18:07:56.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire Between Ukraine and Russ