łosił w piątek trzydniowe zawieszenie broni między Rosją i Ukrainą w dniach 9-11 maja w związku z rocznicą zakończenia II wojny światowej. Zapowiedział, że rozejm obejmie też wymianę łącznie 2 tys. więźniów.","lang":"pl","paywall":"no","refId":"22de0469-7276-4a3a-a736-a62114841248","sortData":{"locality":{"index":193,"labelData":"international","flag":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/flags/120_120/PL.png"},"bias":{"index":345,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":252,"labelData":"2026-05-08T18:48:08.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"Trump ogłasza trzydniowy rozejm między Rosją i Ukrainą","url":"https://wpolityce.pl/swiat/759864-trump-oglasza-trzydniowy-rozejm-miedzy-rosja-i-ukraina","wireStoryId":"1880b7b5-2a13-4927-90aa-5606f6332f6b","sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/ac7034b34dc9b3cf670fba48e7b31383ec3c588d.jpg","id":"7652d821-356f-46c2-8cd0-5728624e3808","interestId":"8e88052b-57d4-4fd7-8de9-b276b3154c6f","location":{"lat":52.224645,"lon":21.044247},"name":"wpolityce.pl","paywall":"no","place":[{"id":"Warszawa,MasovianVoivodeship,PL","name":"Warszawa","type":"administrative_area_level_2"},{"id":"MasovianVoivodeship,PL","name":"Masovian Voivodeship","type":"administrative_area_level_1"},{"id":"PL","name":"Poland","type":"country"}],"placeId":"Warszawa,MasovianVoivodeship,PL","storyCount":70952,"slug":"wpolitycepl","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:44:15.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:23:00.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump announced a three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine on his Truth Social media account today. He wrote that it will be in effect from Saturday to Monday. It is also expected to include an exchange of 1,000 prisoners between the two sides.","originalDescription":"Ameriški predsednik Donald Trump je danes na svojem družbenem omrežju Truth Social naznanil tridnevno prekinitev ognja med Rusijo in Ukrajino. Kot je zapisal, bo ta veljala od sobote do ponedeljka. Vključevala naj bi tudi izmenjavo po tisoč ujetnikov med stranema.","lang":"sl","paywall":"no","refId":"cee557f1-67f2-4c44-adde-c5dc9bfe451f","sortData":{"locality":{"index":200,"labelData":"international","flag":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/flags/120_120/SI.png"},"bias":{"index":346,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":113,"labelData":"2026-05-08T18:23:00.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Donald Trump Declares Ceasefire in Ukraine","originalTitle":"Donald Trump razglasil premirje v Ukrajini","url":"https://siol.net/novice/svet/donald-trump-razglasil-tridnevno-premirje-med-rusijo-in-ukrajino-putin-in-zelenski-se-strinjata-691068","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/[4a1]/39e8aad01bd46166a044706b5d40b97c4f0c43b7.jpg","id":"87f8ebec-6127-4f6f-b041-dd00bb653680","interestId":"4a1ba54d-a498-41c5-8d63-ae4d175b3a7f","location":{"lat":46.065152,"lon":14.496569},"name":"siol.net","paywall":"no","place":[{"id":"Ljubljana,Ljubljana,SI","name":"Ljubljana","type":"locality"},{"id":"SI","name":"Slovenia","type":"country"}],"placeId":"Ljubljana,Ljubljana,SI","storyCount":70853,"slug":"siolnet","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T10:59:05.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T14:48:52.000Z","description":"President Donald Trump announced a three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine beginning Saturday, hinting at the possibility of the “beginning of the end of a very long, deadly, and hard fought War.”“I am pleased to announce that there will be a THREE DAY CEASEFIRE (May 9th, 10th, and 11th) in the War between Russia and Ukraine,” Trump posted Friday on Truth Social, adding that the ceasefire would mark the anniversary of Victory Day in World…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"4b411066-f3a2-4fdb-b257-667e888e9fb6","sort