ace":[{"id":"LuxembourgCity,Luxembourg,LuxembourgDistrict,LU","name":"Luxembourg City","type":"locality"},{"id":"LU","name":"Luxembourg","type":"country"},{"id":"LU","name":"Luxembourg","type":"country"}],"placeId":"LuxembourgCity,Luxembourg,LuxembourgDistrict,LU","storyCount":62316,"slug":"rtllu","factuality":"unknown","owners":[{"id":782,"category":"independent","name":"Bertelsmann Stiftung"}]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:44:06.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:45:00.000Z","description":"In the Ukraine war, there has been no significant progress. Now, among other things, the US President announces a temporary ceasefire.","originalDescription":"Im Ukraine-Krieg gab es zuletzt keine merklichen Fortschritte. Nun verkündet der US-Präsident unter anderem eine temporäre Waffenruhe.","lang":"de","paywall":"no","refId":"beb568ee-a776-4af6-af07-2d5d2a3db90e","sortData":{"locality":{"index":166,"labelData":"international","flag":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/flags/120_120/LU.png"},"bias":{"index":353,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":240,"labelData":"2026-05-08T18:45:00.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three Day Ceasefire in the Ukraine War","originalTitle":"Trump verkündet dreitägige Waffenruhe im Ukraine-Krieg","url":"https://www.wort.lu/international/trump-verkuendet-dreitaegige-waffenruhe-im-ukraine-krieg/151279755.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/8f7032058e8ec85e29f6e33bc030f91e07c7651a.jpg","id":"dace5a8e-2998-4d06-8a59-827f36ffa159","interestId":"9f5ab82b-d9b8-4516-ab3a-28c3c43e9576","location":{"lat":49.611717,"lon":6.131911},"name":"Wort.lu","paywall":"no","place":[{"id":"LuxembourgCity,Luxembourg,LuxembourgDistrict,LU","name":"Luxembourg City","type":"locality"},{"id":"LU","name":"Luxembourg","type":"country"},{"id":"LU","name":"Luxembourg","type":"country"}],"placeId":"LuxembourgCity,Luxembourg,LuxembourgDistrict,LU","storyCount":61999,"slug":"wortlu","factuality":"unknown","owners":[{"id":732,"category":"independent","name":"Saint-Paul Luxembourg"}]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:40:03.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:18:32.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump announces on social media a three-day ceasefire in the war between Russia and Ukraine. The ceasefire will be valid from 9 to 11 May. 1000 prisoners will be exchanged.","originalDescription":"US-Präsident Donald Trump kündigt in den sozialen Medien eine dreitägige Feuerpause im Krieg zwischen Russland und der Ukraine an. Die Waffenruhe soll vom 9. bis zum 11. Mai gelten. 1000 Gefangene sollen unterdessen ausgetauscht werden.","lang":"de","paywall":"yes","refId":"da82be9d-ab3e-4e5a-ba46-190f8907d28e","sortData":{"locality":{"index":160,"labelData":"international","flag":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/flags/120_120/DE.png"},"bias":{"index":240,"labelData":"leanRight"},"date":{"index":94,"labelData":"2026-05-08T18:18:32.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Suspension of All Fighting: Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire Between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":"Aussetzung aller Kampfhandlungen: Trump verkündet dreitägige Waffenruhe zwischen Ukraine und Russland","url":"https://www.welt.de/politik/ausland/article69fe28bd7e3ff373d429eba0/aussetzung-aller-kampfhandlungen-trump-verkuendet-dreitaegige-waffenruhe-zwischen-ukraine-und-russland.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"leanRight","biasRatings":[{"reviewerId":"0b06b55d-d3d4-4653-b4db-b22c77d812f7","politicalBias":"center","referenceUrl":"https://www.adfontesmedia.com/","sourceInfoId":"89298492-e7a8-4962-b3b2-dc2ad58b94d1","reviewer":{"id":"0b06b55d-d3d4-4653-b4db-b22c77d812f7","name":"Ad Fontes Media","icon":"https://b-cdn.ground.news/assets/external_source_reviewer_icons/adFontes.png"}},{"reviewerId":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","politicalBias":"leanRight","referenceUrl":"https://mediabiasfactcheck.com/die-welt/","sourceInfoId":"89298492-e7a8-4962-b3b2-dc2ad58b94d1","reviewer":{"id":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","name":"Media Bias/Fact Check","icon":"https://b-cdn.ground.news/assets/external_source_reviewer_icons/mediaBiasFactCheck.png"}}],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/00c8dbd46517481502aa5a5595822a86e2803f06.jpg","id":"89298492-e7a8-4962-b3b2-dc2ad58b94d1","interestId":"2c2892e7-f5af-440c-a1b5-cae7729a3faf","location":{"lat":51.513957,"lon":7.462998},"name":"Welt","paywall":"yes","place":[{"id":"DO,Arnsberg,NRW,DE","name":"Dortmund","type":"locality"},{"id":"Arnsberg,NRW,DE","name":"Arnsberg","type":"locality"},{"id":"NRW,DE","name":"North Rhine-Westphalia","type":"administrative_area_level_1"},{"id":"DE","name":"Germany","type":"country"}],"placeId":"DO,Arnsberg,NRW,DE","storyCount":61682,"slug":"welt","factuality":"veryHigh","owners":[{"id":32,"category":"privateEquity","name":"KKR"}]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:39:19.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:18:00.000Z","description":"At the request of US President Donald Trump, a ceasefire will be in effect in the war between Russia and Ukraine from May 9 to 11, the White House chief announced on the Truht Social social network on Friday. The ceasefire is also expected to include a suspension of \"all kinetic activity\" and an exchange of 1,000 prisoners, TASR writes.","originalDescription":"Na žiadosť amerického prezidenta Donalda Trumpa bude vo vojne medzi Ruskom a Ukrajinou v dňoch 9. až 11. mája platiť prímerie, oznámil šéf Bieleho domu v piatok na sociálnej sieti Truht Social. Prímerie má tiež zahŕňať pozastavenie „všetkej kinetickej aktivity“ a výmenu po 1000 zajatcov, píše TASR.","lang":"sk","paywall":"no","refId":"79659ca4-90dc-48b5-a6e8-f150d4b2749c","sortData":{"locality":{"index":199,"labelData":"international","flag":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/flags/120_120/SK.png"},"bias":{"index":354,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":89,"labelData":"2026-05-08T18:18:00.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Donald Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"Donald Trump oznámil trojdňové prímerie medzi Ruskom a Ukrajinou","url":"https://www.aktuality.sk/clanok/lts1TgP/donald-trump-oznamil-trojdnove-primerie-medzi-ruskom-a-ukrajinou/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/68b7b6e71cc178f1745763cf7f083d0cb89f2ff8.jpg","id":"0f22cff8-9278-4deb-b901-7838f2e0a559","interestId":"e98a014e-112d-46e6-a83d-a32186f7f58f","location":{"lat":48.319814,"lon":17.197554},"name":"Aktuality.sk","paywall":"no","place":[{"id":"BratislavaRegion,SK","name":"Bratislava Region","type":"administrative_area_level_1"},{"id":"SK","name":"Slovakia","type":"country"}],"placeId":"BratislavaRegion,SK","storyCount":61394,"slug":"aktualitysk","factuality":"unknown","owners":[{"id":147,"category":"mediaConglomerate","name":"Ringier"}]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:28:31.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:07:00.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump has announced a three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia. The ceasefire applies to May 9, 10, and 11, Trump wrote on Truth Social. He states that Russia and Ukraine have agreed.","originalDescription":"De Amerikaanse president Donald Trump heeft aangekondigd dat er een driedaags bestand komt tussen Oekraïne en Rusland. Het staakt-het-vuren geldt op 9, 10 en 11 mei, zo schreef Trump op Truth Social. Hij stelt dat Rusland en Oekraïne hebben ingestemd.","lang":"nl","paywall":"no","refId":"665caa42-155d-4eef-80ef-55eb41726979","sortData":{"locality":{"index":139,"labelData":"international","flag":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/flags/120_120/NL.png"},"bias":{"index":132,"labelData":"center"},"date":{"index":37,"labelData":"2026-05-08T18:07:00.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Three-Day Ceasefire Between Ukraine and Russia: ‘Hopefully the Beginning of the End of a Long War’","originalTitle":"Staakt-het-vuren van drie dagen tussen Oekraïne en Rusland: ‘Hopelijk begin van het einde van een lange oorlog’","url":"https://www.ad.nl/buitenland/staakt-het-vuren-van-drie-dagen-tussen-oekraine-en-rusland-hopelijk-begin-van-het-einde-van-een-lange-oorlog~ae4b70cf/","wireStoryId":"5bc49b27-5fae-457e-8a04-d242f58c8315","sourceInfo":{"bias":"center","biasRatings":[{"reviewerId":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","politicalBias":"center","referenceUrl":"https://mediabiasfactcheck.com/algemeen-dagblad/","sourceInfoId":"db6113b0-39a6-4fdb-a9de-a2e9427b1104","reviewer":{"id":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","name":"Media Bias/Fact Check","icon":"https://b-cdn.ground.news/assets/external_source_reviewer_icons/mediaBiasFactCheck.png"}}],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/a1ee8bb10ca8e6cc219b5b1e3555e80d9d9ad88f.jpg","id":"db6113b0-39a6-4fdb-a9de-a2e9427b1104","interestId":"ff8f63f2-9d2c-44b3-aa3d-8944ae98e5b9","location":{"lat":52.155697,"lon":5.39503},"name":"Algemeen Dagblad","paywall":"no","place":[{"id":"Amersfoort,UT,NL","name":"Amersfoort","type":"locality"},{"id":"UT,NL","name":"Utrecht","type":"administrative_area_level_1"},{"id":"NL","name":"Netherlands","type":"country"},{"id":"NL","name":"Netherlands","type":"country"}],"placeId":"Amersfoort,UT,NL","storyCount":61348,"slug":"algemeen-dagblad","factuality":"high","owners":[{"id":989,"category":"mediaConglomerate","name":"DPG Media"}]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:44:47.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:17:47.000Z","description":"Trump: Three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia","originalDescription":"Trump: Dreitägige Waffenruhe zwischen Ukraine und Russland","lang":"de","paywall":"no","refId":"6bd999a7-01a4-4eb1-bcfb-90e7df8dd4af","sortData":{"locality":{"index":183,"labelData":"international","flag":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/flags/120_120/CH.png"},"bias":{"index":355,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":86,"labelData":"2026-05-08T18:17:47.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump: Three-Day Ceasefire Between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":"Trump: Dreitägige Waffenruhe zwischen Ukraine und Russland","url":"https://www.watson.ch/international/usa/840964490-trump-dreitaegige-waffenruhe-zwischen-ukraine-und-russland","wireStoryId":"6d763828-20be-4ff7-be2d-ee08b01358da","sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/eb48ac6550e150adf641a66d0071374bc41c445a.jpg","id":"c23b1a3d-c980-4e9c-9fa8-1bf164853686","interestId":"12f937ce-70ce-4c25-a791-7e41b263a95a","location":{"lat":47.371189,"lon":8.533821},"name":"watson.ch/","paywall":"no","place":[{"id":"Zürich,ZürichDistrict,ZH,CH","name":"Zürich","type":"locality"},{"id":"ZürichDistrict,ZH,CH","name":"Zürich District","type":"administrative_area_level_2"},{"id":"ZH,CH","name":"Zurich","type":"administrative_area_level_1"},{"id":"CH","name":"Switzerland","type":"country"}],"placeId":"Zürich,ZürichDistrict,ZH,CH","storyCount":61273,"slug":"watsonch","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T10:25:38.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:55:18.000Z","description":"WASHINGTON (AP) — President Donald Trump said Friday that the leaders of Russia and Ukraine have agreed to his request for a three-day ceasefire and an exchange of prisoners, adding that such a halt to hostilities could be the “beginning of the end” of the long war between them. Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy and Kremlin foreign affairs adviser Yuri Ushakov both confirmed the agreement. Trump announced on social media that the ceasefire…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"b52cbadc-6271-4696-893b-b0bcff06af6b","sortData":{"locality":{"index":46,"labelData":"national","flag":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/flags/120_120/US.png"},"bias":{"index":47,"labelData":"leanLeft"},"date":{"index":366,"labelData":"2026-05-08T19:55:18.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Leaders agree to 3-day ceasefire in Russia-Ukraine war","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.wishtv.com/news/international/trump-announces-3-day-ceasefire-in-russia-ukraine-war/","wireStoryId":"72434a09-f786-417c-a537-a31c4217cb53","sourceInfo":{"bias":"leanLeft","biasRatings":[{"reviewerId":"0f4ebea7-7b39-4b2a-8098-2d54b88e6508","politicalBias":"center","referenceUrl":"https://www.allsides.com/news-source/wish-tv-media-bias","sourceInfoId":"73f8dc40-ce7d-4ed7-b396-dc29b6724a87","reviewer":{"id":"0f4ebea7-7b39-4b2a-8098-2d54b88e6508","name":"AllSides","icon":"https://b-cdn.ground.news/assets/external_source_reviewer_icons/allSides.png"}},{"reviewerId":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","politicalBias":"leanLeft","referenceUrl":"https://mediabiasfactcheck.com/wish-tv/","sourceInfoId":"73f8dc40-ce7d-4ed7-b396-dc29b6724a87","reviewer":{"id":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","name":"Media Bias/Fact Check","icon":"https://b-cdn.ground.news/assets/external_source_reviewer_icons/mediaBiasFactCheck.png"}}],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/e069138a1e2ccf8cd2e04affda1a1d4220f5ee9e.jpg","id":"73f8dc40-ce7d-4ed7-b396-dc29b6724a87","interestId":"f469fa26-2c25-41eb-b656-6bad1fd6eec8","location":{"lat":39.779174,"lon":-86.17984},"name":"WISH-TV","paywall":"no","place":[{"id":"Indianapolis,MarionCounty,IN,US","name":"Indianapolis","type":"locality"},{"id":"MarionCounty,IN,US","name":"Marion County","type":"administrative_area_level_2"},{"id":"IN,US","name":"Indiana","type":"administrative_area_level_1"},{"id":"US","name":"United States","type":"country"}],"placeId":"Indianapolis,MarionCounty,IN,US","storyCount":61107,"slug":"wish-tv","factuality":"high","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T08:35:07.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T10:17:12.000Z","description":"Donald Trump announced on Friday a three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia from Saturday, saying he hopes that this truce will mark the \"start of the end\" of the conflict.","originalDescription":"Donald Trump a annoncé vendredi un cessez-le-feu de trois jours entre l’Ukraine et la Russie à partir de samedi, disant espérer que cette trêve signe le « début de la fin » du conflit.","lang":"fr","paywall":"no","refId":"99f6b4bb-63ce-4def-8437-c53bf2a19ba7","sortData":{"locality":{"index":100,"labelData":"international","flag":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/flags/120_120/CA.png"},"bias":{"index":48,"labelData":"leanLeft"},"date":{"index":3,"labelData":"2026-05-08T10:17:12.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"War in Ukraine: Trump Announces a Three-Day Ceasefire","originalTitle":"Guerre en Ukraine | Trump annonce un cessez-le-feu de trois jours","url":"https://www.lapresse.ca/international/europe/2026-05-08/guerre-en-ukraine/trump-annonce-un-cessez-le-feu-de-trois-jours.php","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"leanLeft","biasRatings":[{"reviewerId":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","politicalBias":"leanLeft","referenceUrl":"https://mediabiasfactcheck.com/la-presse/","sourceInfoId":"431981a8-d90b-4213-922a-0720c6924453","reviewer":{"id":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","name":"Media Bias/Fact Check","icon":"https://b-cdn.ground.news/assets/external_source_reviewer_icons/mediaBiasFactCheck.png"}}],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/169be23c556676638839b71dc6fa1745877c7309.jpg","id":"431981a8-d90b-4213-922a-0720c6924453","interestId":"78cfe722-0c6a-4d33-b315-ccd5a9d964e1","location":{"lat":45.523856,"lon":-73.591469},"name":"La Presse","paywall":"no","place":[{"id":"Montreal,QC,CA","name":"Montreal","type":"locality"},{"id":"QC,CA","name":"Quebec","type":"administrative_area_level_1"},{"id":"CA","name":"Canada","type":"country"},{"id":"CA","name":"Canada","type":"country"}],"placeId":"Montreal,QC,CA","storyCount":60045,"slug":"la-presse_39d7a8","factuality":"high","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:10:22.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:18:12.000Z","description":"There will be a temporary ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine from Saturday through Monday, Donald Trump announced on Friday. Acco