d-4e453c212e22","sourceInfo":{"bias":"center","biasRatings":[{"reviewerId":"0f4ebea7-7b39-4b2a-8098-2d54b88e6508","politicalBias":"center","referenceUrl":"https://www.allsides.com/news-source/omaha-world-herald-media-bias","sourceInfoId":"f5f3dae2-10e1-47d5-834b-80fdd29a227d","reviewer":{"id":"0f4ebea7-7b39-4b2a-8098-2d54b88e6508","name":"AllSides","icon":"https://b-cdn.ground.news/assets/external_source_reviewer_icons/allSides.png"}},{"reviewerId":"0b06b55d-d3d4-4653-b4db-b22c77d812f7","politicalBias":"center","referenceUrl":"https://www.adfontesmedia.com/omaha-world-herald-bias-and-reliability/","sourceInfoId":"f5f3dae2-10e1-47d5-834b-80fdd29a227d","reviewer":{"id":"0b06b55d-d3d4-4653-b4db-b22c77d812f7","name":"Ad Fontes Media","icon":"https://b-cdn.ground.news/assets/external_source_reviewer_icons/adFontes.png"}},{"reviewerId":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","politicalBias":"leanRight","referenceUrl":"https://mediabiasfactcheck.com/omaha-world-herald/","sourceInfoId":"f5f3dae2-10e1-47d5-834b-80fdd29a227d","reviewer":{"id":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","name":"Media Bias/Fact Check","icon":"https://b-cdn.ground.news/assets/external_source_reviewer_icons/mediaBiasFactCheck.png"}}],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/b27d6c871f08d2f53607c70f3185880a9b64d1d8.jpg","id":"f5f3dae2-10e1-47d5-834b-80fdd29a227d","interestId":"77f94e90-50b3-44e6-9079-8981516f08df","location":{"lat":41.254296,"lon":-95.937758},"name":"Omaha World-Herald","paywall":"yes","place":[{"id":"Omaha,DouglasCounty,NE,US","name":"Omaha","type":"locality"},{"id":"DouglasCounty,NE,US","name":"Douglas County","type":"administrative_area_level_2"},{"id":"NE,US","name":"Nebraska","type":"administrative_area_level_1"},{"id":"US","name":"United States","type":"country"}],"placeId":"Omaha,DouglasCounty,NE,US","storyCount":57114,"slug":"omaha-world-herald","factuality":"veryHigh","owners":[{"id":65,"category":"mediaConglomerate","name":"Lee Enterprises"}]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T00:19:48.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T15:41:02.000Z","description":"“This request was made directly by me, and I greatly appreciate your acceptance by President Vladimir Putin and President Volodymyr Zelenskyy. I hope it will be the beginning of the end of a very long, bloody and harshly waged war,” said the American.","originalDescription":"“Esta solicitud fue presentada directamente por mí, y agradezco enormemente su aceptación por parte del presidente Vladimir Putin y el presidente Volodymyr Zelenskyy. Espero que sea el principio del fin de una guerra muy larga, sangrienta y duramente librada\", aseguró el estadunidense.","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"85d35855-66e5-443c-b8eb-bcc2722f15b9","sortData":{"locality":{"index":102,"labelData":"international","flag":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/flags/120_120/MX.png"},"bias":{"index":357,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":27,"labelData":"2026-05-08T15:41:02.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces \"A Ceasefire\" Between Russia and Ukraine May 9-11","originalTitle":"Trump anuncia \"un alto el fuego\" entre Rusia y Ucrania del 9 al 11 de mayo","url":"https://www.proceso.com.mx/internacional/2026/5/8/trump-anuncia-un-alto-el-fuego-entre-rusia-ucrania-del-al-11-de-mayo-373698.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/035d0ce5cf5eef19c4a59a1d830274e7d67cda02.jpg","id":"21cc8616-d4a5-4b8c-a5c1-c2e5894fda90","interestId":"97f91dae-7972-49ed-98c9-f5c21308808c","location":{"lat":23.588593,"lon":-104.80547},"name":"Proceso","paywall":"no","place":[{"id":"MX","name":"Mexico","type":"country"}],"placeId":"MX","storyCount":56564,"slug":"proceso","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T23:28:57.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:59:48.000Z","description":"U.S. President Donald Trump said Friday that the presidents of Russia and Ukraine accepted his request for a three-day ceasefire and an exchange of prisoners, adding that such a pause in hostilities could be the “beginning of the end” of the long war between the two.","originalDescription":"El mandatario estadounidense Donald Trump afirmó el viernes que los presidentes de Rusia y Ucrania aceptaron su solicitud de un alto el fuego de tres días y un intercambio de prisioneros, y añadió que una pausa así en las hostilidades podría ser el “comienzo del fin” de la larga guerra entre ambos.","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"16622077-30b1-4386-8f9a-7e38119fdce9","sortData":{"locality":{"index":296,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":442,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":370,"labelData":"2026-05-08T19:59:48.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Says Russia and Ukraine Accepted His Request for a Three-Day Truce and Exchange of Prisoners","originalTitle":"Trump dice que Rusia y Ucrania aceptaron su pedido de tregua de 3 días y canje de presos","url":"https://www.independentespanol.com/noticias/mundo/europa/trump-dice-que-rusia-y-ucrania-aceptaron-su-pedido-de-tregua-de-3-dias-y-canje-de-presos-b2973339.html","wireStoryId":"d4c1dc9f-f76f-4732-ba69-82034fc8cbe9","sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/letterIcons/square/AA00FF/I.png","id":"db924019-b667-46df-8f50-d399b58bc523","interestId":"fc9592a5-b0c2-43da-bb7b-d7ba22b85b75","location":null,"name":"Independent Español","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":56546,"slug":"independent-espanol","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T08:59:01.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T04:41:00.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump said he did not rule out extending the ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia after May 11 and called for a halt to the war. What you know, read TSN.ua (news 1+1).","originalDescription":"Президент США Дональд Трамп заявив, що не виключає продовження перемир’я між Україною та Росією після 11 травня та закликав зупинити війну. Що відомо читайте ᐅTSN.ua(новини 1+1).","lang":"uk","paywall":"no","refId":"e4276263-53fd-4c58-b9c7-bdfa4368d032","sortData":{"locality":{"index":297,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":358,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":480,"labelData":"2026-05-09T04:41:00.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Truce Between Ukraine and Russia: Trump Suggests that the Ceasefire Will Be Extended","originalTitle":"Перемир’я між Україною та РФ: Трамп припустив, що припинення вогню буде подовжене","url":"https://tsn.ua/politika/tramp-dopustyv-prodovzennia-peremyria-miz-ukrayinoiu-ta-rf-pislia-11-travnia-3079568.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/9b7ee6f293bbdc5e633c757a16dd31227439dc16.jpg","id":"d726e5dd-bfb6-4f8a-9d44-2b783e93873a","interestId":"b8ced249-a7f8-4108-9385-f31193d7e583","location":null,"name":"ТСН.ua","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":55532,"slug":"ua_c47d36","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:33:29.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T15:30:00.000Z","description":"ZeroHedge - On a long enough timeline, the survival rate for everyone drops to zero","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"6098cd98-c78c-4f9b-94f8-7c932cb66ddf","sortData":{"locality":{"index":48,"labelData":"national","flag":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/flags/120_120/US.png"},"bias":{"index":292,"labelData":"right"},"date":{"index":26,"labelData":"2026-05-08T15:30:00.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Gets Diplomatic Win In Ukraine War, 3-Day Ceasefire Declared For Russia's V-Day","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.zerohedge.com/geopolitical/trump-gets-diplomatic-win-ukraine-war-3-day-ceasefire-declared-russias-v-day","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"right","biasRatings":[{"reviewerId":"0f4ebea7-7b39-4b2a-8098-2d54b88e6508","politicalBias":"leanRight","referenceUrl":"https://www.allsides.com/news-source/