icker: Trump verkündet dreitägige Waffenruhe","url":"https://www.lvz.de/politik/ukraine-krieg-im-liveticker-trump-verkuendet-dreitaegige-waffenruhe-HE2HCGE6JQFTFWLUN43NO5POI4.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/b399d55e1e87f61663c55f9924f1f5bbbcdd3ca7.jpg","id":"c8a959a5-fd44-4dd0-af41-7bdddaec30b8","interestId":"55054e58-cfb4-4277-b02b-5e53cfa28755","location":{"lat":51.347114,"lon":12.353698},"name":"LVZ - Leipziger Volkszeitung","paywall":"no","place":[{"id":"Leipzig,SN,DE","name":"Leipzig","type":"locality"},{"id":"SN,DE","name":"Sachsen","type":"administrative_area_level_1"},{"id":"DE","name":"Germany","type":"country"}],"placeId":"Leipzig,SN,DE","storyCount":50900,"slug":"lvz-leipziger-volkszeitung","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:33:13.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:07:52.000Z","description":"The proposals that Ukraine and Russia made earlier this week for a temporary ceasefire failed. Now Trump is making an attempt with a proposal of his own.","originalDescription":"De voorstellen die Oekraïne en Rusland eerder deze week deden voor een tijdelijk staakt-het-vuren, zijn mislukt. Nu doet Trump een poging met een eigen voorstel.","lang":"nl","paywall":"no","refId":"cc11939f-1671-4331-9c2a-3f9dfac35851","sortData":{"locality":{"index":138,"labelData":"international","flag":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/flags/120_120/NL.png"},"bias":{"index":244,"labelData":"leanRight"},"date":{"index":291,"labelData":"2026-05-08T19:07:52.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"At Trump's Request, a Three-Day Ceasefire Between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":"Op Trumps verzoek driedaags bestand tussen Oekraïne en Rusland","url":"https://nos.nl/artikel/2613630-op-trumps-verzoek-driedaags-bestand-tussen-oekraine-en-rusland","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"leanRight","biasRatings":[{"reviewerId":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","poli