 short period of time when they will not kill people, that's very good,” the US president noted. Donald Trump also suggested that the ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia, announced on May 9-11, could be extended.","originalDescription":"Про це він сказав під час спілкування з журналістами, передає РБК-Україна. \"Це я попросив, і президент Путін погодився, Зеленський погодився, обидва без вагань. І у нас є невеликий проміжок часу, коли вони не вбиватимуть людей, це дуже добре\", - зазначив президент США.Дональд Трамп також припустив, що перемир’я між Україною та Росією, оголошене на 9-11 травня, може бути продовжене.","lang":"uk","paywall":"no","refId":"88fbf7dd-ace4-4f32-a9ff-8307b1297743","sortData":{"locality":{"index":311,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":452,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":496,"labelData":"2026-05-09T06:49:00.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Says He Has Initiated a Three-Day Ceasefire Between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":"Трамп заявив, що ініціював триденне припинення вогню між Україною та РФ","url":"https://espreso.tv/svit-tramp-zayaviv-shcho-same-vin-initsiyuvav-tridenne-pripinennya-vognyu-mizh-ukrainoyu-ta-rf","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/letterIcons/square/FFAB00/E.png","id":"d88b32de-779b-4849-bdfc-393622fc6233","interestId":"c5c7efd4-8f35-4bde-9865-9619037328c5","location":null,"name":"espreso.tv","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":42598,"slug":"espresotv","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:59:19.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:24:02.000Z","description":"WASHINGTON (AP) — Trump says Russia and Ukraine have agreed to his request for a 3-day ceasefire starting Saturday and a prisoner swap.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"e84c2d85-165f-4245-9198-21b31ae6f880","sortData":{"locality":{"index":55,"labelData":"national","flag":"https://grou