ame":"Enid News & Eagle","paywall":"yes","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":40664,"slug":"enidnewscom","factuality":"high","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T07:34:43.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T21:46:00.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump announced a three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine on Friday to mark Victory Day over Nazi Germany. According to the president, the ceasefire will include a suspension of all military activity and a prisoner exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each country. \nRussia had already announced a unilateral ceasefire on Tuesday, in time for the Victory Day parade that will be marked on a very limited scale tomorrow due to …","originalDescription":"נשיא ארצות הברית דונלד טראמפ הכריז היום (שישי) על הפסקת אש בת שלושה ימים בין רוסיה לאוקראינה, וזאת לרגל ציון יום הניצחון על גרמניה הנאצית. לדברי הנשיא, הפסקת האש תכלול השעיה של כל הפעילות הצבאית וחילופי שבויים של 1,000 אסירים מכל מדינה. \nרוסיה כבר הודיעה על הפסקת אש חד-צדדית שלשום, לרגל מצעד יום הניצחון שיצויין מחר באופן מצומצם מאוד בשל ההתקפות הרוסיות. מנגד, אוקראינה אתגרה את מוסקבה בתחילת השבוע כשהודיעה גם היא על הפסקת אש חד-צדדית משלה. \nלמרות…","lang":"he","paywall":"no","refId":"fec87677-2fa3-416d-be10-e99e15be2f8a","sortData":{"locality":{"index":314,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":366,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":423,"labelData":"2026-05-08T21:46:00.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"On the Occasion of Victory Day over Nazi Germany: 3-Day Ceasefire in the Ukrainian War","originalTitle":"לרגל יום הניצחון על גרמניה הנאצית: הפסקת אש בת 3 ימים במלחמת אוקראינה - וואלה חדשות","url":"https://news.walla.co.il/item/3836545","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/[cbe]/4cb3a4717de2b20bb35dd48abdc8f25f8ae1a956.jpg","id":"4aaf9f77-7a38-4b6d-b7ae-cf01c13addb3","interestId":"cbe30a53-7ebc-4b45-988f-a61c3a6479e9","location":null,"name":"וואלה!","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":40500,"slug":"_1b7846","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T22:45:07.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:20:00.000Z","description":"The ceasefire will last three days. However, the American president announced that talks are underway to end the conflict. \"Every day we are getting closer to a resolution,\" he argued.","originalDescription":"Zawieszenie broni będzie trwało trzy dni. Amerykański prezydent zapowiedział jednak, że prowadzone są rozmowy na temat zakończenia konfliktu. \"Z każdym dniem jesteśmy coraz bliżej rozwiązania\" - przekonywał.","lang":"pl","paywall":"no","refId":"5de1585d-fb88-493f-ba21-a87f039ffb31","sortData":{"locality":{"index":191,"labelData":"international","flag":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/flags/120_120/PL.png"},"bias":{"index":367,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":98,"labelData":"2026-05-08T18:20:00.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Declares Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine. \"I Hope This Is the Beginning of the End\"","originalTitle":"Trump ogłasza rozejm między Rosją i Ukrainą. \"Mam nadzieję, że to początek końca\"","url":"https://wiadomosci.gazeta.pl/polityka/7,198013,32779407,trump-oglasza-rozejm-miedzy-rosja-i-ukraina-mam-nadzieje.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/43c14a761821a730b296e28550d0ddd1a979a467.jpg","id":"bf0b35a5-0440-4916-b666-f66c4e6520d7","interestId":"a7b77236-5bf1-4935-a3b1-89da8b709768","location":{"lat":51.892485,"lon":19.234445},"name":"Gazeta","paywall":"no","place":[{"id":"PL","name":"Poland","type":"country"}],"placeId":"PL","storyCount":39525,"slug":"gazeta","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T21:56:41.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:05:49.000Z","description":"\"I am pleased to announce that there will be a three-day ceasefire (May 9, 10 and 11) in the war between Russia and Ukraine,\" Donald Trump unexpectedly announced on his social media page. According to the American president, May 9 is very important for the Russians, who are celebrating Victory Day, and for Ukraine no less, since \"they also played a significant role in World War II.\" According to Trump, not only will there be no military operatio…","originalDescription":"„Örömmel jelentem be, hogy háromnapos tűzszünet lesz (május 9-én, 10-én és 11-én) az Oroszország és Ukrajna közötti háborúban” – közölte váratlanul Donald Trump a közösségi oldalán. Az amerikai elnök szerint május 9-e nagyon fontos az oroszok számára, akik a győzelem napját ünneplik, és Ukrajna számára nemkülönben, hiszen „ők is jelentős szerepet játszottak a második világháborúban”.Trump szerint nemcsak katonai műveletek nem lesznek ebben az id…","lang":"hu","paywall":"no","refId":"3a1c0635-cb45-4040-980e-8ed3a34ca6c6","sortData":{"locality":{"index":205,"labelData":"international","flag":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/flags/120_120/HU.png"},"bias":{"index":58,"labelData":"leanLeft"},"date":{"index":289,"labelData":"2026-05-08T19:05:49.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Donald Trump Says There Will Be a Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine Between May 9 and 11","originalTitle":"Donald Trump szerint igenis lesz orosz–ukrán tűzszünet, mégpedig május 9. és 11. között","url":"https://444.hu/2026/05/08/donald-trump-szerint-igenis-lesz-oroszukran-tuzszunet-megpedig-majus-9-es-11-kozott","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"leanLeft","biasRatings":[{"reviewerId":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","politicalBias":"leanLeft","referenceUrl":"https://mediabiasfactcheck.com/444-hungary-bias-and-credibility/","sourceInfoId":"fda41d92-7265-4e3d-ab7d-f7cccd8ef0d7","reviewer":{"id":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","name":"Media Bias/Fact Check","icon":"https://b-cdn.ground.news/assets/external_source_reviewer_icons/mediaBiasFactCheck.png"}}],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/2d3d488f149d0b76e2245856b0b49ae452adc998.jpg