et, i tillegg til en fangebytte av 1000 fanger fra hve…","lang":"no","paywall":"no","refId":"f6b1fea1-aa54-45e1-b3d9-4f3179e43574","sortData":{"locality":{"index":315,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":368,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":72,"labelData":"2026-05-08T18:14:35.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump: Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"Trump: Tre dager våpenhvile mellom Russland og Ukraina","url":"https://www.nettavisen.no/nyheter/trump-kunngjores-tredagers-vapenhvile/s/5-95-3028156","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/80701fba71483f94b90f5c0bff8248d3dcdb36f6.jpg","id":"dc4108f8-a79a-4812-934c-27e3a784d7fd","interestId":"4397b46b-a03a-4e2e-9a74-41e13c1cbf5c","location":null,"name":"Nettavisen","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":39069,"slug":"nettavisen","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:37:15.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:10:49.000Z","description":"The armistice coincides with Victory Day in Russia, which marks the victory over Nazi Germany in World War II.","originalDescription":"Våbenhvile falder sammen med sejrsdagen i Rusland, hvor sejren over Nazityskland i Anden Verdenskrig markeres.","lang":"da","paywall":"no","refId":"f61e2e74-b193-40cb-9b04-c9c4bc461960","sortData":{"locality":{"index":162,"labelData":"international","flag":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/flags/120_120/DK.png"},"bias":{"index":249,"labelData":"leanRight"},"date":{"index":298,"labelData":"2026-05-08T19:10:49.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Ukraine and Russia Agree to Three-Day Ceasefire After Trump Proposal","originalTitle":"Ukraine og Rusland aftaler tre dages våbenhvile efter udspil fra Trump","url":"https://www.berlingske.dk/internationalt/ukraine-og-rusland-aftaler-tre-dages-vaabenhvile-efter-udspil-fra-trump","wireStoryId":"1284b29b-5d08-4ac2-ae7e-81aea2a8a510","sourceInfo":{"bi