 alto el fuego del 9 al 11 de mayo se publicó primero en Foco Informativo.","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"85bc227f-10aa-4497-9eed-26b6b09e52c1","sortData":{"locality":{"index":348,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":462,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":336,"labelData":"2026-05-08T19:27:54.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Says Putin and Zelenski Agree to Ceasefire May 9-11 - Information Focus","originalTitle":"Trump dice que Putin y Zelenski acuerdan un alto el fuego del 9 al 11 de mayo - Foco Informativo","url":"https://focoinformativo.site/trump-dice-que-putin-y-zelenski-acuerdan-un-alto-el-fuego-del-9-al-11-de-mayo/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/letterIcons/square/FFD600/F.png","id":"2279e014-639e-4ac2-bc76-851c5092fc5a","interestId":"abfadd2b-a501-4712-98fe-db7ef4eb302d","location":null,"name":"focoinformativo.site","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":26061,"slug":"focoinformativosite","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T21:05:11.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:32:46.000Z","description":"The US president said the ceasefire includes a suspension of all kinetic activity and the exchange of 1,000 prisoners by each country.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"6bb91602-8502-4f33-b16a-330280d5fcd2","sortData":{"locality":{"index":109,"labelData":"international","flag":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/flags/120_120/IE.png"},"bias":{"index":65,"labelData":"leanLeft"},"date":{"index":343,"labelData":"2026-05-08T19:32:46.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump says Russia and Ukraine have agreed to request for a three-day ceasefire","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.breakingnews.ie/world/trump-says-russia-and-ukraine-have-agreed-to-request-for-a-three-day-ceasefire-1897460.html","wireStoryId":"8d3b92bb-4324-4e15-b06e-49d9d7fa7664","sourceInfo":{"bias":"leanLeft","biasR