ate":{"index":502,"labelData":"2026-05-09T07:45:54.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Surprisely Announces Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine… \"Exchange of 1,000 Prisoners Each\"","originalTitle":"트럼프, 러시아-우크라이나 사흘 휴전 전격 발표… \"포로 1천명씩 교환\"","url":"https://v.daum.net/v/20260509062043641","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/25d729f729ed719888fa1e5ec24f24260c3e482c.jpg","id":"9c28f93c-548a-4908-96ab-4303d7001aae","interestId":"494215be-cd9d-4aa5-a11b-f1d52a53f127","location":{"lat":37.566694,"lon":126.978078},"name":"Daum","paywall":"no","place":[{"id":"Seoul,Seoul,KR","name":"Seoul","type":"locality"},{"id":"Seoul,KR","name":"Seoul","type":"administrative_area_level_1"},{"id":"KR","name":"South Korea","type":"country"}],"placeId":"Seoul,Seoul,KR","storyCount":25554,"slug":"daum","factuality":"unknown","owners":[{"id":496,"category":"billionaire","name":"Ma Huateng"},{"id":495,"category":"privateEquity","name":"Naspers"}]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T22:13:54.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T20:51:34.000Z","description":"President Donald Trump announced on 8 May 2026 that Russia and Ukraine had agreed to a three-day ceasefire running from 9 to 11 May, coinciding with Russia's Victory Day commemorations. Trump made the announcement via his Truth Social platform, calling it potentially the 'beginning of the end' of a conflict he described as 'the biggest since World War II.' Trump said the ceasefire would include 'a suspension of all kinetic activity, and also a p…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"5fd83d7f-2784-4d2f-95a7-ccbb1d7faf0e","sortData":{"locality":{"index":118,"labelData":"international","flag":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/flags/120_120/GB.png"},"bias":{"index":66,"labelData":"leanLeft"},"date":{"index":395,"labelData":"2026-05-08T20:51:34.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Calls Russia-Ukraine Ceasefire 'Beginning of the End' After Putin and Zelenskyy Accept His Three-Day Truce","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.ibtimes.co.uk/trump-announces-three-day-ceasefire-russia-ukraine-1795880","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"leanLeft","biasRatings":[{"reviewerId":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","politicalBias":"leanLeft","referenceUrl":"https://mediabiasfactcheck.com/international-business-times-uk-bias-and-credibility/","sourceInfoId":"c8e1d4ad-11b5-4de0-a3d0-98910b1ac2a3","reviewer":{"id":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","name":"Media Bias/Fact Check","icon":"https://b-cdn.ground.news/assets/external_source_reviewer_icons/mediaBiasFactCheck.png"}}],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/92e29c280325964ff0623428a1c2d41388f746cd.jpg","id":"c8e1d4ad-11b5-4de0-a3d0-98910b1ac2a3","interestId":"84097ecb-1449-4ae9-b4f7-389937c48b16","location":{"lat":52.739564,"lon":-1.996537},"name":"IBTimes UK","paywall":"no","place":[{"id":"GB","name":"United Kingdom","type":"country"}],"placeId":"GB","storyCount":25346,"slug":"ibtimes-uk","factuality":"high","owners":[{"id":427,"category":"mediaConglomerate","name":"IBT Media"}]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:26:06.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:26:54.000Z","description":"U.S. President Donald Trump said Friday that his counterparts from Russia and Ukraine, Vladimir Putin and Volodimir Zelenski, have agreed to a ceasefire between May 9 and 11, which includes suspending all attacks and an exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each country.","originalDescription":"El presidente de Estados Unidos, Donald Trump, aseguró este viernes que sus homólogos de Rusia y Ucrania, Vladímir Putin y Volodímir Zelenski, han acordado un alto el fuego entre el 9 y 11 de mayo que incluye suspender todo ataque y un intercambio de mil prisioneros de cada país.","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"bb147fca-cc69-4e9d-8cb5-813813e832cf","sortData":{"locality":{"index":350,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":463,"labelD