-feu entre l'Ukraine et la Russie, proposition américaine à l'Iran : Trump répond à LCI (In…","lang":"fr","paywall":"no","refId":"5be36cc5-14d4-4442-bc74-e386fde975c2","sortData":{"locality":{"index":351,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":161,"labelData":"center"},"date":{"index":530,"labelData":"2026-05-09T18:15:38.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Stop the Fire Between Ukraine and Russia, US Proposal to Iran: Trump Responds to LCI","originalTitle":"Cessez-le-feu entre l'Ukraine et la Russie, proposition américaine à l'Iran : Trump répond à LCI","url":"https://www.tf1info.fr/international/cessez-le-feu-entre-l-ukraine-et-la-russie-proposition-americaine-a-l-iran-trump-repond-a-lci-2440656.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"center","biasRatings":[{"reviewerId":"0b06b55d-d3d4-4653-b4db-b22c77d812f7","politicalBias":"center","referenceUrl":"https://www.adfontesmedia.com/","sourceInfoId":"98cf627a-aa74-434b-874e-414e8a8f0207","reviewer":{"id":"0b06b55d-d3d4-4653-b4db-b22c77d812f7","name":"Ad Fontes Media","icon":"https://b-cdn.ground.news/assets/external_source_reviewer_icons/adFontes.png"}}],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/9fcaf1cdd1c06327c545a210d8169cb782c542f9.jpg","id":"98cf627a-aa74-434b-874e-414e8a8f0207","interestId":"2bd6ca88-3133-4296-80d4-837b166073c7","location":null,"name":"TF1 INFO","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":24987,"slug":"tf1-info","factuality":"veryHigh","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T01:56:42.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T01:50:52.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump says Russia and Ukraine will pause fighting from Saturday through Monday. Both countries have agreed to his initiative, but the question is whether the ceasefire will hold.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"4a28004c-8e00-46cd-8d22-618c553148e8","sortData":{"locality":{"index":232,"labelData":"international","flag":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/flags/120_1