de prisonniers. La Russie organise ce 9 mai un défilé militaire pour commémorer la fin de la Seconde guerre mondiale.","lang":"fr","paywall":"no","refId":"7fdeb41f-a529-446f-8780-5eef6461bb14","sortData":{"locality":{"index":405,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":405,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":474,"labelData":"2026-05-09T03:55:20.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Stop Fire Between Ukraine and Russia After Donald Trump's Surprise Diplomatic Intervention","originalTitle":"Cessez-le-feu entre l’Ukraine et la Russie après “une intervention diplomatique surprise” de Donald Trump","url":"https://www.courrierinternational.com/article/treve-cessez-le-feu-entre-l-ukraine-et-la-russie-apres-une-intervention-diplomatique-surprise-de-donald-trump_243830","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/bbfb3cb9f522a8c03f0550b3beedb825b391a734.jpg","id":"58595788-6ee3-4222-bf10-587914747998","interestId":"fee7164b-10ac-496a-9083-ea4bee13b0b4","location":null,"name":"Courrier international","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":15448,"slug":"courrier-international","factuality":"unknown","owners":[{"id":1353,"category":"independent","name":"Le Monde"}]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T01:04:27.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:45:00.000Z","description":"The agreement also includes a massive exchange of prisoners.","originalDescription":"El acuerdo tambi�n incluir� un intercambio masivo de prisioneros.","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"2e28c7db-b94e-47cb-99e2-5d3ce521ceaf","sortData":{"locality":{"index":406,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":406,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":357,"labelData":"2026-05-08T19:45:00.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announced a Truce Between Russia and Ukraine: \"It May Be the Beginning of the End of the War\"","originalTitle":"Trump anunció una tregua entre Rusia y Ucrania: \"Puede ser el principio del fin de la guerra\"","url":"https://www.somosjujuy.com.ar/internacionales/trump-anuncio-una-tregua-rusia-ucrania-puede-ser-principio-fin-guerra-n117651","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/e188f8c26aa44b0373c8df47b48176ad48bc2386.jpg","id":"bdb0979f-486f-48a4-b259-00711f2e612a","interestId":"9f41667e-f23f-4ce4-8cd2-6c30577cc2e6","location":null,"name":"SOMOS JUJUY","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":15441,"slug":"somos-jujuy","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:55:17.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:50:52.000Z","description":"Donald Trump announces a surprising ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine. Moscow and Kiev have so far lacked confirmation.","originalDescription":"Donald Trump verkündet eine überraschende Waffenruhe zwischen Russland und der Ukraine. Aus Moskau und Kiew fehlt bislang eine Bestätigung.","lang":"de","paywall":"no","refId":"e3a9cca8-9493-433d-b45d-d1ae9e886e4f","sortData":{"locality":{"index":407,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":481,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":258,"labelData":"2026-05-08T18:50:52.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Ceasefire Between Ukraine & Russia – \"Applying Personally\"","originalTitle":"Trump verkündet Waffenruhe zwischen Ukraine & Russland – „Antrag persönlich gestellt“","url":"https://www.ikz-online.de/politik/article411945274/trump-verkuendet-dreitaegige-waffenruhe-zwischen-ukraine-und-russland.html","wireStoryId":"fb624334-eafa-4bcb-8587-535bc79bcdef","sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/letterIcons/square/00C853/I.png","id":"075a9249-1f0b-4dca-b194-497992b59919","interestId":"84dda391-c73d-4e3c-8d95-3986d8f53048","location":null,"name":"ikz-online.de","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":15296,"slug":"ikz-onlinede","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:25:41.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:31:29.000Z","description":"Shafaq News - Moscow/Kyiv: Russia and Ukraine announced on Friday their acceptance of US President Donald Trump's initiative for a ceasefire and prisoner exchange between the two sides. Russian presidential aide Yuri Ushakov told reporters that Russia had agreed to Trump's initiative for a truce from May 9 to 11 and a prisoner exchange with Kyiv on a \"one thousand for one thousand\" basis. Ushakov added, \"This initiative follows the recent conver…","originalDescription":"شفق نيوز- موسكو/ كييف أعلنت روسيا وأوكرانيا، يوم الجمعة، موافقتهما على مبادرة الرئيس الأميركي دونالد ترمب لوقف إطلاق النار وتبادل الأسرى بين الجانبين. وقال مساعد الرئيس الروسي، يوري أوشاكوف، للصحفيين، إن روسيا وافقت على مبادرة ترمب بشأن الهدنة من 9 إلى 11 أيار/ مايو الجاري وإجراء تبادل للأسرى مع كييف وفق صيغة \"ألف مقابل ألف\" وأضاف أوشاكوف: \"تأتي هذه المبادرة في أعقاب المحادثة الأخيرة بين بوتين وترمب، كانت الولايات المتحدة على اتصال مع كييف خلال …","lang":"ar","paywall":"no","refId":"bf6c397a-80d6-4103-bf41-9651a2466ffa","sortData":{"locality":{"index":239,"labelData":"international","flag":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/flags/120_120/IQ.png"},"bias":{"index":176,"labelData":"center"},"date":{"index":340,"labelData":"2026-05-08T19:31:29.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Russia and Ukraine Agree to Trump's Truce","originalTitle":"روسيا وأوكرانيا توافقان على هدنة ترمب","url":"https://shafaq.com/ar/%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%85%D9%86%D8%B7%D9%82%D8%A9-%D9%88%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B9%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%85/%D8%B1%D9%88%D8%B3%D9%8A%D8%A7-%D9%88-%D9%88%D9%83%D8%B1%D8%A7%D9%86%D9%8A%D8%A7-%D8%AA%D9%88%D8%A7%D9%81%D9%82%D8%A7%D9%86-%D8%B9%D9%84%D9%89-%D9%87%D8%AF%D9%86%D8%A9-%D8%AA%D8%B1%D9%85%D8%A8","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"center","biasRatings":[{"reviewerId":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","politicalBias":"center","referenceUrl":"https://mediabiasfactcheck.com/shafaq-news/","sourceInfoId":"c7fdef42-8955-482f-b249-1e03f0eb28e