r”","originalTitle":"Trump anunció un alto el fuego entre Rusia y Ucrania, sería «el comienzo del fin de la guerra»","url":"https://caraotadigital.net/eeuu/trump-anuncio-un-alto-el-fuego-entre-rusia-y-ucrania-seria-el-comienzo-del-fin-de-la-guerra/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/[44e]/cbf02872efacd0e9557f04cc3704f025864c6e17.jpg","id":"3d055b3d-29f8-4e53-b97f-1f7a9f7d4bab","interestId":"44eb1cb5-43bd-45de-a3b2-506cf590e4f8","location":null,"name":"Caraota Digital","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":15032,"slug":"caraota-digital","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T16:03:54.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T15:00:00.000Z","description":"U.S. President Donald Trump announced on Friday a three-day ceasefire in the Russia-Ukraine war, effective from May 9th to May 11th.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"cbd33867-896f-43c0-8096-1e78f9fef612","sortData":{"locality":{"index":409,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":408,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":524,"labelData":"2026-05-09T15:00:00.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Truce Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.jordannews.jo/Section-111/All/Trump-Announces-Three-Day-Truce-Between-Russia-and-Ukraine-51271","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/e28edef38cf07aba84401d6a763fb04c9e627fe9.jpg","id":"6ae8aca0-89f6-491a-bc81-fa867ea2df1b","interestId":"8abfac94-2291-4349-bd6e-2986c4eb1134","location":null,"name":"Jordan News | Latest News from Jordan, MENA","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":14905,"slug":"jordan-news-latest-news-from-jordan-mena","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:53:46.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:30:00.000Z","description":"","originalDes