-May.","originalDescription":"De son côté, Moscou avait déjà décrété en début de semaine une trêve unilatérale avant les commémorations en Russie du 9-Mai.","lang":"fr","paywall":"no","refId":"fe6b6a53-5287-45a3-80a5-261f2e54f39c","sortData":{"locality":{"index":413,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":482,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":233,"labelData":"2026-05-08T18:43:00.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"War in Ukraine. Trump Announces a Three-Day Ceasefire Between Kiev and Moscow From Saturday","originalTitle":"Guerre en Ukraine. Trump annonce un cessez-le-feu de trois jours entre Kiev et Moscou à partir de samedi","url":"https://www.republicain-lorrain.fr/defense-guerre-conflit/2026/05/08/trump-annonce-un-cessez-le-feu-de-trois-jours-entre-kiev-et-moscou-a-partir-de-samedi","wireStoryId":"fff9b2f6-b6cc-4db0-b4f9-4b6ab9efda2f","sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/letterIcons/square/FFD600/R.png","id":"f592b878-f16c-434d-9f62-722c74d780fa","interestId":"4e3ebd8a-f3e0-4e34-b27b-79de8bcfe44e","location":null,"name":"republicain-lorrain.fr","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":14394,"slug":"republicain-lorrainfr","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:07:01.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:33:02.000Z","description":"U.S. President Donald Trump announced a three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine on Friday, May 9-11, marking the anniversary of the end of World War II. He announced that the ceasefire would also include the exchange of a total of 2,000 prisoners. \"I am pleased to announce that there will be a THREE-DAY ARMISTATE in the war between Russia and Ukraine (May 9, 10, and 11). The article, \"Trump Declares a Three-Day Armistice Between Russia an…","originalDescription":"Prezydent USA Donald Trump ogłosił w piątek trzydniowe zawieszenie broni między Rosją i Ukrainą w dniach 9-11 maja w związku z rocznicą zakończenia II wojny światowej. Zapowiedział, że rozejm obejmie też wymianę łącznie 2 tys. więźniów. „Z przyjemnością ogłaszam, że w wojnie między Rosją a Ukrainą nastąpi TRZYDNIOWE ZAWIESZENIE BRONI (9, 10 i 11 maja). Artykuł Trump ogłosił trzydniowy rozejm między Rosją i Ukrainą w dniach 9-11 maja pochodzi z s…","lang":"pl","paywall":"no","refId":"d0647d4a-c38d-40e3-ba55-a6363eb1447c","sortData":{"locality":{"index":414,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":410,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":182,"labelData":"2026-05-08T18:33:02.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Declared a Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine From May 9-11","originalTitle":"Trump ogłosił trzydniowy rozejm między Rosją i Ukrainą w dniach 9-11 maja","url":"https://misyjne.pl/trump-oglosil-trzydniowy-rozejm-miedzy-rosja-i-ukraina-w-dniach-9-11-maja/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/efa0fd3552a0103402f25f87d89e0e032548b0da.jpg","id":"5a0337a2-89bb-4c99-975b-41be605651ed","interestId":"5af9f182-fbfb-435f-9986-7f49189431a7","location":null,"name":"Misyjne.pl","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":14316,"slug":"misyjnepl","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:50:05.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:46:39.000Z","description":"In what feels like the first big development in the Russia-Ukraine war for quite some time, President Trump just announced a 3-day ceasefire. The ceasefire will take place May 9-11 while both nations celebrate the Soviet Union's victory in WWII.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"5e430a71-98ab-48de-a682-4f8326cbc101","sortData":{"locality":{"index":415,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":317,"labelData":"farRight"},"date":{"index":360,"labelData":"2026-05-08T19:46:39.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"President Trump Announces Surprise Ceasefire Between Russia & Ukraine","originalTitle":null,"url":"htt