ally to Putin's Protz Parade","originalTitle":"Ukraine-Krieg aktuell: Donald Trump verkündet dreitägige Waffenruhe - pünktlich zu Putins Protz-Parade","url":"https://www.news.de/politik/859598379/donald-trump-verkuendet-3-tage-waffenruhe-im-ukraine-krieg-aktuell-us-praesident-macht-wladimir-putin-geschenk-am-tag-des-sieges/1/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"leanLeft","biasRatings":[{"reviewerId":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","politicalBias":"leanLeft","referenceUrl":"https://mediabiasfactcheck.com/news-de-bias-and-credibility/","sourceInfoId":"18173dde-8bbb-40ef-842a-a856337ed256","reviewer":{"id":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","name":"Media Bias/Fact Check","icon":"https://b-cdn.ground.news/assets/external_source_reviewer_icons/mediaBiasFactCheck.png"}}],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/letterIcons/square/6200EA/N.png","id":"18173dde-8bbb-40ef-842a-a856337ed256","interestId":"3df938cf-7e12-4491-a354-db7c57d0b8c0","location":null,"name":"News.de","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":14104,"slug":"newsde","factuality":"high","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T11:37:15.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:23:31.000Z","description":"A little more than a week after the telephone conversation he had with Vladimir Putin, Donald Trump announced this Friday a three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine on the occasion of the celebration of Victory Day, celebrated annually by the Kremlin in commemoration of the victory against the Nazis during the Second World War: “We are getting closer and closer to the end of the conflict”.\nThe truce will run from this Saturday, May 9 and t…","originalDescription":"A poco más de una semana de la conversación telefónica que mantuvo con Vladimir Putin, Donald Trump anunció este viernes un cese al fuego de tres días entre Rusia y Ucrania con motivo de la celebración del Día de la Victoria, festejado anualmente por el Kremlin en conmemoración de la victoria ante los nazis durante la Segunda Guerra Mundial: \"Nos acercamos cada vez más al fin del conflicto\".\nLa tregua se extenderá desde este sábado, 9 de mayo y …","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"b1d86aa5-5ecc-4f00-8a8e-a019572b568c","sortData":{"locality":{"index":418,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":411,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":332,"labelData":"2026-05-08T19:23:31.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announced a Three-Day Ceasefire in Russia's War with Ukraine: “We Are Nearing the End of the Conflict”","originalTitle":"Trump anunció un cese al fuego de tres días en la guerra de Rusia con Ucrania: \"Nos acercamos al fin del conflicto\"","url":"https://elcanciller.com/internacional/trump-anuncio-un-cese-al-fuego-de-tres-dias-en-la-guerra-de-rusia-con-ucrania---nos-acercamos-al-fin-del-conflicto-_a69fe315138106afd31ee108b","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/1debbd8ecf0e32d2ca43075da671541b4a494993.jpg","id":"2e900420-a4d9-4462-9879-b3848f3d5741","interestId":"c422a5e4-57b7-40a4-b18a-4b94563bec37","location":null,"name":"elCanciller","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":14095,"slug":"elcanciller","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T09:30:49.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T04:04:31.000Z","description":"In this Human Events article, Thomas Stevenson reports that President Donald Trump announced a three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine scheduled for May 9, 10, and 11. Trump said the ceasefire would suspend “all kinetic activity” between Russia and Ukraine for the three-day period. The announcement also includes a proposed prisoner swap of 1,000 prisoners...","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"92b6f182-cd40-412c-abf5-ea31bef85565","sortData":{"locality":{"index":419,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":318,"labelData":"farRight"},"date":{"index":475,"labelData":"2026-05-09T04:04: