er-swap/","wireStoryId":"72434a09-f786-417c-a537-a31c4217cb53","sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/abd23ab6ad4ed78179f31c77a1dd1c15585f9279.jpg","id":"c6a1c5af-7f17-4709-9246-12071cb4eeb3","interestId":"5ae8588f-3b4e-4114-91a5-4407a438de09","location":null,"name":"KFOR FM 103.3 1240 AM","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":12015,"slug":"kfor-fm-1033-1240-am","factuality":"unknown","owners":[{"id":632,"category":"mediaConglomerate","name":"Alpha Media"}]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T06:52:04.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T06:20:12.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump requested a suspension of combat operations for the duration of Russia's Victory Day celebrations.","originalDescription":"Yhdysvaltain presidentti Donald Trump pyysi taistelutoimien keskeyttämistä Venäjän voitonpäivän juhlallisuuksien ajaksi.","lang":"fi","paywall":"no","refId":"eda9f397-82d8-42a8-bfc2-fa5292c6c373","sortData":{"locality":{"index":437,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":493,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":493,"labelData":"2026-05-09T06:20:12.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Declares Ceasefire Between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":"Trump julisti Ukrainan ja Venäjän välille tulitauon","url":"https://www.kauppalehti.fi/uutiset/a/032ce555-2c1c-4b31-8a0f-0853120a3da6","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/letterIcons/square/FF6D00/T.png","id":"eee44b58-382f-4b26-accf-37ed846d4a4b","interestId":"6a27ab97-9276-46a5-b396-3471df33a231","location":null,"name":"Tärkeimmät talousuutiset | Kauppalehti…","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":11914,"slug":"tarkeimmat-talousuutiset-kauppalehti","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T05:08:17.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T20:28:23.000Z","description":"WASHINGTON (Agencies) : President Donald Trump said Friday that the leaders of Russia and Ukraine have agreed to his request for a three-day ceasefire and an exchange of prisoners, adding that such a halt to hostilities could be the “beginning of the end” of the long war between them. Trump announced on social media that the ceasefire would run Saturday through Monday. Saturday is Victory Day in Russia, a holiday that commemorates its victory ov…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"2a10d0f8-cc1d-4825-b276-6efb92936a9d","sortData":{"locality":{"index":438,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":494,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":386,"labelData":"2026-05-08T20:28:23.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces three-day Ukraine-Russia ceasefire, prisoner swap","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://thefrontierpost.com/trump-announces-three-day-ukraine-russia-ceasefire-prisoner-swap/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/letterIcons/square/FFD600/T.png","id":"04f82dea-ee87-4093-9fd7-83321d69e5be","interestId":"0aa7cda4-c83b-4b11-94ae-962893ea7d05","location":null,"name":"The Frontier Post","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":11853,"slug":"the-frontier-post","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:52:03.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:36:21.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump announced on the Truth Social network that there will be a three-day ceasefire in the war between Russia and Ukraine from May 9 to 11. In addition to the ceasefire, there will be a 1,000-for-1,000 prisoner exchange.","originalDescription":"Прэзыдэнт ЗША Дональд Трамп заявіў у сацсетцы Truth Social, што ў вайне паміж Расеяй і Ўкраінай будзе трохдзённае перамір’е з 9 да 11 траўня. Апроч спыненьня агню, адбудзецца абмен палоннымі ў фармаце 1000 на 1000.","lang":"be","paywall":"no","refId":"88ce1c0a-5d31-4045-a663-cf7fb0fb819b","sortData":{"locality":{"index":439,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":415,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":198,"labelData":"2026-05-08T18:36:21.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump: Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine Will Be on May 9-11, 2,000 Prisoners Will Be Exchanged","originalTitle":"Трамп: перамір’е паміж Расеяй і Ўкраінай будзе 9—11 траўня, пройдзе абмен 2000 палонных","url":"https://www.svaboda.org/a/33752892.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/90ac0da93f7a0a2c246890963cb7ec5ae632cee1.jpg","id":"d822bf31-995c-4539-8d5e-9cd00c2483ff","interestId":"bf72aab8-65a1-465f-ad1b-7dcb0612f684","location":null,"name":"Радыё Свабода","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":11821,"slug":"_8a7522","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T08:34:35.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T20:30:57.000Z","description":"Donald Trump announced this Friday, May 8, 2026 a three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia from Saturday, accompanied by an exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each country. Moscow and Volodymyr Zelensky confirmed the agreement, but the drone attacks were still going on this Friday.","originalDescription":"Donald Trump a annoncé ce vendredi 8 mai 2026 un cessez-le-feu de trois jours entre l’Ukraine et la Russie à partir de samedi, accompagné d’un échange de 1.000 prisonniers de chaque pays. Moscou et Volodymyr Zelensky ont confirmé l’accord, mais les attaques de drones se poursuivaient encore ce vendredi.","lang":"fr","paywall":"no","refId":"bceeb3be-94a5-44b7-b488-4f69447db5c0","sortData":{"locality":{"index":440,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":495,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":388,"labelData":"2026-05-08T20:30:57.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"\"Let's Hope This Is the Beginning of the End of a Very Long War\": Donald Trump Announces a Three-Day Ceasefire and an Exchange of 1,000 Prisoners Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"« Espérons que ce soit le début de la fin d’une guerre très longue » : Donald Trump annonce un cessez-le-feu de trois jours et un échange de 1.000 prisonniers entre la Russie et l’Ukraine","url":"https://www.nicematin.com/societe/conflits/esperons-que-ce-soit-le-debut-de-la-fin-d-une-guerre-tres-longue-donald-trump-annonce-un-cessez-le-feu-de-trois-jours-et-un-echange-de-1-000-prisonniers-entre-la-russie-et-l-ukraine-10679934","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/letterIcons/square/00B8D4/N.png","id":"ba9ddc85-3b09-4a84-86c9-9a18d96bf6d9","interestId":"c27a4c1f-947e-4c88-87ca-a55e360bb74f","location":null,"name":"nicematin.com","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":11745,"slug":"nicematincom","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T10:17:55.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:30:28.000Z","description":"The three-day truce, starting from Saturday, will also include a mutual swap of 1,000 prisoners each, US President Trump says.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"a0eb14f6-7556-4e16-b3ce-156537646d77","sortData":{"locality":{"index":226,"labelData":"international","flag":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/flags/120_120/TR.png"},"bias":{"index":301,"labelData":"right"},"date":{"index":338,"labelData":"2026-05-08T19:30:28.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces temporary Russia-Ukraine ceasefire, both sides confirm","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.trtworld.com/article/558d1b739cb9","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"right","biasRatings":[{"reviewerId":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","politicalBias":"right","referenceUrl":"https://mediabiasfactcheck.com/trt-world/","sourceInfoId":"61d747e7-b909-449a-a557-139b99aae473","reviewer":{"id":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","name":"Media Bias/Fact Check","icon":"https://b-cdn.ground.news/assets/external_source_reviewer_icons/mediaBiasFactCheck.pn