ace negotiations and market optimism. The post Russia, Ukraine agree to three-day ceasefire with prisoner swap appeared first on Crypto Briefing.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"17d86a95-cd0e-404e-99e0-bf43d0faba27","sortData":{"locality":{"index":445,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":416,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":275,"labelData":"2026-05-08T18:56:59.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Russia, Ukraine agree to three-day ceasefire with prisoner swap","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://cryptobriefing.com/russia-ukraine-agree-to-three-day-ceasefire-with-prisoner-swap/","wireStoryId":"8bd0747f-ec52-47fc-b821-0808e9622b29","sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/ab5b584ac905f18bc5e4e15a0a7d1dd6071cd133.jpg","id":"d787e878-bbf9-4f42-aacc-f112c471cbf9","interestId":"ae9da584-d353-4b06-9c68-3fa992d20255","location":null,"name":"Crypto Briefing","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":11354,"slug":"crypto-briefing","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T22:43:40.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T21:09:50.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump announced a three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia, set to begin this Saturday, which he said has already been agreed upon by both governments. The measure coincides with the unilateral truce that Moscow had previously announced in the context of the Victory Day celebrations, held every May 9 to commemorate the victory over Nazi Germany in World War II. Despite this, clashes between the forces of both countries …","originalDescription":"El presidente de Estados Unidos, Donald Trump, anunció un cese del fuego de tres días entre Ucrania y Rusia que comenzará este sábado y que, según indicó, ya cuenta con la aceptación de ambos gobiernos. La medida coincide con la tregua unilateral que Moscú había comunicado previamente en el marco de las celebraciones por el Día de la V