nfirm Russia's acceptance of the initiative recently proposed by U.S. President Donald Trump on a ceasefire for the exchange of prisoners of war between Russia and Ukraine,\" Yuri Ushakov, Russian presidenti…","originalDescription":"El Kremlin informó este viernes haber aceptado la propuesta del presidente estadounidense, Donald Trump, sobre una tregua con Ucrania entre el 9 y el 11 de mayo y un intercambio de mil prisioneros de cada bando. \n\"Siguiendo instrucciones del presidente Vladímir Putin, confirmo la aceptación por parte rusa de la iniciativa propuesta recientemente por el presidente estadounidense Donald Trump sobre un alto el fuego para el intercambio de prisioner…","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"a05a5120-766e-4368-a960-7276e7fb8694","sortData":{"locality":{"index":474,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":505,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":6,"labelData":"2026-05-08T12:00:00.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Moscow Accepts the Proposed Truce with Ukraine From 9 to 11 May","originalTitle":"Moscú acepta la propuesta de tregua con Ucrania del 9 al 11 de mayo","url":"https://www.elsiglodetorreon.com.mx/noticia/2026/moscu-acepta-la-propuesta-de-tregua-con-ucrania-del-9-al-11-de-mayo.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/letterIcons/square/FFAB00/E.png","id":"08ae1297-b3f2-47c0-9506-7894d5d3c8cd","interestId":"c80c18b1-02c0-4f58-9950-9f9b89522cca","location":null,"name":"elsiglodetorreon.com.mx","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":8190,"slug":"elsiglodetorreoncommx","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T16:21:26.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T22:31:42.000Z","description":"The president of the United States, Donald Trump, announced this Friday a three-day truce in the conflict between Russia and Ukraine while \"continuing the talks\" to reach a peace agreement. The president warned that this could be \"the begi