ion’s victory over Nazi Germany in World War II, known in Russia as the Great Patriotic War. It is a time when the nation collectively reflects on its […]","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"1c41a892-fdc4-40ca-a14d-09236f17fc9c","sortData":{"locality":{"index":476,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":320,"labelData":"farRight"},"date":{"index":459,"labelData":"2026-05-09T01:37:06.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"President Trump Mediates a Three-Day Ceasefire Between Ukraine and Russia Coinciding with Victory Day","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://theconservativetreehouse.com/blog/2026/05/08/president-trump-mediates-a-three-day-ceasefire-between-ukraine-and-russia-coinciding-with-victory-day/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"farRight","biasRatings":[{"reviewerId":"0b06b55d-d3d4-4653-b4db-b22c77d812f7","politicalBias":"farRight","referenceUrl":"https://www.adfontesmedia.com/the-last-refuge-bias-and-reliability/","sourceInfoId":"5e87384e-b338-4db9-9122-75758606d71d","reviewer":{"id":"0b06b55d-d3d4-4653-b4db-b22c77d812f7","name":"Ad Fontes Media","icon":"https://b-cdn.ground.news/assets/external_source_reviewer_icons/adFontes.png"}},{"reviewerId":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","politicalBias":"farRight","referenceUrl":"https://mediabiasfactcheck.com/the-last-refuge/","sourceInfoId":"5e87384e-b338-4db9-9122-75758606d71d","reviewer":{"id":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","name":"Media Bias/Fact Check","icon":"https://b-cdn.ground.news/assets/external_source_reviewer_icons/mediaBiasFactCheck.png"}}],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/60341017ae2d5486cc4730798e7075291e98c4dc.jpg","id":"5e87384e-b338-4db9-9122-75758606d71d","interestId":"2bcdc9a4-9c91-467c-af29-a30354aeac7e","location":null,"name":"The Last Refuge","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":7755,"slug":"the-last-refuge","factuality":"low","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T13:34:16.000Z","date":"20