5f-4a51-a5c2-03c9f7376d8d","sortData":{"locality":{"index":487,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":430,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":453,"labelData":"2026-05-09T00:52:34.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Temporary Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine Would Include Massive Exchange of Prisoners, According to International Reports","originalTitle":"Alto al fuego temporal entre Rusia y Ucrania incluiría intercambio masivo de prisioneros, según reportes internacionales","url":"https://lapagina.com.sv/internacionales/alto-al-fuego-temporal-entre-rusia-y-ucrania-incluiria-intercambio-masivo-de-prisioneros-segun-reportes-internacionales/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/a502db3732f76e1be7682ab22a93c8b1b97495a7.jpg","id":"c58184dc-7f4f-408c-9b3e-0610ae5b6f9f","interestId":"715207a9-f0af-470d-93c6-c318db63f922","location":null,"name":"Diario La Página","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":6604,"slug":"diario-la-pagina","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T00:22:52.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T20:58:25.000Z","description":"President Donald Trump announced this Friday that Russia and Ukraine agreed to a three-day ceasefire in the ongoing war between the two countries, which, he said, will include a cessation of fighting and a large-scale prisoner exchange. The truce will extend from this Saturday, May 9, the original date of the festivity, until Monday 11. While the U.S. president said it is carried out mainly on Russian territory, he clarified that for Ukrainians …","originalDescription":"El presidente Donald Trump anunció este viernes que Rusia y Ucrania acordaron un alto el fuego de tres días en la guerra en curso entre ambos países, el cual, según dijo, incluirá un cese de los combates y un intercambio de prisioneros a gran escala. La tregua se extenderá desde este sábado, 9 de mayo, fecha original de la festividad, hasta el lunes 11. Si bien el presidente estadounidense indicó que se lleva a cabo principalmente en territorio …","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"d73c9616-a8cf-41d4-a264-2a4066d3bd5d","sortData":{"locality":{"index":488,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":511,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":397,"labelData":"2026-05-08T20:58:25.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announced a Three-Day Ceasefire in Russia’s War with Ukraine","originalTitle":"Trump anunció un cese al fuego de tres días en la guerra de Rusia con Ucrania","url":"https://www.conclusion.com.ar/internacionales/trump-anuncio-un-cese-al-fuego-de-tres-dias-en-la-guerra-de-rusia-con-ucrania/05/2026/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/letterIcons/square/AA00FF/C.png","id":"81ed64c0-66d8-4bf3-98c1-6cea7a7d18a8","interestId":"8ed9fe70-0bc6-4586-b779-b9d342df55e0","location":null,"name":"conclusion.com.ar","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":6542,"slug":"conclusioncomar","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:30:07.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:23:45.000Z","description":"The request for a ceasefire was made directly by Trump, the president said.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"9a16295e-6260-4b9b-82f1-9407df03da67","sortData":{"locality":{"index":489,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":273,"labelData":"leanRight"},"date":{"index":132,"labelData":"2026-05-08T18:23:45.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump shares terms of Victory Day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://mynews4.com/news/nation-world/russia-ukraine-ceasefire-trump-shares-terms-victory-day-prison-swap-kinetic-activity-fighting-putin-zelenskyy-world-war-ii","wireStoryId":"5ad5b0ec-635a-4595-84eb-5a14b8bd4825","sourceInfo":{"bias":"leanRight","biasRatings":[{"reviewerId":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","polit