Icon":null,"title":"Three-Day Ceasefire Between Ukraine and Russia: ‘Hopefully the Beginning of the End of a Long War’","originalTitle":"Staakt-het-vuren van drie dagen tussen Oekraïne en Rusland: ‘Hopelijk begin van het einde van een lange oorlog’","url":"https://www.destentor.nl/buitenland/staakt-het-vuren-van-drie-dagen-tussen-oekraine-en-rusland-hopelijk-begin-van-het-einde-van-een-lange-oorlog~ae4b70cf/","wireStoryId":"5bc49b27-5fae-457e-8a04-d242f58c8315","sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/letterIcons/square/FFD600/D.png","id":"dbb710ef-17a3-40d3-8bab-cba448371bde","interestId":"d2926da9-4eb1-4f33-95f6-4262bb958c87","location":null,"name":"destentor.nl","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":3893,"slug":"destentornl","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T00:06:47.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:17:00.000Z","description":"article updated.... \"I am happy to announce that a THREE-DAY ARMISTATE has been declared in the armed conflict between Russia and Ukraine (May 9, 10, and 11). Victory Day is celebrated in Russia, but so is Ukraine, as that country also played an important role in World War II,\" Trump wrote on social media. Trump Declares ArmisticeThe US President announced that \"the armistice will include a cessation of all hostilities, as well as an exchange of…","originalDescription":"artykuł aktualizowany....„Z radością ogłaszam, że w konflikcie zbrojnym między Rosją a Ukrainą ogłoszono TRZYDNIOWE ZAWIESZENIE BRONI (9, 10 i 11 maja). W Rosji obchodzony jest Dzień Zwycięstwa, ale podobnie jest na Ukrainie, ponieważ kraj ten również odegrał ważną rolę w II wojnie światowej” – napisał Trump w mediach społecznościowych.Trumpa ogłasza rozejmPrezydent USA ogłosił, że „zawieszenie broni obejmie wstrzymanie wszelkich działań zbrojny…","lang":"pl","paywall":"no","refId":"22537847-a8f9-4871-afe3-5c742bbaa64e","sortData":{"locality":{"index":506,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":307,"labelData":"right"},"date":{"index":83,"labelData":"2026-05-08T18:17:00.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire. Ukraine and Russia Are to Hold Their Fire.","originalTitle":"Trump ogłasza trzydniowy rozejm. Ukraina i Rosja mają wsytrzmać ogień","url":"https://www.tvp.info/93151540/usa-donald-trump-oglasza-rozejm-w-wojnie-ukrainsko-rosyjskiej-ma-potrwac-trzy-dni","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"right","biasRatings":[{"reviewerId":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","politicalBias":"right","referenceUrl":"https://mediabiasfactcheck.com/tvp-info-bias/","sourceInfoId":"453f4b9b-a70d-4099-a07e-423d4dd40074","reviewer":{"id":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","name":"Media Bias/Fact Check","icon":"https://b-cdn.ground.news/assets/external_source_reviewer_icons/mediaBiasFactCheck.png"}}],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/[f5c]/9ecf49d20c60e4397f2e45b60a367a9763ca150c.jpg","id":"453f4b9b-a70d-4099-a07e-423d4dd40074","interestId":"f5c99213-2061-4c48-a886-960936ee6e10","location":null,"name":"tvp.info","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":3554,"slug":"tvpinfo","factuality":"mixed","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T13:34:16.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:23:45.000Z","description":"The request for a ceasefire was made directly by Trump, the president said.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"7b9b19a8-6210-4935-8554-6af190dc068f","sortData":{"locality":{"index":507,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":279,"labelData":"leanRight"},"date":{"index":136,"labelData":"2026-05-08T18:23:45.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump shares terms of Victory Day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://wjactv.com/news/nation-world/russia-ukraine-ceasefire-trump-shares-terms-victory-day-prison-swap-kinetic-activity-fighting-putin-zelenskyy-world-war-ii","wireStoryId":"5ad5b0ec-635a-4