he-morning-news-bias-and-credibility/","sourceInfoId":"d8ecc0e5-8340-4b7c-a840-0f5ee59fa292","reviewer":{"id":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","name":"Media Bias/Fact Check","icon":"https://b-cdn.ground.news/assets/external_source_reviewer_icons/mediaBiasFactCheck.png"}}],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/letterIcons/square/FFD600/T.png","id":"d8ecc0e5-8340-4b7c-a840-0f5ee59fa292","interestId":"1b1400de-8766-47ba-96ea-53f66ed6a73a","location":null,"name":"The Morning News","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":1710,"slug":"the-morning-news","factuality":"high","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:44:55.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:35:01.000Z","description":"President Donald Trump announced this Friday that Russia and Ukraine have agreed on a three-day ceasefire in the ongoing war between the two countries, which, he said, will include a cessation of fighting and a...","originalDescription":"El presidente Donald Trump anunció este viernes que Rusia y Ucrania han acordado un alto el fuego de tres días en la guerra en curso entre ambos países, el cual, según dijo, incluirá un cese de los combates y un…","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"3b25f67f-5dc0-4c1c-9510-fb9756c5c283","sortData":{"locality":{"index":518,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":189,"labelData":"center"},"date":{"index":190,"labelData":"2026-05-08T18:35:01.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces a 3-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"Trump anuncia un alto el fuego de 3 días entre Rusia y Ucrania","url":"https://www.kezi.com/news/spanish/trump-anuncia-un-alto-el-fuego-de-3-d-as-entre-rusia-y-ucrania/article_fcfb503e-7a7a-5722-9b3c-e2183a2dd3b8.html","wireStoryId":"c7013806-b379-4795-b2c5-f2c44879abc2","sourceInfo":{"bias":"center","biasRatings":[{"reviewerId":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","politicalBias":"center","referenceUrl":"https://mediabiasfactcheck.com/kezi-eugene-news-bias/","sourceInf