mundo/rusia-y-ucrania-aceptan-tregua-del-9-al-11-de-mayo-mediada-por-washington-29882658","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/letterIcons/square/FFAB00/O.png","id":"4714b3b1-25ed-4bc4-888c-2c4f7aa60384","interestId":"bd40142c-404a-412c-9698-8ba8d7bd7591","location":null,"name":"oem.com.mx","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":993,"slug":"oemcommx","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T21:30:37.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:27:00.000Z","description":"","originalDescription":null,"lang":"az","paywall":"no","refId":"dbbd5317-cb89-4217-8710-969c00628ebb","sortData":{"locality":{"index":524,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":527,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":162,"labelData":"2026-05-08T18:27:00.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"Tramp Rusiya ilə Ukrayna arasında üçgünlük atəşkəs elan olunacağını bildirib","url":"https://azertag.az/xeber/tramp_rusiya_ile_ukrayna_arasinda_uchgunluk_ateskes_elan_olunacagini_bildirib-4177815","wireStoryId":"1880b7b5-2a13-4927-90aa-5606f6332f6b","sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/letterIcons/square/00C853/A.png","id":"a93fcc44-b800-4e13-a0fe-486f9449f8f4","interestId":"7f43519f-0ca2-40ed-a44d-b231149726d8","location":null,"name":"azertag.az","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":809,"slug":"azertagaz","factuality":"unknown","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T01:49:07.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:00:00.000Z","description":"The US President said that Russia and Ukraine have agreed on a three-day ceasefire. Trump added that he made this proposal himself, and Putin and Zelenskiy agreed. “This ceasefire will include the suspension of all hostilities, as well as the exchange of prisoners — 1,000 from each side [...] The celebration in Russia is associated with Victory Day, but also in Ukraine, as it also played a significant role in World War II,” the American leader w…","originalDescription":"Президент США заявил, что Россия и Украина договорились о прекращении огня на трое суток. Трамп добавил, что сам внес это предложение, а Путин с Зеленским согласились. „ «Это прекращение огня будет включать в себя приостановку всех боевых действий, а также обмен пленными — по 1000 с каждой стороны. [...] Празднование в России связано с Днем Победы, но также и в Украине, поскольку она тоже сыграла значительную роль во Второй мировой войне», — нап…","lang":"ru","paywall":"no","refId":"3fe7bc14-8d75-420c-8351-3fe81cd87fcc","sortData":{"locality":{"index":525,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":436,"labelData":null},"date":{"index":279,"labelData":"2026-05-08T19:00:00.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Moscow and Kiev Confirmed Trump's Ceasefire From May 9 to May 11. Zelenskiy Said He Did This for the Sake of Exchanging Prisoners — Novaya Gazeta","originalTitle":"Москва и Киев подтвердили объявленное Трампом прекращение огня с 9 по 11 мая. Зеленский заявил, что пошел на это ради обмена пленными — Новая газета","url":"https://novayagazeta.ru/articles/2026/05/08/moskva-i-kiev-podtverdili-obiavlennoe-trampom-prekrashchenie-ognia-s-9-po-11-maia-zelenskii-zaiavil-chto-poshel-na-eto-radi-obmena-plennymi-news","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"unknown","biasRatings":[],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/interests/4b947415c29c0778485cee33a6aae9aa2fccc5e3.jpg","id":"86410f14-e334-42b3-9d8f-a527a0157b13","interestId":"fcb245a9-06c6-426e-83fb-4d7c18b27c8a","location":null,"name":"Новая газета - Novayagazeta.ru","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":669,"slug":"novayagazetaru","factuality":"unknown","owners":[{"id":1047,"category":"independent","name":"Mikhail Gorbachev"}]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T10:25:28.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T07:19:17.000Z","description":"