ia-Ukraine War Ceasefire Tied to Victory Day a…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"532959ff-9f08-41f0-8c41-ae43660aaa23","sortData":{"locality":{"index":529,"labelData":"other","flag":null},"bias":{"index":7,"labelData":"left"},"date":{"index":515,"labelData":"2026-05-09T11:26:01.000Z"}},"specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Brokers Brief Russia-Ukraine War Ceasefire Tied to Victory Day as Prisoner Swap of 1,000 Each Side Confirmed","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.foreignpolicyjournal.com/2026/05/09/trump-brokers-brief-russia-ukraine-war-ceasefire-tied-to-victory-day-as-prisoner-swap-of-1000-each-side-confirmed/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":{"bias":"left","biasRatings":[{"reviewerId":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","politicalBias":"left","referenceUrl":"https://mediabiasfactcheck.com/foreign-policy-journal/","sourceInfoId":"f3b845ce-d0a3-4e9e-9e6a-1705e00c0a4c","reviewer":{"id":"c17ff2cc-b919-439a-b390-1a9a4d08ba62","name":"Media Bias/Fact Check","icon":"https://b-cdn.ground.news/assets/external_source_reviewer_icons/mediaBiasFactCheck.png"}}],"icon":"https://groundnews.b-cdn.net/assets/letterIcons/square/FF6D00/F.png","id":"f3b845ce-d0a3-4e9e-9e6a-1705e00c0a4c","interestId":"4ba545f7-234a-4f06-ba05-497f77cc6470","location":null,"name":"foreignpolicyjournal.com","paywall":"no","place":[],"placeId":null,"storyCount":253,"slug":"foreignpolicyjournalcom","factuality":"mixed","owners":[]}},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T19:36:32.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T18:54:28.000Z","description":"Russian President Vladimir Putin stated on Saturday that Moscow has not yet received a formal proposal from Ukraine regarding the significant prisoner exchange recently announced by U.S. President Donald Trump. Despite the public nature of the plan, which suggests a large-scale humanitarian swap between the two warring nations, Putin indicated that the specific logistics and terms have not been communicated through official channels. Spe