91:["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-col gap-[2rem] tablet:pr-[1rem]","style":{"gridArea":"sources"},"children":[["$","section",null,{"className":"flex flex-col gap-[2rem]","children":["$","$L96",null,{"user":"$undefined","session":"$undefined","showFactualityData":false,"defaultSort":"latest first","children":["$","$L97",null,{"allSources":[{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T18:31:25.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T18:30:47.000Z","description":"U.S. President Donald Trump said on Saturday, May 9th, that Russia and Ukraine had agreed to a temporary three-day ceasefire from May 9 to May 11, marking the first coordinated pause in fighting between the two sides in months amid ongoing diplomatic efforts to end the war. According to Trump, the agreement includes a suspension of “all kinetic activity” and a mutual exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each side.  Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zele…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"324d7408-1739-439d-b7bc-b0cac2fd5771","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:475:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Russia-Ukraine Ceasefire on Victory Day","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://europeanconservative.com/articles/news-corner/trump-russia-ukraine-three-day-ceasefire-victory-day/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:475:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T18:51:25.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T18:15:38.000Z","description":"Donald Trump answered LCI's questions again on Saturday, May 9. He said that he had \"obtained\" the temporary ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia, believing that \"it would be a good thing\" for the truce to be extended. Questioned about the Middle East, the US President assured that Iran \"really wants to conclude an agreement.\" - Ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia, US proposal to Iran: Trump responds to LCI (International).","originalDescription":"▶️ Donald Trump a de nouveau répondu aux questions de LCI ce samedi 9 mai. Il indique notamment avoir \"obtenu\" le cessez-le-feu temporaire entre l'Ukraine et la Russie, estimant que \"ce serait une bonne chose\" que la trêve soit prolongée. Interrogé sur le Moyen-Orient, le président américain assure que l'Iran veut \"vraiment conclure un accord\". - Cessez-le-feu entre l'Ukraine et la Russie, proposition américaine à l'Iran : Trump répond à LCI (In…","lang":"fr","paywall":"no","refId":"5be36cc5-14d4-4442-bc74-e386fde975c2","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:303:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Stop the Fire Between Ukraine and Russia, US Proposal to Iran: Trump Responds to LCI","originalTitle":"Cessez-le-feu entre l'Ukraine et la Russie, proposition américaine à l'Iran : Trump répond à LCI","url":"https://www.tf1info.fr/international/cessez-le-feu-entre-l-ukraine-et-la-russie-proposition-americaine-a-l-iran-trump-repond-a-lci-2440656.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:303:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T19:42:58.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T17:58:51.000Z","description":"A three-day ceasefire has come into effect in Ukraine, brokered by the US, while Russia warned a long-term peace deal is a long way off.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"127b75e2-a1fd-41f4-843e-6a88e607fa74","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:348:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Russia and Ukraine begin three-day ceasefire after Trump appeal","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.channel4.com/news/russia-and-ukraine-begin-three-day-ceasefire-after-trump-appeal","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:348:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T18:35:02.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T17:31:24.000Z","description":"President Donald Trump announced Friday a three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine that began today, May 9, and will run through May 11, coinciding with Russia’s Victory Day commemorations. The ceasefire agreement also includes a major prisoner exchange, with both sides agreeing to swap 1,000 prisoners each. President Trump highlighted this element in his Truth Social announcement, noting it as part of the temporary truce. Ukrainian Presid…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"7d7246de-a1b8-4052-8581-12e6876b8897","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:431:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Brokers 3-Day Ceasefire + 1,000 Prisoner Swap Between Russia And Ukraine","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://dallasexpress.com/national/trump-brokers-3-day-ceasefire-1000-prisoner-swap-between-russia-and-ukraine/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:431:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T16:02:33.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T15:00:00.000Z","description":"Could a three-day ceasefire really slow down Europe’s deadliest war in decades — or is this just another pause before the next wave of attacks? That’s the question hanging over Russia and Ukraine after US President Donald Trump announced a temporary truce between the two countries.The deal also includes a massive prisoner swap involving 1,000 captives from each side. \nIt comes after days of bitter accusations that both Moscow and Kyiv were viola…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"c31bcd70-363b-41c5-b4c1-874dbc9b9b3f","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:514:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Russia, Ukraine Agree To Three-Day Ceasefire, Trump Says","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://themorningnews.c