n three-day ceasefire","originalDescription":"Russia, Ukraine agree on three-day ceasefire","lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"65e4b5d5-d095-46b9-9882-686e195dcba1","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:181:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Russia, Ukraine Agree on Three-Day Ceasefire","originalTitle":"Russia, Ukraine agree on three-day ceasefire","url":"https://tribune.com.pk/story/2607149/russia-ukraine-agree-on-three-day-ceasefire","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:181:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T00:54:44.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T21:43:40.000Z","description":"President Donald Trump said that the leaders of Russia and Ukraine have agreed to his request for a three-d...","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"30a0e53c-7a44-42fe-a944-9f43e4ede183","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:166:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump says Russia and Ukraine have agreed to his request for a three-day ceasefire","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.9news.com.au/world/trump-says-russia-and-ukraine-have-agreed-to-his-request-for-a-3day-ceasefire-and-a-prisoner-swap/6bcaa00b-72fd-49ee-b56d-5de9dc0e50b7","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:166:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T02:02:46.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T21:33:19.000Z","description":"In an online post, US President Donald Trump said Russia and Ukraine had agreed to a three-day cease-fire deal starting on May 9. The date coincides with Victory Day celebrations in Russia. Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy said there would be no attacks on the site of the celebrations.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"c302d7ee-3e73-437f-9f8c-0b71798d8aff","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:192:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Says Russia, Ukraine Will Pause Fighting On May 9","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.rferl.org/a/trump-putin-zelenskyy-cease-fire-victory-day/33752919.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:192:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T22:41:46.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T21:32:47.000Z","description":"U.S. President Donald Trump has announced a three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine, a decision that he claims would have been agreed by the leaders of both countries. The truce comes just in time for Vladimir Putin to hold the Victory Day parade in Moscow. “This ceasefire will include the suspension of all military activity and an exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each country. I made this request directly and I greatly appreciate your ac…","originalDescription":"El presidente de Estados Unidos, Donald Trump, ha anunciado un alto el fuego de tres días entre Rusia y Ucrania, una decisión que, según afirma, habría sido acordada por los líderes de ambos países. La tregua llega justo a tiempo para que Vladimir Putin celebre el desfile del Día de la Victoria en Moscú. «Este alto el fuego incluirá la suspensión de toda actividad militar y un intercambio de 1000 prisioneros de cada país. Esta solicitud la hice …","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"81597fd1-648b-40ff-8dc2-f91294b0f4cf","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:64:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine for Putin’s Parade in Moscow · Global Voices","originalTitle":"Trump anuncia un alto el fuego de tres días entre Rusia y Ucrania por el desfile de Putin en Moscú","url":"https://okdiario.com/internacional/trump-anuncia-alto-fuego-tres-dias-rusia-ucrania-desfile-putin-moscu-16763373","wireStoryId":nu