e}]},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:28:34.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T21:17:48.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump announced Friday that Russia and Ukraine have agreed to a temporary ceasefire and a large prisoner exchange, marking what he described as a potential step toward ending the ongoing war.\n\n","originalDescription":"'Talks are continuing on ending this major conflict ... we are getting closer and closer every day,' says US president","lang":"tr","paywall":"no","refId":"5a3c0711-3561-4163-8907-7a4d7faf51a4","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:40:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces 3-day ceasefire in Russia-Ukraine war","originalTitle":"Trump announces 3-day ceasefire in Russia-Ukraine war","url":"https://www.aa.com.tr/en/russia-ukraine-war/trump-announces-3-day-ceasefire-in-russia-ukraine-war/3931862","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:40:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T03:06:12.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T21:12:55.000Z","description":"Russia and Ukraine have agreed to a three-day ceasefire and a prisoner swap in honor of Victory Day in World War II, President Donald Trump announced.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"581329a8-5c2f-44f4-9efa-2e95879986c9","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:29:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Donald Trump Announces 3-Day Ceasefire Between Russia, Ukraine","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.breitbart.com/politics/2026/05/08/donald-trump-announces-3-day-ceasefire-prisoner-swap-russia-ukraine/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:29:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T05:42:35.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T21:10:16.000Z","description":"Russia and Ukraine confirmed a US-mediated three-day ceasefire and a 1,000-for-1,000 prisoner swap. The deal covered the Victory Day period even as both sides reported fresh overnight attacks.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"a21025f8-0091-49c1-9da3-689972f38962","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:43:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Russia, Ukraine agree to 3-day Trump-mediated ceasefire, prisoner swap","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.indiatoday.in/world/story/russia-ukraine-ceasefire-trump-may-9-11-truce-1000-prisoner-exchange-2909004-2026-05-09","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:43:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T21:06:14.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T21:06:05.000Z","description":"KYIV, Ukraine — US President Donald Trump announced a three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia starting Saturday, saying he hoped it could lead to long term deal to end Moscow’s war. Russia had previously announced a two-day unilateral ceasefire to mark its May 9 World War II Victory Day on Saturday. Ukraine previously stated that it too had offered a truce but that this had been ignored by Moscow. The truce would also include a mutual swa…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"b4bd4243-dee7-4010-bfd6-55e77fbf4278","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:80:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces three-day Ukraine-Russia ceasefire","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://globalnation.inquirer.net/322251/trump-announces-three-day-ukraine-russia-ceasefire","wireStoryId":"e7244cc3-1159-4e01-bd7a-7de35e0a9794","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:80:sourceInfo","wireStories":[{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:35:20.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T20:12:32.000Z","description":"Russia and Ukraine will down arms for three days to allow Russia to mark the end of World War II for Russia, US President Donald Trump has announced.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"yes","refId":"4d772cf3-a709-493a-89e7-ad5e7b94589d","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:27:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces three-day Ukraine-Russia ceasefire","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://thewest.com.au/news/conflict/trump-announces-three-day-ukraine-russia-ceasefire-c-22258089","wireStoryId":"e7244cc3-1159-4e01-bd7a-7de35e0a9794","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:27:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:22:34.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T20:12:32.000Z","description":"Russia and Ukraine will down arms for three days to allow Russia to mark the end of World War II for Russia, US President Donald Trump has announced.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"76e3b3b4-3364-44a0-b104-fbadf1dedcb4","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:37:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces three-day Ukraine-Russia ceasefire","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.perthnow.com.au/news/conflict/trump-announces-three-day-ukraine-russia-ceasefire-c-22258087","wireStoryId":"e7244cc3-1159-4e01-bd7a-7de35e0a9794","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:37:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T12:49:37.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T04:08:00.000Z","description":"Washington - US President Donald Trump announces Friday that Ukraine and Russia have agreed to observe a three-day truce starting Saturday and a mutual swap of 1,000 prisoners each.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"5717af62-9c59-44e7-b321-0e734ac8aa25","sortData":"$86:p