ngoing peace talks","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.thestatesman.com/world/donald-trump-three-day-ceasefire-russia-ukraine-war-us-mediation-zelenskyy-putin-prisoner-swap-peace-talks-may-9-11-1503591625.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:442:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T21:58:39.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T21:00:00.000Z","description":"Key news items from VOA's \"Today's Focus\" on May 8, 2026 include: President Trump states that the ceasefire following the US-Iran conflict remains in effect; President Trump announces a three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine and a prisoner exchange; Taiwan's Legislative Yuan passes a $25 billion special defense budget; and an interview with Yu Maochun discussing the \"Trump-Xi meeting\": Trump 2.0 has more confidence and more concrete coun…","originalDescription":"2026年5月8日《VOA今日焦点》重点新闻内容包括：特朗普总统表示美伊冲突后停火依然有效；特朗普总统宣布俄乌停火三天并交换囚犯；台湾立法院通过250亿美元国防特别预算；专访余茂春谈“特习会”：特朗普2.0应对中共更有信心、也更有具体的对策。","lang":"zh-CN","paywall":"no","refId":"fd647174-e8bf-4f3b-bc14-ea41c3fa3b58","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:506:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"VOA Today's Focus (Audio)","originalTitle":"《VOA今日焦点》音频","url":"https://www.voachinese.com/a/8145624.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:506:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T21:02:39.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T20:54:00.000Z","description":"“Hopefully, it is the beginning of the end of a very long, deadly, and hard-fought war,” the president posted on Truth Social.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"bf494bf5-ccdb-4d5e-9954-9dabf530b19a","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:297:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces prisoner swap and 3-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.stripes.com/theaters/europe/2026-05-08/trump-announces-ceasefire-russia-ukraine-21614764.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:297:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T22:13:54.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T20:51:34.000Z","description":"President Donald Trump announced on 8 May 2026 that Russia and Ukraine had agreed to a three-day ceasefire running from 9 to 11 May, coinciding with Russia's Victory Day commemorations. Trump made the announcement via his Truth Social platform, calling it potentially the 'beginning of the end' of a conflict he described as 'the biggest since World War II.' Trump said the ceasefire would include 'a suspension of all kinetic activity, and also a p…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"5fd83d7f-2784-4d2f-95a7-ccbb1d7faf0e","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:300:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Calls Russia-Ukraine Ceasefire 'Beginning of the End' After Putin and Zelenskyy Accept His Three-Day Truce","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.ibtimes.co.uk/trump-announces-three-day-ceasefire-russia-ukraine-1795880","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:300:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T01:09:55.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T20:45:49.000Z","description":"President Donald Trump says the leaders of Russia and Ukraine have agreed to his request for a three-day ceasefire and an exchange of prisoners","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"624b0219-34fa-492a-a2b0-9e8881187169","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:1:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump says Russia, Ukraine agree to his request for three-day ceasefire, prisoner swap","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/russia-ukraine-three-day-ceasefire-prisoner-swap-donald-trump-victory-day/article70957018.ece","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:1:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T23:24:06.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T20:43:07.000Z","description":"As of Saturday, a three-day ceasefire will apply between Ukraine and Russia. US President Donald Trump just announced on his platform \"Truth Social.\" Prisoners will also be exchanged. Selenskyj and Putin's foreign policy advisor confirmed the announcement. US President Donald Trump, according to his own statements, convinced Russia and Ukraine of a three-day ceasefire from tomorrow, which will include the suspension of all fighting and the excha…","originalDescription":"Ab Samstag soll zwischen der Ukraine und Russland ein dreitägiger Waffenstillstand gelten. Das teilte US-Präsident Donald Trump soeben auf seiner Plattform „Truth Social“ mit. Außerdem sollen Gefangene ausgetauscht werden. Selenskyj und ein außenpolitischer Berater Putins bestätigten die Verkündung. US-Präsident Donald Trump hat nach eigenen Angaben Russland und die Ukraine von einer ab dem morgigen Samstag geltenden dreitägigen Waffenruhe überz…","lang":"de","paywall":"no","refId":"124d0a49-0acb-4df9-925c-d5095144396d","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:32:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Ukraine: Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire","originalTitle":"Ukraine: Trump kündigt dreitägige Waffenruhe an","url":"https://www.krone.at/4134982","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:32:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T23:26:42.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T20:30:26.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump takes to social media to announce a three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine from May 9 to 11.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"4cba90f6-ca17-446c-98c6-c3c1412e7c45","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:22:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Ukraine and Russia agree to three-day ceasefire, Trump says","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.abc.net.au/news/2026-05-09/trump-announces-ceasefire-between-ukraine-and-russia/106661254","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:22:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T21:07:12.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T20:24:39.000Z","description":"US president says ceasefire will include suspension of all ‘kinetic activity’ and an exchange of prisoners.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"yes","refId":"f9694a92-1c58-4356-bcb9-58cef70c4981","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:18:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Beginning of the end? Trump announces 3-day Russia-Ukraine ceasefire deal","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.scmp.com/news/world/europe/article/3352962/trump-announces-three-day-ceasefire-between-russia-and-ukraine","wireStoryId":"6acdabf3-cd6c-4877-a068-aff0968920c0","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:18:sourceInfo","wireStories":[{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T02:52:47.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T23:47:16.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump announced a three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia, beginning Saturday, an agreement confirmed by both warring parties. Moscow had previously announced a unilateral truce to coincide with Russia's commemorations of Victory Day over Nazi Germany in World War II on May 9, but the two countries clashed in recent hours.","originalDescription":"El presidente estadounidense Donald Trump anunció un alto al fuego de tres días a partir del sábado entre Ucrania y Rusia, un acuerdo que fue confirmado por ambas partes beligerantes. \n\tMoscú ya había anunciado previamente una tregua unilateral con motivo de las conmemoraciones rusas del Día de la Victoria sobre la Alemania nazi en la Segunda Guerra Mundial, el 9 de mayo, pero ambos países se enfrentaron en las últimas horas.","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"174fb046-5bb1-48cd-aff6-fac79c2da903","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:208:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces 3-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"Trump anuncia alto al fuego de 3 días entre Rusia y Ucrania","url":"https://www.lostiempos.com/actualidad/mundo/20260508/trump-anuncia-alto-al-fuego-3-dias-rusia-ucrania","wireStoryId":"6acdabf3-cd6c-4877-a068-aff0968920c0","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:208:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:28:34.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:13:04.000Z","description":"\"The Celebration in Russia is for Victory Day, but, likewise, in Ukraine, because they were also a big part and factor of World War II. This Ceasefire will include a suspension of all kinetic activity, and also a prison swap of 1,000 prisoners from each Country.\"","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"7bb4c163-f5bb-4682-89c6-1b825769711d","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:287:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces 3-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://kyivindependent.com/breaking-trump-announces-3-day-ceasefire-between-russia-and-ukraine/","wireStoryId":"6acdabf3-cd6c-4877-a068-aff0968920c0","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:287:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false}]},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T09:01:23.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T20:19:38.000Z","description":"President Donald Trump said Friday that the leaders of Russia and Ukraine have agreed to his request for a three-day ceasefire and an exchange of prisoners, adding that such a halt to hostilities could be the “beginning of the end” of the long war between them.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"e96dfde1-9637-4bfe-bb52-7f39956f500d","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:404:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"President Trump says Russia & Ukraine have agreed to his request for 3-day ceasefire, prisoner swap","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.wpxi.com/news/world/president-trump-says-russia-ukraine-have-agreed-request-3-day-ceasefire-prisoner-swap/S7J3PBT5N5G53H2TAH5FZMKX4I/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:404:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T17:24:09.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T20:18:04.000Z","description":"Donald Trump has announced a three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"yes","refId":"81b3f16d-657d-4d20-a99b-77428200aef9","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:13:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Russia and Ukraine have agreed three-day ceasefire, says Donald Trump","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.independent.ie/world-news/europe/russia-and-ukraine-have-agreed-three-day-ceasefire-says-donald-trump/a1916240545.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:13:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:36:33.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T20:14:54.000Z","description":"Both Russia and Ukraine stated on Friday evening that they have agreed to a three-day ceasefire, which was announced earlier in the evening by…","original