on":"Victory Day is a holiday that commemorates the victory of the Soviet Union over Nazi Germany in 1945","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"b6943f86-dc10-4030-a808-0219ebc3fd23","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:28:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces Ukraine-Russia ceasefire as he hints 'close to end of war'","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.walesonline.co.uk/news/world-news/trump-announces-ukraine-russia-ceasefire-33916601","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:28:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T23:23:34.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:52:28.000Z","description":"President Trump has called for a three-day ceasefire in the ongoing Russia-Ukraine conflict. This initiative aims to foster negotiations and features a significant prisoner exchange between the two nations. The post Trump Proposes Temporary Ceasefire in Ukraine-Russia Conflict appeared first on News Addicts.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"93e76eca-aec9-47ac-a7ec-00e638e828a4","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:482:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Proposes Temporary Ceasefire in Ukraine-Russia Conflict","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://newsaddicts.com/trump-proposes-temporary-ceasefire-in-ukraine-russia-conflict/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:482:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T21:31:49.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:52:28.000Z","description":"President Donald Trump announced a short-term ceasefire in the Russia-Ukraine war, saying the sides will pause fighting for three days as negotiations continue. In a Truth Social post Friday, Trump said the ceasefire will run from May 9 through May 11, timed to mark the end of World War II for Russia. He said the pause will include a suspension “of all kinetic activity” and a prisoner swap involving 1,000 prisoners from each country. “Hopefully,…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"e00f3ff9-485b-43fe-ab20-f969dfcf2566","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:451:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"JUST IN: Trump Announces Breakthrough In Russia-Ukraine War","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://trendingpoliticsnews.com/just-in-trump-announces-breakthrough-in-russia-ukraine-war-trin/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:451:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:50:24.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:48:41.000Z","description":"US President Trump announced the start of a three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine on Saturday.","originalDescription":"US-Präsident Trump hat für Samstag den Beginn einer dreitägigen Waffenruhe zwischen Russland und der Ukraine angekündet.","lang":"de","paywall":"no","refId":"fbed2fa1-0eac-45d9-bf14-1fcc242b81a3","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:190:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Ukraine War - Three-Day Ceasefire Agreed","originalTitle":"Ukraine-Krieg - Dreitägige Waffenruhe vereinbart","url":"https://www.deutschlandfunk.de/dreitaegige-waffenruhe-vereinbart-100.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:190:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:50:05.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:46:39.000Z","description":"In what feels like the first big development in the Russia-Ukraine war for quite some time, President Trump just announced a 3-day ceasefire. The ceasefire will take place May 9-11 while both nations celebrate the Soviet Union's victory in WWII.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"5e430a71-98ab-48de-a682-4f8326cbc101","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:390:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"President Trump Announces Surprise Ceasefire Between Russia & Ukraine","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://wltreport.com/2026/05/08/president-trump-announces-surprise-ceasefire-between-russia-ukraine/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:390:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T03:15:15.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:45:47.000Z","description":"The president said he facilitated the deal, which includes a prisoner swap, and Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy quickly signaled his support. But past ceasefires have crumbled.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"f26b8ab8-b6c4-4d1e-b3a9-6d58f909e502","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:187:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump says there will be 3-day ceasefire in Russia-Ukraine war","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.politico.com/news/2026/05/08/russia-ukraine-war-trump-ceasefire-00912463?utm_source=RSS_Feed&utm_medium=RSS&utm_campaign=RSS_Syndication","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:187:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T21:06:23.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:42:31.000Z","description":"","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"sometimes","refId":"ec90e0c3-926d-4817-800c-04c37552e261","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:2:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia with prisoner swap","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.independent.co.uk/bulletin/news/ukraine-russia-ceasefire-trump-zelensky-putin-b2973332.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:2:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T01:36:59.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:39:07.000Z","description":"President Trump announced on Truth Social that Russia and Ukraine have agreed to a three-day ceasefire. “I am pleased to announce that there will be a THREE DAY CEASEFIRE (May 9th, 10th, and 11th) in the War between Russia and Ukraine. The Celebration in Russia is for Victory Day but, likewise, in Ukraine, because they were also a big part and factor of World War II,” Trump wrote. “This Ceasefire will include a suspension of all kinetic activity…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"bb56e560-d64e-45a2-8aaf-c7f2a53ca8cc","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:395:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire for Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://americanfaith.com/trump-announces-three-day-ceasefire-for-russia-and-ukraine/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:395:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T01:19:03.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:38:00.000Z","description":"In the Russian war of aggression, the weapons should remain silent from 9 to 11 May. That is what US President Trump announces. Thus, the warring parties have also agreed on an exchange of prisoners.","originalDescription":"Im russischen Angriffskrieg sollen die Waffen vom 9. bis zum 11. Mai schweigen. Das gibt US-Präsident Trump bekannt. Auch auf einen Gefangenenaustausch haben sich die Kriegsparteien demnach geeinigt.","lang":"de","paywall":"yes","refId":"46a0b952-da4b-45b9-b8bd-e0c5df7ee560","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:75:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Ukraine-Russia War: Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire – Selensky and Trump Confirm","originalTitle":"Ukraine-Russland-Krieg: Trump verkündet dreitägige Waffenruhe – Selenskyj und Trump bestätigen","url":"https://www.spiegel.de/ausland/ukraine-russland-krieg-donald-trump-verkuendet-dreitaegige-waffenruhe-wolodymyr-selenskyj-und-kreml-bestaetigen-a-59635356-86c1-4e72-9d7a-a0e85c70e5f0","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:75:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T21:29:21.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:35:16.000Z","description":"President Donald Trump said Friday that the leaders of Russia and Ukraine have agreed to his request for a three-day ceasefire.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"3613680b-f5eb-46a2-8d1c-c9f2242d6255","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:262:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Russia, Ukraine agree to 3-day ceasefire, Trump says","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.wcax.com/2026/05/08/russia-ukraine-agree-3-day-ceasefire-trump-says/","wireStoryId":"33fd8d85-7ce6-4bf7-92d3-83bffcd1d0f0","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:262:sourceInfo","wireStories":[{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T10:07:14.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:35:16.000Z","description":"President Donald Trump said Friday that the leaders of Russia and Ukraine have agreed to his request for a three-day ceasefire.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"a5f4b91a-70c7-4150-868a-34287c13c4a7","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:498:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Russia, Ukraine agree to 3-day ceasefire, Trump says","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.walb.com/2026/05/08/russia-ukraine-agree-3-day-ceasefire-trump-says/","wireStoryId":"33fd8d85-7ce6-4bf7-92d3-83bffcd1d0f0","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:4