rops:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:296:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump says Russia and Ukraine have agreed to request for a three-day ceasefire","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.breakingnews.ie/world/trump-says-russia-and-ukraine-have-agreed-to-request-for-a-three-day-ceasefire-1897460.html","wireStoryId":"8d3b92bb-4324-4e15-b06e-49d9d7fa7664","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:296:sourceInfo","wireStories":[{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:13:16.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:34:48.000Z","description":"","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"1ee4db38-6077-438b-a956-705f1527c21f","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:243:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump says Russia and Ukraine have agreed to request for a three-day ceasefire","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.belfasttelegraph.co.uk/news/world-news/trump-says-russia-and-ukraine-have-agreed-to-request-for-a-three-day-ceasefire/a/151279708.html","wireStoryId":"8d3b92bb-4324-4e15-b06e-49d9d7fa7664","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:243:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false}]},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:47:18.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:32:11.000Z","description":"‘Red Square is less important to us than the lives of Ukrainian prisoners who can be brought home,’ Ukraine’s president says.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"yes","refId":"66f9afe9-950f-478a-bb5c-410123834096","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:314:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire, Prisoner Swap Between Russian and Ukraine","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.nysun.com/article/trump-announced-three-day-ceasefire-prisoner-swap-between-russian-and-ukraine","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:314:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:25:41.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:31:29.000Z","description":"Shafaq News - Moscow/Kyiv: Russia and Ukraine announced on Friday their acceptance of US President Donald Trump's initiative for a ceasefire and prisoner exchange between the two sides. Russian presidential aide Yuri Ushakov told reporters that Russia had agreed to Trump's initiative for a truce from May 9 to 11 and a prisoner exchange with Kyiv on a \"one thousand for one thousand\" basis. Ushakov added, \"This initiative follows the recent conver…","originalDescription":"شفق نيوز- موسكو/ كييف أعلنت روسيا وأوكرانيا، يوم الجمعة، موافقتهما على مبادرة الرئيس الأميركي دونالد ترمب لوقف إطلاق النار وتبادل الأسرى بين الجانبين. وقال مساعد الرئيس الروسي، يوري أوشاكوف، للصحفيين، إن روسيا وافقت على مبادرة ترمب بشأن الهدنة من 9 إلى 11 أيار/ مايو الجاري وإجراء تبادل للأسرى مع كييف وفق صيغة \"ألف مقابل ألف\" وأضاف أوشاكوف: \"تأتي هذه المبادرة في أعقاب المحادثة الأخيرة بين بوتين وترمب، كانت الولايات المتحدة على اتصال مع كييف خلال …","lang":"ar","paywall":"no","refId":"bf6c397a-80d6-4103-bf41-9651a2466ffa","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:380:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Russia and Ukraine Agree to Trump's Truce","originalTitle":"روسيا وأوكرانيا توافقان على هدنة ترمب","url":"https://shafaq.com/ar/%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%85%D9%86%D8%B7%D9%82%D8%A9-%D9%88%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B9%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%85/%D8%B1%D9%88%D8%B3%D9%8A%D8%A7-%D9%88-%D9%88%D9%83%D8%B1%D8%A7%D9%86%D9%8A%D8%A7-%D8%AA%D9%88%D8%A7%D9%81%D9%82%D8%A7%D9%86-%D8%B9%D9%84%D9%89-%D9%87%D8%AF%D9%86%D8%A9-%D8%AA%D8%B1%D9%85%D8%A8","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:380:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T10:17:55.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:30:28.000Z","description":"The three-day truce, starting from Saturday, will also include a mutual swap of 1,000 prisoners each, US President Trump says.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"a0eb14f6-7556-4e16-b3ce-156537646d77","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:420:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces temporary Russia-Ukraine ceasefire, both sides confirm","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.trtworld.com/article/558d1b739cb9","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:420:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T15:52:29.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:26:26.000Z","description":"A ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine must last three days, from 9 to 11 May. Accepted at the request of Washington, the truce provides for the exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each camp.","originalDescription":"Un cessez-le-feu entre la Russie et l’Ukraine doit durer trois jours, du 9 au 11 mai. Acceptée à la demande de Washington, la trêve prévoit l’échange de 1 000 prisonniers de chaque camp.","lang":"fr","paywall":"no","refId":"6eaf077f-5e1c-4cda-805b-c685c986127f","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:330:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"War in Ukraine: It Will Take Place From May 9 to 11, What Does the Cease-Fire Announced by US President Trump Between Moscow and Kyiv Mean?","originalTitle":"Guerre en Ukraine : il aura lieu du 9 au 11 mai, que prévoit le cessez-le-feu annoncé par le président américain Trump entre Moscou et Kyiv ?","url":"https://www.lindependant.fr/2026/05/08/guerre-en-ukraine-il-aura-lieu-du-9-au-11-mai-que-prevoit-le-cessez-le-feu-annonce-par-le-president-americain-trump-entre-moscou-et-kyiv-13362491.php","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:330:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T21:43:26.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:25:48.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump on Friday announced that Russia and Ukraine have agreed to a 3-day ceasefire running from May 9 to May 11. According to the announcement made, the particular window will also see both nations exchange 1000 prisoners each. The declaration, made on Trump's","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"3d579fe2-b8a9-4799-a361-ca3de3c3fe6a","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:320:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces 3-Day Russia-Ukraine Ceasefire As Victory Day Truce Opens Door For 2000 Prisoner Swap","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.republicworld.com/world-news/trump-announces-3-day-russia-ukraine-ceasefire-as-victory-day-truce-opens-door-for-2000-prisoner-swap-2026-05-08-123513","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:320:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T06:19:01.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:25:39.000Z","description":"Ukraine and Russia have agreed in principle to conduct a 1,000-for-1,000 prisoner exchange alongside a temporary ceasefire from 9–11 May, according to statements from Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy and US President Donald Trump. Zelenskyy said the agreement was reached through negotiations mediated by the United States and linked the arrangement to humanitarian priorities surrounding the return of Ukrainian prisoners of war. Zelenskyy s…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"93278157-2e94-4daa-93f9-4bf9800a1e6a","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:518:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Ukraine and Russia agree to three-day Victory Day ceasefire tied to large-scale POW exchange","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://euromaidanpress.com/2026/05/08/ukraine-and-russia-agree-to-three-day-victory-day-ceasefire/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:518:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:14:42.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:20:55.000Z","description":"Washington, May 8 (SANA)    U.S. President Donald Trump announced on Friday that a three-day ceasefire agreement has been reached between Russia and Ukraine, scheduled to begin on May 9 and conclude on May 11. In a statement via the “Truth Social” platform, Trump clarified that the ceasefire entails the suspension of all military operations. He further revealed that the deal includes a significant exchange of 1,000 prisoners from both sides, not…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"fd1a1899-193c-4e65-a075-d245865c3636","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:334:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces three-day Russia-Ukraine ceasefire and prisoner exchange agreement","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://sana.sy/en/international/2315439/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:334:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:36:37.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:20:48.000Z","description":"The old Trump peace-mojo is back in the headlines.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"51d7c030-53eb-4554-a7eb-3dcb72a12bf1","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:98:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"PEACEMAKER: Trump Announces Three Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine To Celebrate 'Victory Day'","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.thegatewaypundit.com/2026/05/peacemaker-trump-announces-three-day-ceasefire-between-russia/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:98:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-