sland_aid-147965795","wireStoryId":"2e98c327-11bb-4bb0-b492-5a92f5036f61","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:367:sourceInfo","wireStories":[{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T02:17:25.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:11:41.000Z","description":"In the Ukraine war, there has been no significant progress. Now, among other things, the US President announces a temporary ceasefire.","originalDescription":"Im Ukraine-Krieg gab es zuletzt keine merklichen Fortschritte. Nun verkündet der US-Präsident unter anderem eine temporäre Waffenruhe.","lang":"de","paywall":"no","refId":"7cfbc19b-40a2-4b35-8111-c737aeeb4767","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:144:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Ukraine War: Trump: Three-Day Ceasefire Between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":"Ukraine-Krieg: Trump: Dreitägige Waffenruhe zwischen Ukraine und Russland","url":"https://www.handelsblatt.com/politik/international/ukraine-krieg-trump-dreitaegige-waffenruhe-zwischen-ukraine-und-russland/100223063.html","wireStoryId":"2e98c327-11bb-4bb0-b492-5a92f5036f61","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:144:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false}]},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T01:28:16.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:11:00.000Z","description":"Trump announced on social media that the ceasefire would run Saturday through Monday.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"116ec1e3-c77d-4213-b1db-1fb9d1db0b3d","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:329:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump says Russia and Ukraine have agreed to a 3-day ceasefire","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.abc12.com/news/international/trump-says-russia-and-ukraine-have-agreed-to-a-3-day-ceasefire/article_2fc18fbf-16c1-5e99-a749-d05c6373b34a.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:329:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T09:52:26.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:09:30.000Z","description":"The announcement of the US President comes at a time when the Kremlin unilaterally declared a suspension of hostilities on the occasion of the celebration of the 1945 victory. On Friday, Ukraine reported more than 800 shots of Russian drones, while Russia claims to have destroyed more than 260 Ukrainian sides.","originalDescription":"L’annonce du président américain intervient alors que le Kremlin avait déclaré unilatéralement une suspension des hostilités à l’occasion de la célébration de la victoire de 1945. Ce vendredi, l’Ukraine a rapporté plus de 800 tirs de drones russes, tandis que la Russie dit en avoir détruit plus de 260 côté ukrainiens.","lang":"fr","paywall":"yes","refId":"52b6c771-68de-4431-aa98-64ca8295de26","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:122:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"War in Ukraine: After Moscow, Trump Announces a Cease-Fire, Starting on Saturday","originalTitle":"Guerre en Ukraine : après Moscou, Trump annonce à son tour un cessez-le-feu, à partir de samedi","url":"https://www.liberation.fr/international/europe/ukraine-zelensky-accuse-moscou-de-ne-pas-respecter-la-treve-la-russie-affirme-quelle-ne-fait-que-riposter-20260508_52HBTD4KA5CU3PGC2V5GXOZY34/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:122:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:39:47.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:09:17.000Z","description":"Victory Day is a holiday that commemorates the victory of the Soviet Union over Nazi Germany in 1945","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"678a14a8-a53f-4218-8d3b-94187522c6b4","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:206:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump 'end is near' message as Ukraine and Russia three-day ceasefire announced","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.cornwalllive.com/news/uk-world-news/trump-end-near-message-ukraine-10957068","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:206:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T00:50:06.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:08:07.000Z","description":"Ceasefire U.S. helped negotiate in effort to end war will last from Saturday to Monday","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"yes","refId":"24fc19b3-6043-4c72-9158-5d901660a001","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:61:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Russia, Ukraine agree to three-day ceasefire and prisoner exchange","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-russia-ukraine-agree-to-three-day-ceasefire-and-prisoner-exchange/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:61:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:33:13.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:07:52.000Z","description":"The proposals that Ukraine and Russia made earlier this week for a temporary ceasefire failed. Now Trump is making an attempt with a proposal of his own.","originalDescription":"De voorstellen die Oekraïne en Rusland eerder deze week deden voor een tijdelijk staakt-het-vuren, zijn mislukt. Nu doet Trump een poging met een eigen voorstel.","lang":"nl","paywall":"no","refId":"cc11939f-1671-4331-9c2a-3f9dfac35851","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:202:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"At Trump's Request, a Three-Day Ceasefire Between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":"Op Trumps verzoek driedaags bestand tussen Oekraïne en Rusland","url":"https://nos.nl/artikel/2613630-op-trumps-verzoek-driedaags-bestand-tussen-oekraine-en-rusland","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:202:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:11:30.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:07:25.000Z","description":"President Donald Trump announced on social media that the ceasefire would run Saturday through Monday. Saturday is Victory Day in Russia, a holiday that commemorates its victory over Nazi Germany 81 years ago in World War II.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"sometimes","refId":"84b8e20a-87e9-4fde-b0f7-c8d58488dcef","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:171:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump says Russia and Ukraine have agreed to his request for a 3-day ceasefire, prisoner swap","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/trump-says-russia-and-ukraine-have-agreed-to-his-request-for-a-3-day-ceasefire-prisoner-swap","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:171:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T21:56:41.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:05:49.000Z","description":"\"I am pleased to announce that there will be a three-day ceasefire (May 9, 10 and 11) in the war between Russia and Ukraine,\" Donald Trump unexpectedly announced on his social media page. According to the American president, May 9 is very important for the Russians, who are celebrating Victory Day, and for Ukraine no less, since \"they also played a significant role in World War II.\" According to Trump, not only will there be no military operatio…","originalDescription":"„Örömmel jelentem be, hogy háromnapos tűzszünet lesz (május 9-én, 10-én és 11-én) az Oroszország és Ukrajna közötti háborúban” – közölte váratlanul Donald Trump a közösségi oldalán. Az amerikai elnök szerint május 9-e nagyon fontos az oroszok számára, akik a győzelem napját ünneplik, és Ukrajna számára nemkülönben, hiszen „ők is jelentős szerepet játszottak a második világháborúban”.Trump szerint nemcsak katonai műveletek nem lesznek ebben az id…","lang":"hu","paywall":"no","refId":"3a1c0635-cb45-4040-980e-8ed3a34ca6c6","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:235:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Donald Trump Says There Will Be a Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine Between May 9 and 11","originalTitle":"Donald Trump szerint igenis lesz orosz–ukrán tűzszünet, mégpedig május 9. és 11. között","url":"https://444.hu/2026/05/08/donald-trump-szerint-igenis-lesz-oroszukran-tuzszunet-megpedig-majus-9-es-11-kozott","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:235:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:12:38.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:04:47.000Z","description":"Trump says Russia and Ukraine will observe a three-day ceasefire from May 9 to May 11, including a halt in fighting and a prisoner swap.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"e30e2d43-df54-4e92-9a31-3cc6405ebc6d","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:432:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces Russia-Ukraine ceasefire","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.pakistantoday.com.pk/2026/05/09/trump-announces-three-day-russia-ukraine-ceasefire-from-may-9","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:432:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:17:56.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:02:16.000Z","description":"President Donald Trump says the leaders of Russia and Ukraine have agreed to his request for a three-day ceasefire and an exchange of prisoners. Trump posted Friday that it could be the “beginning of the end” of the long war…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"788c3238-d0c1-4499-a7ae-16622304955f","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:401:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"The Latest: Trump says a 3-day Russia-Ukraine ceasefire may be 'beginning of the end'","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.thedailystar.com/news/national/the-latest-trump-says-a-3-day-russia-ukraine-ceasefire-may-be-beginning-of-the/article_51ca40a3-e00b-539a-8c16-c7a8cc988230.html","wireStoryId":"1e7c1b8d-6dd8-4ed3-ba06-33108b9a36ca","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:401:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:12:19.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:02:10.000Z","description":"Russia and Ukraine confirmed on Friday that they had agreed to a U.S.-brokered three-day ceasefire that will run from May 9 to May 11, and U.S. President Donald Trump said he hoped it ‌would be extended.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"ffe5cab6-97db-48fb-8713-7ee45f312126","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:4:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Russia and Ukraine agree to a 3-day ceasefire and a prisoner swap","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.cbc.ca/news/world/russia-ukraine-ceasefire-9.7193061","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:4:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:12:23.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:00:26.000Z","description":"The president announced on social media that the cease-fire would run Saturday through Monday.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"yes","refId":"e6fbb0c0-33f9-4224-a4dc-21bb94ba9244","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:231:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces a 3-day Russia-Ukraine cease-fire. Follow live updates. - The Boston Globe","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.bostonglobe.com/2026/05/08/nation/trump-presidency-live-updates/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:231:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T00:34:58.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:00:00.000Z","description":"President Donald Trump says the leaders of Russia and Ukraine have agreed to his request for a three-day ceasefire and an exchange of prisoners. Trump said Friday that such a halt to hostilities could be the “beginning of the end”…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"6f38b2c5-21bc-49a3-9744-f2e4cc9566d8","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:286:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump says Russia, Ukraine have agreed to his request for a 3-day ceasefire and a prisoner swap","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.tribdem.com/news/latest_news/trump-says-russia-ukraine-have-agreed-to-his-request-for-a-3-day-ceasefire-and/article_eaad4a85-11bb-5314-b1bb-f44482ebc528.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:286:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:05:08.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:58:27.000Z","description":"The President of the United States, Donald Trump, announced this Friday a temporary cease-fire between Russia and Ukraine, to take effect between 9 and 11 May. The declaration was made through the social network Truth Social, where the American leader stated that all military activities will be suspended during this period. According to Trump, the agreement also includes the exchange of a thousand prisoners of war between the two countries, in a…","originalDescription":"O presidente dos Estados Unidos, Donald Trump, anunciou esta sexta-feira um cessar-fogo temporário entre a Rússia e a Ucrânia, a vigorar entre os dias 9 e 11 de maio. A declaração foi feita através da rede social Truth Social, onde o líder norte-americano afirmou que todas as atividades militares serão suspensas durante este período. Segundo Trump, o acordo inclui também a troca de mil prisioneiros de guerra entre os dois países, num gesto que p…","lang":"pt","paywall":"no","refId":"8a2a218a-d546-4ada-b443-e403b9502212","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:111:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire in Ukraine and Exchange of Prisoners of War","originalTitle":"Trump anuncia cessar-fogo de três dias na Ucrânia e troca de prisioneiros de guerra","url":"https://jornaleconomico.sapo.pt/?p=1406072","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:111:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T23:20:16.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:55:55.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump has announced a three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia. The temporary halt in hostilities is scheduled to take place from May 9 to May 11. Trump stated that the arrangement includes a total cessation of all combat operations. It also involves the exchange of 1,000 prisoners of war from each side. \nWe bring you stories from the ground. Your support keeps our team in the field. DONATE NOW \"This truce will include …","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"0fd27346-ff7e-4da0-bda9-cebed11561c9","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:448:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire and POW Exchange Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://united24media.com/war-in-ukraine/trump-announces-three-day-ceasefire-and-pow-exchange-between-russia-and-ukraine-18620","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:448:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:14:04.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:55:55.000Z","description":"A three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia will begin on Saturday and continue through Monday, US President Donald Trump wrote on his social media site, Truth Social. The initiative to ...","originalDescription":"Lørdag begynder en tre dage lang våbenhvile mellem Ukraine og Rusland, som fortsætter til og med mandag. Det skriver USA’s præsident, Donald Trump, på sit sociale medie, Truth Social. Initiativet til ...","lang":"da","paywall":"yes","refId":"3a43615c-449a-4f95-a051-6158e9c082ed","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:246:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Ukraine and Russia Agree to Three-Day Ceasefire After Trump Proposal","originalTitle":"Ukraine og Rusland aftaler tre dages våbenhvile efter udspil fra Trump","url":"https://jyllands-posten.dk/international/ECE19281797/ukraine-og-rusland-aftaler-tre-dages-vaabenhvile-efter-udspil-fra-trump/","wireStoryId":"1284b29b-5d08-4ac2-ae7e-81aea2a8a510","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:246:sourceInfo","wireStories":[{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:37:15.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:10:49.000Z","description":"The armistice coincides with Victory Day in Russia, which marks the victory over Nazi Germany in World War II.","originalDescription":"Våbenhvile falder sammen med sejrsdagen i Rusland, hvor sejren over Nazityskland i Anden Verdenskrig markeres.","lang":"da","paywall":"no","refId":"f61e2e74-b193-40cb-9b04-c9c4bc461960","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:238:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Ukraine and Russia Agree to Three-Day Ceasefire After Trump Proposal","originalTitle":"Ukraine og Rusland aftaler tre dages våbenhvile efter udspil fra Trump","url":"https://www.berlingske.dk/internationalt/ukraine-og-rusland-aftaler-tre-dages-vaabenhvile-efter-udspil-fra-trump","wireStoryId":"1284b29b-5d08-4ac2-ae7e-81aea2a8a510","sourceInfo":"$86:props