$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:371:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false}]},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:30:10.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:55:23.000Z","description":"It happens after Moscow and Kiev cross-reported the breach of the unilateral ceasefire declared by Putin.Zelenski's instant reaction: ordered not to attack the Red Square at the Russian celebration of Victory Day.","originalDescription":"Ocurre luego de que Moscú y Kiev denunciaran de forma cruzada el incumplimiento del cese al fuego unilateral declarado por Putin.Reacción instantánea de Zelenski: ordenó no atacar la Plaza Roja en la celebración rusa del Día de la Victoria.","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"2e4bec8e-ef66-4429-bb41-ad5f9f7f0b9e","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:92:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Donald Trump Now Announces a Three-Day Truce in the War Between Russia and Ukraine: \"I Asked for It Myself\"","originalTitle":"Ahora Donald Trump anuncia una tregua de tres días en la guerra entre Rusia y Ucrania: \"Lo pedí yo mismo\"","url":"https://www.clarin.com/mundo/ahora-donald-trump-anuncia-tregua-dias-guerra-rusia-ucrania-pedi-mismo_0_H9e6jj1lbF.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:92:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T11:14:11.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:55:00.000Z","description":"Russia agreed to the initiative of US President Donald Trump on a truce from May 9 to 11. This was stated by Presidential aide Yuri Ushakov.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"3d96ada4-f193-4652-8531-d36685b1265f","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:324:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Russia agreed to a truce from May 9 to May 11","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://eadaily.com/en/news/2026/05/08/russia-agreed-to-a-truce-from-may-9-to-may-11-ushakov","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:324:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:04:54.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:53:38.000Z","description":"U.S. President Donald Trump announced Friday a three-day ceasefire, 9, 10 and 11 May, on the occasion of Victory Day after his Russian and Ukrainian counterparts, Vladimir Putin and Volodimir Zelenski, have accepted the proposal.\"This ceasefire will include the suspension of all military activity and an exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each country. I made this request directly and I greatly appreciate your acceptance by President Vladimir Putin…","originalDescription":"El presidente de Estados Unidos, Donald Trump, ha anunciado este viernes un alto el fuego de tres días, 9, 10 y 11 de mayo, con motivo del Día de Victoria después de que sus homólogos ruso y ucraniano, Vladimir Putin y Volodimir Zelenski, hayan aceptado la propuesta.\"Este alto el fuego incluirá la suspensión de toda actividad militar y un intercambio de 1.000 prisioneros de cada país. Esta solicitud la hice directamente yo y agradezco enormement…","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"9853f677-31d0-47c0-8640-4a232c6d0a96","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:96:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine on Victory Day · Global Voices","originalTitle":"Trump anuncia un alto el fuego de tres días entre Rusia y Ucrania con motivo del Día de la Victoria","url":"https://www.20minutos.es/internacional/donald-trump-anuncia-alto-fuego-tres-dias-entre-rusia-ucrania-motivo-dia-victoria_6968267_0.html","wireStoryId":"f06b658a-3fa8-4b94-a97d-607a80ee413b","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:96:sourceInfo","wireStories":[{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T22:49:18.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:19:40.000Z","description":"U.S. President Donald Trump announced Friday a three-day ceasefire, 9, 10 and 11 May, on the occasion of Victoria Day after his Russian and Ukrainian counterparts, Vladimir Putin and Volodymyr Zelensky, accepted the proposal. “This ceasefire will include the suspension of all military activity and an exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each country. I made this request directly and I greatly appreciate your acceptance by President Vladimir Putin an…","originalDescription":"El presidente de Estados Unidos, Donald Trump, ha anunciado este viernes un alto el fuego de tres días, 9, 10 y 11 de mayo, con motivo del Día de Victoria después de que sus homólogos ruso y ucraniano, Vladimir Putin y Volodymyr Zelensky, hayan aceptado la propuesta.“Este alto el fuego incluirá la suspensión de toda actividad militar y un intercambio de 1.000 prisioneros de cada país. Esta solicitud la hice directamente yo y agradezco enormement…","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"b6bbebda-7aab-4065-9aa1-b1a81bc7ed9d","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:133:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine on Victory Day · Global Voices","originalTitle":"Trump anuncia un alto el fuego de tres días entre Rusia y Ucrania con motivo del Día de la Victoria","url":"https://www.latercera.com/mundo/noticia/trump-anuncia-un-alto-el-fuego-de-tres-dias-entre-rusia-y-ucrania-con-motivo-del-dia-de-la-victoria/","wireStoryId":"f06b658a-3fa8-4b94-a97d-607a80ee413b","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:133:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T00:21:33.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T23:12:49.000Z","description":"The agreement includes an exchange of prisoners between the parties ...","originalDescription":"El acuerdo incluye un intercambio de prisioneros entre las partes ...","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"421a19ba-459c-4be0-9d02-53f622dc72bb","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:261:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine on Victory Day · Global Voices","originalTitle":"​Trump anuncia un alto el fuego de tres días entre Rusia y Ucrania con motivo del Día de la Victoria","url":"https://www.diarioestrategia.cl/texto-diario/mostrar/5874793/trump-anuncia-alto-fuego-tres-dias-entre-rusia-ucrania-motivo-dia-victoria","wireStoryId":"f06b658a-3fa8-4b94-a97d-607a80ee413b","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:261:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false}]},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:05:39.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:53:35.000Z","description":"According to the US President, the ceasefire will start on Saturday. Ukrainian President Selensky confirmed Trump's statements.","originalDescription":"Laut Angaben des US-Präsidenten gilt die Feuerpause ab Samstag. Der ukrainische Präsident Selenskij bestätigte Trumps Aussagen.","lang":"de","paywall":"no","refId":"93ec31a1-9737-4ac1-b85d-6c627bdc8d61","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:95:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire in Ukraine","originalTitle":"Trump kündigt dreitägige Waffenruhe in der Ukraine an","url":"https://www.diepresse.com/23125830/trump-kuendigt-dreitaegige-waffenruhe-in-der-ukraine-an","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:95:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:30:28.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:52:23.000Z","description":"Donald Trump announced a three-day truce in the war between Russia and Ukraine on Friday, from May 9 to 11, coinciding with Victory Day, Russia's major commemoration of the defeat of Nazi Germany in World War II. The US president stated on his social media platform, Truth Social, that the ceasefire would include a suspension of all \"kinetic activity\" and an exchange of 1,000 prisoners of war for each side. According to Trump, the request was mad…","originalDescription":"Donald Trump anunció este viernes una tregua de tres días en la guerra entre Rusia y Ucrania, del 9 al 11 de mayo , coincidiendo con el Día de la Victoria, la gran conmemoración rusa de la derrota de la Alemania nazi en la Segunda Guerra Mundial. El presidente de Estados Unidos aseguró en su red Truth Social que el alto el fuego incluirá la suspensión de toda «actividad cinética» y un intercambio de 1.000 prisioneros por cada lado.Según Trump, l…","lang":"es","paywall":"yes","refId":"06798988-b0c7-487d-96a9-29af3c409ec9","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:88:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Truce in Ukraine for Russian Victory Day","originalTitle":"Trump anuncia una tregua de tres días en Ucrania para el Día de la Victoria rusa","url":"https://www.abc.es/internacional/trump-anuncia-tregua-tres-dias-ucrania-dia-20260508205218-nt.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:88:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:04:08.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:49:24.000Z","description":"The US president said 'end to conflict is near'","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"3401d3e4-092a-4194-a44e-e0990e05bce9","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:34:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Donald Trump announces three-day ceasefire in Ukraine","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.dailyrecord.co.uk/news/uk-world-news/donald-trump-announces-three-day-37132157","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:34:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:40:01.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:47:31.000Z","description":"Donald Trump announces a three-day ceasefire and a major prisoner exchange between Russia and Ukraine.","originalDescription":"Donald Trump kündigt eine dreitägige Feuerpause und einen großen Gefangenenaustausch zwischen Russland und der Ukraine an.","lang":"de","paywall":"yes","refId":"a7a553c6-3cdd-403c-9678-6c138c5f6913","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:221:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"For Russia's Victory Day: Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire in Ukraine","originalTitle":"Für Russlands „Tag des Sieges“-Feier: Trump verkündet 3-tägige Waffenruhe in der Ukraine","url":"https://www.bild.de/politik/ausland-und-internationales/fuer-russlands-tag-des-sieges-feier-trump-verkuendet-3-taegige-waffenruhe-in-der-ukraine-69fe27b17e3ff373d429eb94","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:221:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:13:51.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:46:52.000Z","description":"According to Trump, military operations will be completely suspended during the ceasefire that will last until Monday, and the two countries will also exchange thousands of prisoners of war.","originalDescription":"Trump szerint a hétfőig tartó tűzszünet alatt teljesen felfüggesztik a katonai műveleteket, emellett a két ország ezer-ezer hadifoglyot is kicserél.","lang":"hu","paywall":"no","refId":"e7348952-2187-4ca7-8690-f52ac89fb0d9","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:128:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Donald Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire Between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":"Háromnapos tűzszünetet jelentett be Donald Trump Ukrajna és Oroszország között","url":"https://telex.hu/kulfold/2026/05/08/haromnapos-tuzszunetet-jelentett-be-donald-trump-ukrajna-es-oroszorszag-kozott","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:128:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T23:07:59.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:46:26.000Z","description":"U.S. President Donald Trump announced a three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia starting Saturday.","originalDescription":"El presidente estadounidense Donald Trump anunció un alto el fuego de tres días entre Ucrania y Rusia a partir del sábado.","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"c0601555-8525-4336-8aab-94dd95dbbc7c","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:249:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Donald Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine · Global Voices","originalTitle":"Donald Trump anuncia un alto el fuego de tres días entre Rusia y Ucrania","url":"https://www.eluniverso.com/noticias/internacional/donald-trump-anuncia-un-alto-el-fuego-de-tres-dias-entre-rusia-y-ucrania-nota/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:249:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:57:05.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:46:05.000Z","description":"President Donald Trump of the United States announced a three-day cease-fire in the Russian-Ukraine war, which he posted on the Truth social network.","originalDescription":"Президент США Дональд Трамп заявил о трехдневном прекращении огня в российско-украинской войне. Соответствующий пост он опубликовал в соцсети Truth.","lang":"ru","paywall":"no","refId":"3264d2b5-6569-482d-8281-036e6d491047","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:289:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announced a Truce: Russia and Ukraine Will Not Fight From 9 to 11 May.","originalTitle":"Трамп объявил о перемирии: Россия и Украина не будут воевать с 9 по 11 мая. Киев и Москва это подтвердили","url":"https://meduza.io/news/2026/05/08/tramp-ob-yavil-o-peremirii-rossiya-i-ukraina-ne-budut-voevat-s-9-po-11-maya-utverzhdaet-on","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:289:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T22:24:25.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:46:00.000Z","description":"","originalDescription":null,"lang":"de","paywall":"yes","refId":"8e3a306c-e6b6-4f28-a0ab-99be680ec6b5","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:31:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump: Three-Day Ceasefire Between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":"Trump: Dreitägige Waffenruhe zwischen Ukraine und Russland","url":"https://www.sueddeutsche.de/politik/us-praesident-trump-dreitaegige-waffenruhe-zwischen-ukraine-und-russland-li.3480830","wireStoryId":"6d763828-20be-4ff7-be2d-ee08b01358da","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:31:sourceInfo","wireStories":[{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:44:47.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:17:47.000Z","description":"Trump: Three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia","originalDescription":"Trump: Dreitägige Waffenruhe zwischen Ukraine und Russland","lang":"de","paywall":"no","refId":"6bd999a7-01a4-4eb1-bcfb-90e7df8dd4af","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:177:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump: Three-Day Ceasefire Between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":"Trump: Dreitägige Waffenruhe zwischen Ukraine und Russland","url":"https://www.watson.ch/international/usa/840964490-trump-dreitaegige-waffenruhe-zwischen-ukraine-und-russland","wireStoryId":"6d763828-20be-4ff7-be2d-ee08b01358da","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:177:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T02:13:38.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:17:34.000Z","description":"According to US President Donald Trump, Russia and Ukraine have been convinced of a three-day ceasefire that will begin tomorrow, which will include the suspension of all fighting and the exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each side, Trump wrote on his platform Truth Social.","originalDescription":"US-Präsident Donald Trump hat nach eigenen Angaben Russland und die Ukraine von einer ab morgen geltenden dreitägigen Waffenruhe überzeugt. Diese werde die Aussetzung aller Kampfhandlungen sowie den Austausch von 1.000 Gefangenen jeder Seite umfassen, schrieb Trump auf seiner Plattform Truth Social.","lang":"de","paywall":"no","refId":"d19da7c4-e7bd-40ee-91f8-b8c43ff0da52","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:257:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump: Three-Day Ceasefire Between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":"Trump: Dreitägige Waffenruhe zwischen Ukraine und Russland","url":"https://www.onetz.de/deutschland-welt/trump-dreitaegige-waffenruhe-zwischen-ukraine-russland-id5366463.html","wireStoryId":"6d763828-20be-4ff7-be2d-ee08b01358da","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:257:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:16:46.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:51:29.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump has announced a three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia. The ceasefire is valid from tomorrow through Monday, according to Trump on Truth Social. He states that Russia and Ukraine have agreed to it.","originalDescription":"De Amerikaanse president Donald Trump heeft aangekondigd dat er een driedaags bestand komt tussen Oekraïne en Rusland. Het staakt-het-vuren geldt van morgen tot en met maandag, aldus Trump op Truth Social. Hij stelt dat Rusland en Oekraïne ermee hebben ingestemd.","lang":"nl","paywall":"no","refId":"799d0a5d-b40c-49bd-9e95-21d78729ec06","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:291:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump: Three-Day Ceasefire Between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":"Trump: driedaags staakt-het-vuren tussen Oekraïne en Rusland","url":"https://www.rtl.nl/nieuws/buitenland/artikel/5599417/trump-kondigt-driedaags-bestand-tussen-oekraine-en-rusland-aan","wireStoryId":"6d763828-20be-4ff7-be2d-ee08b01358da","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:291:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T22:29:23.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:58:00.000Z","description":"For years, Russia has waged a brutal war of aggression against Ukraine. All developments in struggles and negotiations are available in the news blog.","originalDescription":"Seit Jahren führt Russland einen brutalen Angriffskrieg gegen die Ukraine. Alle Entwicklungen zu Kämpfen und Verhandlungen gibt es im Newsblog.","lang":"de","paywall":"no","refId":"b3de670f-64b6-4f4b-80f5-7a432b9f0005","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:311:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump: Three-Day Ceasefire Between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":"Trump: Dreitägige Waffenruhe zwischen Ukraine und Russland","url":"https://www.augsburger-allgemeine.de/politik/ukraine-ticker-trump-dreitaegige-waffenruhe-zwischen-ukraine-und-russland-103025282","wireStoryId":"6d763828-20be-4ff7-be2d-ee08b01358da","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:311:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:45:01.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:16:11.000Z","description":"","originalDescription":null,"lang":"de","paywall":"no","refId":"666b2098-fcda-447d-b90e-539f87e9a435","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:335:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump: Three-Day Ceasefire Between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":"Trump: Dreitägige Waffenruhe zwischen Ukraine und Russland","url":"https://www.infranken.de/ueberregional/newsticker-national/eilmeldungen/trump-dreitaegige-waffenruhe-zwischen-ukraine-und-russland-art-6353417","wireStoryId":"6d763828-20be-4ff7-be2d-ee08b01358da","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:335:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:42:41.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:11:00.000Z","description":"In the Ukraine war, there has been no significant progress. Now, among other things, the US President announces a temporary ceasefire.","originalDescription":"Im Ukraine-Krieg gab es zuletzt keine merklichen Fortschritte. Nun verkündet der US-Präsident unter anderem eine temporäre Waffenruhe.","lang":"de","paywall":"sometimes","refId":"0c128961-3c84-4b15-a6fb-c2b5447b4f55","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:358:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump: Three-Day Ceasefire Between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":"Trump: Dreitägige Waffenruhe zwischen Ukraine und Russland","url":"https://www.wz.de/politik/ausland/trump-dreitaegige-waffenruhe-zwischen-ukraine-und-russland_aid-147965831","wireStoryId":"6d763828-20be-4ff7-be2d-ee08b01358da","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:358:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T11:46:29.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T21:28:02.000Z","description":"Kiev and the Kremlin have agreed to a ceasefire mediated by US President Trump. It has been valid from Saturday midnight to Monday inclusive.","originalDescription":"Kiew und der Kreml haben einer von US-Präsident Trump vermittelten Feuerpause zugestimmt. Sie gilt seit Samstag Mitternacht bis einschließlich Montag.","lang":"de","paywall":"no","refId":"8c8de75b-dce9-45c7-9d6f-ec5ef253ff4b","sortData":"$86:pro