ildren:0:props:articleSources:207:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T23:55:11.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:36:03.000Z","description":"The ceasefire, which Donald Trump said would last May 9 to 11, coincides with Russia’s Victory Day celebrations, the US president said in a social media post.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"sometimes","refId":"69e918f2-f445-42f6-b88e-8cf4b14b7948","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:223:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Russia, Ukraine agree to three-day ceasefire, says Trump","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.watoday.com.au/world/europe/russia-ukraine-agree-to-three-day-ceasefire-says-trump-20260509-p5zv8m.html","wireStoryId":"f0d686e7-3a3a-46df-bfb5-ab379bb1adf6","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:223:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false}]},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T22:24:45.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:35:01.000Z","description":"For years, Russia's Victory Day parade has symbolized the country's strength and military power, with a dazzling display of heavy military equipment and a stream of visiting dignitaries.","originalDescription":"Durante años, el desfile del Día de la Victoria de Rusia ha simbolizado la fuerza y el poder militar del país, con una deslumbrante exhibición de equipo militar pesado y una corriente de dignatarios visitantes.","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"6d51d0bb-33ac-4161-81a6-74761317852c","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:454:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"While Trump Announces a 3-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine, Putin Prepares a Low-Key Victory Parade","originalTitle":"Mientras Trump anuncia un alto el fuego de 3 días entre Rusia y Ucrania, Putin prepara un Desfile de la Victoria discreto","url":"https://www.wxow.com/news/spanish/mie