ady been asking for a truce to celebrate victory in World War II, but Ukraine wanted it to begin even sooner.","originalDescription":"Moscou já vinha pedindo trégua para celebrar vitória na Segunda Guerra, mas Ucrânia queria que ela começasse ainda mais cedo","lang":"pt","paywall":"yes","refId":"68a02507-5d40-409e-a950-91494596df0b","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:11:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine.","originalTitle":"Trump anuncia cessar-fogo de três dias entre Rússia e Ucrânia","url":"https://valor.globo.com/mundo/noticia/2026/05/08/trump-anuncia-cessar-fogo-de-trs-dias-entre-rssia-e-ucrnia.ghtml","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:11:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T14:22:59.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:28:00.000Z","description":"President Donald Trump said Friday that the leaders of Russia and Ukraine agreed to his proposal for a three-day cease-fire and a prisoner exchange amid ongoing efforts to ease the...","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"43aa3df5-d6e4-4dd2-a3ba-a5be889a2494","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:278:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump says Russia, Ukraine agree to 3-day cease-fire","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.dailysabah.com/world/europe/trump-says-russia-ukraine-agree-to-3-day-cease-fire","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:278:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T01:50:07.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:27:50.000Z","description":"It will take place between 9 and 11 May and includes suspending all attacks and an exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each country.","originalDescription":"Se producirá entre el 9 y 11 de mayo e incluye suspender todo