utual exchange of 1,000 prisoners each.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"5baab75a-86ba-40c8-8f07-33fc86064dc7","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:0:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Donald Trump announces three-day Ukraine-Russia ceasefire","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/international/world-news/donald-trump-announces-three-day-ukraine-russia-ceasefire/articleshow/130965811.cms","wireStoryId":"73deb6b7-0007-418d-ae29-b6cdef2cb4dd","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:0:sourceInfo","wireStories":[{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:12:23.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:21:00.000Z","description":"A significant development in the Ukraine-Russia conflict has been announced. US President Donald Trump revealed that both nations have agreed to a three-day truce commencing Saturday. This ceasefire is expected to be accompanied by a mutual exchange of 1,000 prisoners each.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"a45ec892-3bba-4f35-ac1d-fe363cb94159","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:106:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Donald Trump announces three-day Ukraine-Russia ceasefire","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://m.economictimes.com/news/international/world-news/donald-trump-announces-three-day-ukraine-russia-ceasefire/articleshow/130965811.cms","wireStoryId":"73deb6b7-0007-418d-ae29-b6cdef2cb4dd","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:106:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false}]},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:46:15.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:20:17.000Z","description":"Donald Trump announced a three-day Russia-Ukraine ceasefire from May 9 to 11, along with a major prisoner exchange deal.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"d9c2fdd6-97a1-42bd-a421-7f5cb0a6c4df","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:63:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Donald Trump Announces Three-Day Russia-Ukraine Ceasefire From May 9","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://news.abplive.com/news/world/russia-ukraine-war-trump-announces-three-day-russia-ukraine-ceasefire-from-may-9-1842377","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:63:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:40:03.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:18:32.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump announces on social media a three-day ceasefire in the war between Russia and Ukraine. The ceasefire will be valid from 9 to 11 May. 1000 prisoners will be exchanged.","originalDescription":"US-Präsident Donald Trump kündigt in den sozialen Medien eine dreitägige Feuerpause im Krieg zwischen Russland und der Ukraine an. Die Waffenruhe soll vom 9. bis zum 11. Mai gelten. 1000 Gefangene sollen unterdessen ausgetauscht werden.","lang":"de","paywall":"yes","refId":"da82be9d-ab3e-4e5a-ba46-190f8907d28e","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:174:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Suspension of All Fighting: Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire Between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":"Aussetzung aller Kampfhandlungen: Trump verkündet dreitägige Waffenruhe zwischen Ukraine und Russland","url":"https://www.welt.de/politik/ausland/article69fe28bd7e3ff373d429eba0/aussetzung-aller-kampfhandlungen-trump-verkuendet-dreitaegige-waffenruhe-zwischen-ukraine-und-russland.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:174:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:30:13.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:18:09.000Z","description":"Donald Trump has announced a three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"yes","refId":"bf69b127-f090-47bf-9add-bf6d0062740e","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:90:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Donald Trump announces a three-day ceasefire in Russia-Ukraine war as he says peace is 'closer every day'","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.gbnews.com/news/world/donald-trump-ceasefire-russia-ukraine-war","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:90:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:52:26.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:18:00.000Z","description":"Trump proudly announced the temporary ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"8a8448d2-1f72-45a5-9375-48adf80d5d69","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:347:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces 3-day Russia and Ukraine ceasefire including prisoner swap","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.the-express.com/news/world-news/206786/trump-announces-russia-ukraine-ceasefire","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:347:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T00:06:47.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:17:00.000Z","description":"article updated.... \"I am happy to announce that a THREE-DAY ARMISTATE has been declared in the armed conflict between Russia and Ukraine (May 9, 10, and 11). Victory Day is celebrated in Russia, but so is Ukraine, as that country also played an important role in World War II,\" Trump wrote on social media. Trump Declares ArmisticeThe US President announced that \"the armistice will include a cessation of all hostilities, as well as an exchange of…","originalDescription":"artykuł aktualizowany....„Z radością ogłaszam, że w konflikcie zbrojnym między Rosją a Ukrainą ogłoszono TRZYDNIOWE ZAWIESZENIE BRONI (9, 10 i 11 maja). W Rosji obchodzony jest Dzień Zwycięstwa, ale podobnie jest na Ukrainie, ponieważ kraj ten również odegrał ważną rolę w II wojnie światowej” – napisał Trump w mediach społecznościowych.Trumpa ogłasza rozejmPrezydent USA ogłosił, że „zawieszenie broni obejmie wstrzymanie wszelkich działań zbrojny…","lang":"pl","paywall":"no","refId":"22537847-a8f9-4871-afe3-5c742bbaa64e","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:502:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire. Ukraine and Russia Are to Hold Their Fire.","originalTitle":"Trump ogłasza trzydniowy rozejm. Ukraina i Rosja mają wsytrzmać ogień","url":"https://www.tvp.info/93151540/usa-donald-trump-oglasza-rozejm-w-wojnie-ukrainsko-rosyjskiej-ma-potrwac-trzy-dni","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:502:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T10:22:19.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:17:00.000Z","description":"U.S. President Donald Trump said Friday that his counterparts from Russia and Ukraine, Vladimir Putin and Volodimir Zelenski, have agreed to a ceasefire between May 9 and 11, which includes suspending all attacks and an exchange of a thousand prisoners from each country. At the last hour of the day, both leaders have accepted the truce. \"I am pleased to announce a three-day ceasefire (9, 10 and 11 May) in the war between Russia and Ukraine. Vict…","originalDescription":"El presidente de Estados Unidos, Donald Trump, aseguró este viernes que sus homólogos de Rusia y Ucrania, Vladímir Putin y Volodímir Zelenski, han acordado un alto el fuego entre el 9 y 11 de mayo que incluye suspender todo ataque y un intercambio de mil prisioneros de cada país. A última hora de la jornada, ambos líderes han aceptado la tregua. \"Me complace anunciar un alto el fuego de tres días (9, 10 y 11 de mayo) en la guerra entre Rusia y U…","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"c1d574fb-6f86-4c73-ba8e-2129bde81367","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:205:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Says Putin and Zelenski Have Agreed to a Ceasefire From 9 to 11 May","originalTitle":"Trump dice que Putin y Zelenski han acordado un alto el fuego del 9 al 11 de mayo","url":"https://www.elconfidencial.com/mundo/2026-05-08/trump-putin-ucrania-zelenski-tregua-alto-el-fuego_4352525/","wireStoryId":"2d9ae562-7c63-4852-935a-570fa72f001f","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:205:sourceInfo","wireStories":[{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:24:34.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:18:52.000Z","description":"The agreement includes suspending all attacks and an exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each country","originalDescription":"El acuerdo incluye suspender todo ataque y un intercambio de mil prisioneros de cada país","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"2851ae5b-6437-42d0-83c7-87ad7f2938e9","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:134:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Says Putin and Zelenski Have Agreed to a Ceasefire From 9 to 11 May","originalTitle":"Trump dice que Putin y Zelenski han acordado un alto el fuego del 9 al 11 de mayo","url":"https://www.eldebate.com/internacional/20260508/trump-dice-putin-zelenski-han-acordado-alto-fuego-9-11-mayo_415813.html","wireStoryId":"2d9ae562-7c63-4852-935a-570fa72f001f","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:134:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:32:26.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:22:32.000Z","description":"U.S. President Donald Trump said this Friday that his counterparts from Russia and Ukraine, Vladimir Putin and Volodimir Zelenski, have agreed, at his request, a ceasefire between May 9 and 11, which includes suspending all attacks and an exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each country. A truce that Ukrainian President confirmed shortly after","originalDescription":"El presidente de Estados Unidos, Donald Trump, aseguró este viernes que sus homólogos de Rusia y Ucrania, Vladímir Putin y Volodímir Zelenski, han acordado, a petición suya, un alto el fuego entre el 9 y 11 de mayo que incluye suspender todo ataque y un intercambio de mil prisioneros de cada país. Una tregua que el presidente ucraniano confirmó poco después","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"002c1bf1-8f09-44d7-b693-7a3f7273c955","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:315:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Says Putin and Zelenski Have Agreed to a Ceasefire From 9 to 11 May","originalTitle":"Trump dice que Putin y Zelenski han acordado un alto el fuego del 9 al 11 de mayo","url":"https://www.deia.eus/mundo/2026/05/08/trump-dice-putin-zelenski-han-11043414.html","wireStoryId":"2d9ae562-7c63-4852-935a-570fa72f001f","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:315:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:24:34.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:22:32.000Z","description":"U.S. President Donald Trump said this Friday that his counterparts from Russia and Ukraine, Vladimir Putin and Volodimir Zelenski, have agreed, at his request, a ceasefire between May 9 and 11, which includes suspending all attacks and an exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each country. A truce that Ukrainian President confirmed shortly after","originalDescription":"El presidente de Estados Unidos, Donald Trump, aseguró este viernes que sus homólogos de Rusia y Ucrania, Vladímir Putin y Volodímir Zelenski, han acordado, a petición suya, un alto el fuego entre el 9 y 11 de mayo que incluye suspender todo ataque y un intercambio de mil prisioneros de cada país. Una tregua que el presidente ucraniano confirmó poco después","la