es three-day ceasefire in Russia-Ukraine war By Investing.com","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.investing.com/news/economy-news/trump-announces-threeday-ceasefire-in-russiaukraine-war-93CH-4673745","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:327:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:17:07.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:15:46.000Z","description":"Truce will also include swap of 1,000 prisoners of war from each country, US president says.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"f3cdb29e-7e6a-4a58-9019-d9ffabda06d1","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:60:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces three-day ceasefire in Russia-Ukraine war","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/5/8/trump-announces-three-day-ceasefire-in-russia-ukraine-war","wireStoryId":"290c655b-bb10-49ec-b91a-2ebb1bf61de2","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:60:sourceInfo","wireStories":[{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T23:31:56.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:20:25.000Z","description":"Donald Trump announced a three-day ceasefire in the war between Russia and Ukraine on Friday (8/5). More...","originalDescription":"Τριήμερη κατάπαυση του πυρός στον πόλεμο μεταξύ Ρωσίας και Ουκρανίας ανακοίνωσε την Παρασκευή (8/5)  ο Ντόναλντ Τραμπ.  Περισσότερα...","lang":"el","paywall":"no","refId":"f206e119-d538-45df-8492-208be125fb65","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:161:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire in Russia-Ukraine War","originalTitle":"Τριήμερη κατάπαυση του πυρός στον πόλεμο Ρωσίας - Ουκρανίας ανακοίνωσε ο Τραμπ","url":"https://www.cnn.gr/kosmos/story/532764/triimeri-katapafsi-tou-pyros-ston-polemo-rosias-oukranias-anakoinose-o-tramp","wireStoryId":"290c655