moscou-HHN3LSDK7FG7JFIBIDKLFJMAWM/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:103:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T01:09:06.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:14:19.000Z","description":"Donald Trump announced on Friday a three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia starting Saturday.","originalDescription":"Donald Trump a annoncé vendredi un cessez-le-feu de trois jours entre l'Ukraine et la Russie à partir de samedi.","lang":"fr","paywall":"no","refId":"14b4066a-2c14-4567-898f-922983cd0359","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:120:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces a Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"Trump annonce un cessez-le-feu de trois jours entre Russie et Ukraine","url":"https://www.tvanouvelles.ca/2026/05/08/trump-annonce-un-cessez-le-feu-de-trois-jours-entre-lukraine-et-la-russie-des-samedi","wireStoryId":"70596325-b231-4c02-a5ac-e6f73f6a86d6","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:120:sourceInfo","wireStories":[{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:44:48.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:26:00.000Z","description":"In a message posted on social media, US President Donald Trump announced a three-day ceasefire on Friday, May 9, 10, and 11, in the war between Russia and Ukraine. According to the White House occupant, the ceasefire coincides with Victory Day, scheduled to be celebrated in Russia this Saturday. However, Trump emphasized that this day \"is also a day of celebration in Ukraine, given that this country was also a party and a key factor in World War…","originalDescription":"En un mensaje publicado en redes, el presidente de Estados Unidos, Donald Trump, ha anunciado este viernes un alto el fuego de tres días, \"9, 10 y 11 de mayo\", en la guerra entre Rusia y Ucrania. Según detalla el inquilino de la Casa Blanca, el alto el fuego se produce coincidiendo con el Día de la Victoria, previsto para celebrarse en Rusia este sábado. No obstante, Trump remarca que este día \"lo es también en Ucrania, dado que este país fue as…","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"94b48df2-5c45-4d11-8dcd-dfbb99b7f05a","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:370:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces a Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"Trump anuncia un alto el fuego durante tres días entre Rusia y Ucrania","url":"https://www.elplural.com/politica/internacional/trump-anuncia-alto-fuego-durante-tres-dias-entre-rusia-ucrania_389533102","wireStoryId":"70596325-b231-4c02-a5ac-e6f73f6a86d6","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:370:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T16:13:39.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T07:38:26.000Z","description":"Donald Trump announced on Friday a three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia from Saturday, saying that he hopes that this truce will sign the \"start of the end\" of the conflict. Moscow had already decreed a truce before the commemorations in Russia of the 9-May, but Ukraine as well as Russia continued ...","originalDescription":"Donald Trump a annoncé vendredi un cessez-le-feu de trois jours entre l’Ukraine et la Russie à partir de samedi, disant espérer que cette trêve signe le «début de la fin» du conflit. Moscou avait déjà décrété de son côté une trêve avant les commémorations en Russie du 9-Mai, mais l’Ukraine comme la Russie ont poursuivi ...","lang":"fr","paywall":"no","refId":"3e48d8f9-67d1-4232-915a-9ba386d26e20","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:440:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces a Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"Trump annonce un cessez-le-feu de trois jours entre la Russie et l’Ukraine","url":"https://lequotidien.lu/monde/trump-annonce-un-cessez-le-feu-de-trois-jours-entre-la-russie-et-lukraine/","wireStoryId":"70596325-b231-4c02-a5ac-e6f73f6a86d6","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:440:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false}]},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T22:05:08.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:14:01.000Z","description":"\"This ceasefire will include the suspension of any military activity, as well as an exchange of prisoners to the tune of 1,000 prisoners from each country,\" said US President Volodymyr Zelensky.","originalDescription":"« Ce cessez-le-feu comprendra la suspension de toute activité militaire, ainsi qu’un échange de prisonniers à hauteur de 1 000 prisonniers de chaque pays », indique le président américain. Volodymyr Zelensky a exigé sa mise en œuvre.","lang":"fr","paywall":"yes","refId":"1c47c6c6-389c-4f1f-9567-3a8c252d7419","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:44:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"War in Ukraine: A Three-Day Ceasefire Between Moscow and Kiev Through Trump","originalTitle":"Guerre en Ukraine : un cessez-le-feu de trois jours entre Moscou et Kiev acté grâce à Trump","url":"https://www.leparisien.fr/international/ukraine/guerre-en-ukraine-donald-trump-annonce-un-cessez-le-feu-de-trois-jours-entre-moscou-et-kiev-et-un-echange-de-prisonniers-08-05-2026-RSS2PFDDAFAW5EKIVWFY2FBRG4.php","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:44:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:44:04.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:13:52.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump said on Friday that Russia and Ukraine would observe a three-day ceasefire in the ongoing war from May 9 to May 11.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"ae8bf5c6-ecf4-4d22-a778-e3da2efcc293","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:10:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Suspension of kinetic activity, prison swap: Inside the 3-day ceasefire between Russia, Ukraine announced by Trump","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/world-news/suspension-of-kinetic-activity-prison-swap-inside-the-3-day-ceasefire-between-russia-ukraine-announced-by-trump-101778263706146.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:10:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T05:14:09.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:13:37.000Z","description":"Who initiated the ceasefire request? The US President announced a three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia. It will be in effect from May 9 to 11. This was reported by RBC-Ukraine, citing Trump's statement on his social media account, Truth Social, and a statement from Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy. Read also: Zelenskyy on the May 9 \"ceasefire\": Tomorrow depends on what we hear today.\n\"This ceasefire will include a cessation of a…","originalDescription":"Кто стал инициатором запроса на прекращение огня? Президент США объявил о введении трехдневного перемирия между Украиной и Россией. Оно будет действовать с 9 по 11 мая. Об этом сообщает РБК-Украина со ссылкой на заявление Трампа в его соцсети Truth Social и сообщение президента Украины Владимира Зеленского. Читайте также: Зеленский о \"перемирии\" 9 мая: завтра зависит от того, что мы услышим сегодня\n\"Это перемирие будет включать в себя прекращени…","lang":"ru","paywall":"no","refId":"95db44cb-4464-40a0-848d-fdade45a3593","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:241:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announced a Three-Day Ceasefire and Prisoner Exchange Between Ukraine and Russia.","originalTitle":"Трамп объявил о трехдневном перемирии и обмене пленными между Украиной и РФ","url":"https://www.rbc.ua/ukr/news/tramp-ogolosiv-tridenne-peremir-ya-i-obmin-1778264017.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:241:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T00:55:01.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:13:24.000Z","description":"Russia and Ukraine confirmed a three-day cease-fire and prisoner swap, which was agreed to after their leaders spoke with U.S. President Donald Trump.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"1545237a-b5f5-408a-b4f0-90ab063e6047","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:57:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Russia, Ukraine confirm three-day cease-fire, prisoner swaps after Trump conversations","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.upi.com/Top_News/World-News/2026/05/08/ukraine-war-russia-ceasefire-prisoner-swap-victory-day/9411778274053/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:57:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:31:10.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:12:54.000Z","description":"DONALD Trump has declared a three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia to commemorate Victory Day - as he claimed the brutal four-year conflict...","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"d59f53b2-26e0-4ac8-935d-da2aae691345","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:236:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces three-day ceasefire in Ukraine and says end to conflict is near","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.the-sun.com/news/16334304/trump-russia-ukraine-ceasefire-conflict-putin-zelensky/","wireStoryId":"d6ee43bd-1f92-4f70-ac31-5f1a808c465a","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:236:sourceInfo","wireStories":[{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T23:04:27.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:35:35.000Z","description":"The US president said there would be a halt in the fighting along with a prisoner swap of 1,000 prisoners from each side between May 9 and May 11 to mark Victory Day","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"88a9cdd1-8c77-41cf-ae77-a314d9f5ac79","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:3:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces three-day ceasefire in Ukraine and says end to conflict is near","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.mirror.co.uk/news/world-news/trump-ukraine-russia-ceasefire-victory-37132134","wireStoryId":"d6ee43bd-1f92-4f70-ac31-5f1a808c465a","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:3:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false}]},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T21:11:57.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:12:17.000Z","description":"President Donald Trump of the United States reported a three-day truce in the war between Russia and Ukraine, which will last from 9 to 11...","originalDescription":"Президент США Дональд Трамп сообщил о трехдневном перемирии в войне между Россией и Украиной — оно продлится с 9 по 11 м...","lang":"ru","paywall":"no","refId":"1d4cabb4-0ca9-4102-9dfd-8b3daa6c058a","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:317:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Donald Trump Announced a Three-Day Truce Between Russia and Ukraine, Which Will Last From 9 to 11 May.","originalTitle":"Дональд Трамп объявил о трехдневном перемирии между Россией и Украиной — оно продлится с 9 по 11 мая","url":"https://zona.media/news/2026/05/08/trump-victory-day","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:317:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:29:24.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:11:29.000Z","description":"Trump announces a 3-day Russia-Ukraine ceasefire from May 9–11, including a full halt to fighting and a 1,000-for-1,000 prisoner exchange.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"yes","refId":"0c84383a-5cd9-4d42-99a1-9294c75953e0","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:78:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces 3-day Russia-Ukraine ceasefire","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://gulfnews.com/world/americas/trump-announces-3-day-russia-ukraine-ceasefire-1.500534256","wireStoryId":"e732929b-5c5e-4262-9129-efe01b4ac468","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:78:sourceInfo","wireStories":[{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T11:57:38.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T04:33:20.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump has announced a three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine, scheduled to run from May 9 to May 11.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"56214c9d-97e9-40f5-9092-8866929b4a3f","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:321:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces 3-day Russia-Ukraine ceasefire","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://pajhwok.com/2026/05/09/trump-announces-3-day-russia-ukraine-ceasefire/","wireStoryId":"e732929b-5c5e-4262-9129-efe01b4ac468","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:321:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false}]},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:21:18.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:10:24.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump has announced a three-day ceasefire in Russia's war against Ukraine, to last from May 9 to 11. The ceasefire includes an exchange of around 1,000 prisoners on each side.","originalDescription":"Americký prezident Donald Trump oznámil třídenní příměří ve válce Ruska proti Ukrajině. Trvat má od 9. do 11. května. Součástí příměří je výměna tisícovky zajatců na každé straně.","lang":"cs","paywall":"no","refId":"25864cb6-3c12-4f3e-ac03-b03d98807f9b","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:150:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire in Russia's War Against Ukraine","originalTitle":"Trump oznámil třídenní příměří ve válce Ruska proti Ukrajině","url":"https://www.novinky.cz/clanek/valka-na-ukrajine-trump-oznamil-tridenni-primeri-ve-valce-ruska-proti-ukrajine-40577299","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:150:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:44:14.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:09:21.000Z","description":"\"This cease-fire will include the suspension of all war activity, as well as an exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each country,\" said the US President. \"The US International Trade Tribunal fails to find that Trump's 10% global tariff is illegal after the reverse of the Supreme. \"I am pleased to announce on Friday that there will be a three-day truce between Russia and Ukraine for the day of the victory of the Second World War, which is being held…","originalDescription":"\"Este alto el fuego incluirá la suspensión de toda actividad bélica, así como un intercambio de 1.000 prisioneros de cada país\", ha afirmado el presidente de EEUUEl Tribunal de Comercio Internacional de EEUU falla que es ilegal el arancel global del 10% impuesto por Trump tras el revés del Supremo\nEl presidente de EEUU, Donald Trump, ha anunciado este viernes una tregua de tres días entre Rusia y Ucrania por el día de la victoria de la Segunda G…","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"8e49d889-238f-4e84-94f2-5fa4f22a8f55","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:119:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Truce Between Russia and Ukraine for World War II Victory Day · Global Voices","originalTitle":"Trump anuncia una tregua de tres días entre Rusia y Ucrania por el día de la victoria de la Segunda Guerra Mundial","url":"https://www.eldiario.es/internacional/trump-anuncia-tregua-tres-dias-rusia-ucrania-dia-victoria-segunda-guerra-mundial_1_13207567.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:119:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:28:34.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:09:04.000Z","description":"U.S. President Donald Trump on Friday announced on social media that ​there would be a ​three-day ceasefire in the war between ⁠Russia and Ukraine from ​May 9 until May 11.","originalDescription":null,"lang":null,"paywall":"yes","refId":"e6c0aef3-006f-4be0-ba1d-ae1a7f99a0dd","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:7:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.reuters.com/world/europe/trump-announces-three-day-ceasefire-between-ukraine-russia-2026-05-08/","wireStoryId":"98835fca-0291-4526-b4b1-6aa5a172815e","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:7:sourceInfo","wireStories":[{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:11:28.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:54:19.000Z","description":"WASHINGTON - US President Donald Trump on Friday announced on social media that there would be a three-day ceasefire in the war between Russia and Ukraine from May 9 until May 11 to mark the end of World War Two for the Russians.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"40694b15-6fcd-46bf-b980-809960beec77","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:65:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.gmanetwork.com/news/topstories/world/986991/trump-announces-three-day-ceasefire-between-ukraine-and-russia/story/","wireStoryId":"98835fc