-b4b1-6aa5a172815e","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:89:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T07:09:57.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T03:24:00.000Z","description":"Russia and Ukraine confirmed on Friday that they had agreed to a three-day ceasefire brokered by the United States to last from May 9 to 11, and US President Donald Trump said he hoped it would be extended, Reuters reports.","originalDescription":"Rusija ir Ukraina penktadienį patvirtino susitarusios dėl JAV tarpininkautų trijų dienų paliaubų, kurios galios nuo gegužės 9 iki 11 dienos, o JAV prezidentas Donaldas Trumpas teigė besitikintis, kad jos bus pratęstos, skelbia „Reuters“.","lang":"lt","paywall":"no","refId":"092f27af-1b3e-4387-8f03-77a8e4747be2","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:130:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"War in Ukraine. 245 Clashes Took Place on the Frontline in a Day, the Most Intense Battles Were in Pokrovsk","originalTitle":"Karas Ukrainoje. Per parą fronte įvyko 245 susirėmimai, intensyviausi mūšiai – Pokrovske","url":"https://www.lrt.lt/naujienos/pasaulyje/6/2923005/karas-ukrainoje-per-para-fronte-ivyko-245-susiremimai-intensyviausi-musiai-pokrovske","wireStoryId":"98835fca-0291-4526-b4b1-6aa5a172815e","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:130:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:39:53.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:08:48.000Z","description":"May 8 (Reuters) – U.S. ​President ‌Donald Trump on ‌Friday ​announced ⁠on social ⁠media that there ​would ⁠be ⁠a three-day ​ceasefire ​in the war ‌between Russia ⁠and Ukraine from ⁠May ‌9 ⁠until ​May ‌11. (Reporting by ​Susan ⁠Heavey; editing by Michelle ​Nichols )","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"0136fc4c-66f4-4668-b7ca-a5a76a7ec473","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:142:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://wtvbam.com/2026/05/08/trump-announces-three-day-ceasefire-between-ukraine-and-russia/","wireStoryId":"98835fca-0291-4526-b4b1-6aa5a172815e","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:142:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T06:32:05.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T03:08:44.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump wants the ceasefire in the war in Ukraine to last longer than the three days he previously announced. The head of the White House said this on Friday evening, Washington time, according to Reuters. For now, the ceasefire is to last from today to Tuesday. \"I would like to see a significant extension,\" Trump told reporters. \"It is possible,\" he added. \nRussia and Ukraine have agreed to a three-day ceasefire. Zelensky has …","originalDescription":"Americký prezident Donald Trump si želá, aby prímerie vo vojne na Ukrajine bolo dlhšie ako ním predtým oznámené tri dni. Šéf Bieleho domu to podľa agentúry Reuters povedal v piatok večer washingtonského času. Zatiaľ má pokoj zbraní trvať od dneška do utorka. \"Rád by som videl výrazné predĺženie,\" povedal Trump novinárom. \"Možné to je,\" dodal. \nRusko aj Ukrajina súhlasili s uzavretím trojdňového prímeria. Zelenskyj dekrétom zakázal armáde 9. mája…","lang":"sk","paywall":"no","refId":"d0164da8-9d6d-426c-9a78-134f8ae4610d","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:152:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Will the Ceasefire in the War in Ukraine Last Longer than Three Days? It's Possible, Says Trump","originalTitle":"Bude prímerie vo vojne na Ukrajine dlhšie ako tri dni? Možné to je, tvrdí Trump","url":"https://hnonline.sk/svet/96280093-bude-primerie-vo-vojne-na-ukrajine-dlhsie-ako-tri-dni-mozne-to-je-tvrdi-trump","wireStoryId":"98835fca-0291-4526-b4b1-6aa5a172815e","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:152:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T08:21:43.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:07:56.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump has announced a three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia. The ceasefire applies to May 9, 10, and 11, according to Trump on Truth Social. He states that Russia and Ukraine have agreed.","originalDescription":"De Amerikaanse president Donald Trump heeft aangekondigd dat er een driedaags bestand komt tussen Oekraïne en Rusland. Het staakt-het-vuren geldt op 9, 10 en 11 mei, aldus Trump op Truth Social. Hij stelt dat Rusland en Oekraïne hebben ingestemd.","lang":"nl","paywall":"no","refId":"9eeca61b-6381-4378-b559-16a2ce314397","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:153:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire Between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":"Trump kondigt driedaags bestand tussen Oekraïne en Rusland aan","url":"https://www.rd.nl/a/1148486-trump-kondigt-driedaags-bestand-tussen-oekraine-en-rusland-aan","wireStoryId":"98835fca-0291-4526-b4b1-6aa5a172815e","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:153:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:54:39.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:52:04.000Z","description":"US President announces ceasefire ahead of contentious Russia military parade. Ukraine says will implement cessation of hostilities, but only in central Moscow where the festivities are taking place Saturday.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"9ede67fd-b820-46f4-adb5-ed49bb202432","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:169:sortData","specialIcon":null,"