ceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T23:58:24.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:36:00.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump on Friday announced on social media that there would be a three-day ceasefire in the war between Russia and Ukraine from May 9 until May 11 to mark the end of World War II for the Russians. Trump had said after a phone call with Putin on April 29 that a temporary ceasefire was in the works. Putin announced a similar truce last year that lasted three days ​but was not agreed with Kyiv. Trump said in a Truth Social post t…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"8e2ec51b-9abd-4958-a424-ead793458511","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:313:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://cyprus-mail.com/2026/05/08/trump-announces-three-day-ceasefire-between-ukraine-and-russia","wireStoryId":"98835fca-0291-4526-b4b1-6aa5a172815e","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:313:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:13:19.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T20:12:10.000Z","description":"President Trump made a ceasefire announcement on Friday, though not one involving Iran. In a Truth Social post , Trump said Ukraine and Russia had agreed to a three-day ceasefire at his request starting Saturday, reports Reuters . \"Hopefully, it is the beginning of the end of a very long, deadly, and...","originalDescription":null,"lang":"fr","paywall":"no","refId":"e6503da1-3783-432c-ac49-2b754a47a96c","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:412:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump: Russia-Ukraine Agree to 3-Day Truce","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.newser.com/story/388822/trump-russia-ukraine-agree-to-3-day-truce.html","wireStoryId":"98835fca-0291-4526-b4b1-6aa5a172815e","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:412:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:07:52.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:48:00.000Z","description":"US president Donald Trump announced a three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia on his Truth Social platform on Friday. The ceasefire is set...","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"54f07683-e72a-4a48-939c-7b65e2efd6f0","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:490:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.belganewsagency.eu/trump-announces-three-day-ceasefire-between-ukraine-and-russia","wireStoryId":"98835fca-0291-4526-b4b1-6aa5a172815e","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:490:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false}]},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:47:35.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:07:16.000Z","description":"U.S. President Donald Trump announced a three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine from May 9 to 11. The announcement was confirmed by Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky.","originalDescription":"Prezydent USA Donald Trump ogłosił trzydniowy rozejm między Rosją i Ukrainą od 9 do 11 maja. Ogłoszenie potwierdził prezydent Ukrainy Wołodymyr Zełenski.","lang":"pl","paywall":"no","refId":"26de3e83-5cd6-4620-90ec-c3a3cfbc6531","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:464:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announced a Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"Trump ogłosił trzydniowy rozejm między Rosją i Ukrainą","url":"https://tvn24.pl/swiat/donald-trump-oglosil-trzydniowy-rozejm-miedzy-rosja-i-ukraina-st9038793","wireStoryId":"24b1789d-81be-4ee6-9047-176326a56a79","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:464:sourceInfo","wireStories":[{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T22:43:40.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T21:09:50.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump announced a three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia, set to begin this Saturday, which he said has already been agreed upon by both governments. The measure coincides with the unilateral truce that Moscow had previously announced in the context of the Victory Day celebrations, held every May 9 to commemorate the victory over Nazi Germany in World War II. Despite this, clashes between the forces of both countries …","originalDescription":"El presidente de Estados Unidos, Donald Trump, anunció un cese del fuego de tres días entre Ucrania y Rusia que comenzará este sábado y que, según indicó, ya cuenta con la aceptación de ambos gobiernos. La medida coincide con la tregua unilateral que Moscú había comunicado previamente en el marco de las celebraciones por el Día de la Victoria, que se realiza cada 9 de mayo para recordar el triunfo sobre la Alemania nazi en la Segunda Guerra Mund…","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"d38edaef-26fe-46c8-92db-de35d30bdb7c","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:426:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announced a Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"Trump anunció un alto el fuego de tres días entre Rusia y Ucrania - Sin Mordaza","url":"https://sinmordaza.com/noticia/504593-trump-anuncio-un-alto-el-fuego-de-tres-dias-entre-rusia-y-ucrania.html","wireStoryId":"24b1789d-81be-4ee6-9047-176326a56a79","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:426:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false}]},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:28:31.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:07:00.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump has announced a three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia. The ceasefire applies to May 9, 10, and 11, Trump wrote on Truth Social. He states that Russia and Ukraine have agreed.","originalDescription":"De Amerikaanse president Donald Trump heeft aangekondigd dat er een driedaags bestand komt tussen Oekraïne en Rusland. Het staakt-het-vuren geldt op 9, 10 en 11 mei, zo schreef Trump op Truth Social. Hij stelt dat Rusland en Oekraïne hebben ingestemd.","lang":"nl","paywall":"no","refId":"665caa42-155d-4eef-80ef-55eb41726979","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:176:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Three-Day Ceasefire Between Ukraine and Russia: ‘Hopefully the Beginning of the End of a Long War’","originalTitle":"Staakt-het-vuren van drie dagen tussen Oekraïne en Rusland: ‘Hopelijk begin van het einde van een lange oorlog’","url":"https://www.ad.nl/buitenland/staakt-het-vuren-van-drie-dagen-tussen-oekraine-en-rusland-hopelijk-begin-van-het-einde-van-een-lange-oorlog~ae4b70cf/","wireStoryId":"5bc49b27-5fae-457e-8a04-d242f58c8315","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:176:sourceInfo","wireStories":[{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T05:21:51.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:07:21.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump has announced a three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia. The ceasefire applies to May 9, 10, and 11, Trump wrote on Truth Social. He states that Russia and Ukraine have agreed.","originalDescription":"De Amerikaanse president Donald Trump heeft aangekondigd dat er een driedaags bestand komt tussen Oekraïne en Rusland. Het staakt-het-vuren geldt op 9, 10 en 11 mei, zo schreef Trump op Truth Social. Hij stelt dat Rusland en Oekraïne hebben ingestemd.","lang":"nl","paywall":"no","refId":"f4aefb94-4d05-46fd-b40c-dbcc96b4d38c","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:489:sortData","specialIcon":null,"