ull,"url":"https://www.afr.com/politics/federal/live-updates-fighting-flares-in-middle-east-as-us-awaits-iran-response-20260509-p5zv8f","wireStoryId":"1880b7b5-2a13-4927-90aa-5606f6332f6b","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:244:sourceInfo","wireStories":[{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T21:24:49.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:14:38.000Z","description":"President Donald Trump announced a three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine, coinciding with Russia’s Victory Day parade. “I am pleased to announce that there will be a THREE DAY CEASEFIRE (May 9th, 10th, and 11th) in the War between Russia and Ukraine. The Celebration in Russia is for Victory Day but, likewise, in Ukraine, because they were also a big part and factor of World War II,” Trump said in a post on Truth Social. In his own state…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"yes","refId":"7657cee6-62e3-4c52-86ee-6fd8ed9df498","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:30:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.washingtonexaminer.com/news/world/4561150/trump-announces-three-day-ceasefire-between-russia-and-ukraine/","wireStoryId":"1880b7b5-2a13-4927-90aa-5606f6332f6b","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:30:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T21:55:42.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:31:20.000Z","description":"President Trump said the ceasefire also contemplates the exchange of 1,000 prisoners","originalDescription":"El presidente Trump afirmó que el cese al fuego también contempla el intercambio de 1,000 prisioneros","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"c7773059-fea1-46f7-9cd5-92848ae27b3a","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:55:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"Trump anuncia alto el fuego de tres días entre Rusia y Ucrania - La Opinión","url":"https://laopinion.com/2026/05/08/trump-anuncia-alto-el-fuego-de-tres-dias-entre-rusia-y-ucrania/","wireStoryId":"1880b7b5-2a13-4927-90aa-5606f6332f6b","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:55:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:35:44.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:10:41.000Z","description":"The Ukrainian population has been living in uncertainty for over four years due to Russian terror. Peace talks have yielded little results so far, and the fighting continues. Follow the latest developments regarding the war in Ukraine in our live blog.","originalDescription":"De Oekraïense bevolking leeft al ruim vier jaar in onzekerheid door de Russische terreur. Vredesgesprekken leverden tot nu toe weinig op, de gevechten gaan door. Volg de laatste ontwikkelingen rond de oorlog in Oekraïne in ons liveblog.","lang":"nl","paywall":"yes","refId":"ed798c50-ad7f-41e6-bfd2-0c1813c4d637","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:107:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"Trump kondigt driedaags staakt-het-vuren aan tussen Rusland en Oekraïne","url":"https://www.telegraaf.nl/buitenland/live-trump-kondigt-driedaags-staakt-het-vuren-aan-tussen-rusland-en-oekrane/151233683.html","wireStoryId":"1880b7b5-2a13-4927-90aa-5606f6332f6b","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:107:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T05:14:31.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:45:40.000Z","description":"According to US President Donald Trump, Russia and Ukraine have been convinced of a three-day ceasefire starting tomorrow.","originalDescription":"US-Präsident Donald Trump hat nach eigenen Angaben Russland und die Ukraine von einer ab dem morgigen Samstag geltenden dreitägigen Waffenruhe überzeugt.","lang":"de","paywall":"no","refId":"08c0b9f7-baa3-4090-87f7-0ab184e98167","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:115:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"Trump kündigt dreitägige Waffenruhe zwischen Russland und der Ukraine an","url":"https://www.tt.com/artikel/30933585/trump-kuendigt-dreitaegige-waffenruhe-zwischen-russland-und-der-ukraine-an","wireStoryId":"1880b7b5-2a13-4927-90aa-5606f6332f6b","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:115:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T05:07:58.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:48:08.000Z","description":"U.S. President Donald Trump announced on Friday a three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine from May 9-11, marking the anniversary of the end of World War II. He announced that the ceasefire would also include an exchange of 2,000 prisoners.","originalDescription":"Prezydent USA Donald Trump ogłosił w piątek trzydniowe zawieszenie broni między Rosją i Ukrainą w dniach 9-11 maja w związku z rocznicą zakończenia II wojny światowej. Zapowiedział, że rozejm obejmie też wymianę łącznie 2 tys. więźniów.","lang":"pl","paywall":"no","refId":"22de0469-7276-4a3a-a736-a62114841248","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:155:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"Trump ogłasza trzydniowy rozejm między Rosją i Ukrainą","url":"https://wpolityce.pl/swiat/759864-trump-oglasza-trzydniowy-rozejm-miedzy-rosja-i-ukraina","wireStoryId":"1880b7b5-2a13-4927-90aa-5606f6332f6b","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:155:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T14:08:18.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:21:44.000Z","description":"The President of the United States, Donald Trump, announced this Friday (08), a three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine. “I am pleased to announce that there will be a three-day ceasefire (May 9, 10 and 11) in the war between Russia and Ukraine,” Trump wrote on Truth Social. The publication talks about the celebration of Victory Day, an important Russian holiday that marks the date of the defeat of the Nazis in the Second World War, celeb…","originalDescription":"O presidente dos Estados Unidos, Donald Trump, anunciou nesta sexta-feira (08), um cessar-fogo de três dias entre Rússia e Ucrânia. “Tenho prazer de anunciar que haverá três dias de cessar-fogo (9, 10 e 11 de maio) na guerra entre Rússia e Ucrânia”, escreveu Trump no Truth Social. A publicação fala sobre a comemoração do Dia da Vitória, importante feriado russo que marca a data da derrota dos nazistas na Segunda Guerra Mundial, comemorado pelos …","lang":"pt","paywall":"no","refId":"3f16ace3-0e45-4074-a9e8-fbf62b54e436","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:160:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"Trump anuncia cessar-fogo de três dias entre Rússia e Ucrânia – Jovem Pan","url":"https://jovempan.com.br/noticias/mundo/trump-anuncia-cessar-fogo-de-tres-dias-entre-russia-e-ucrania.html","wireStoryId":"1880b7b5-2a13-4927-90aa-5606f6332f6b","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:160:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:08:31.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:08:05.000Z","description":"After Russian President Vladimir Putin announced a ceasefire for May 8th and 9th, and Ukraine had previously called for an indefinite truce starting May 6th, US President Donald Trump has now also weighed in. \"I am pleased to announce that there will be a three-day ceasefire (May 9th, 10th, and 11th) in the war between Russia and Ukraine,\" he wrote on his personal platform. \"This ceasefire includes a cessation of all hostilities as well as a pri…","originalDescription":"Nachdem der russische Präsident Wladimir Putin bereits einen Waffenstillstand für den 8. und 9. Mai angekündigt und die Ukraine zuvor eine unbefristete Waffenruhe ab dem 6. Mai gefordert hatte, hat sich nun auch US-Präsident Donald Trump zu Wort gemeldet. \"Ich freue mich, bekannt geben zu dürfen, dass es im Krieg zwischen Russland und der Ukraine einen dreitägigen Waffenstillstand (9., 10. und 11. Mai) geben wird\", schrieb er auf seiner persönli…","lang":"de","paywall":"no","refId":"e91b4a58-10fc-4c09-93ae-283b7333a325","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:280:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"Trump verkündet dreitägige Waffenruhe zwischen Russland und Ukraine","url":"https://www.berliner-sonntagsblatt.de/Deutschland/Trump-verkuendet-dreitaegige-Waffenruhe-zwischen-Russland-und-Ukraine-359420.html","wireStoryId":"1880b7b5-2a13-4927-90aa-5606f6332f6b","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:280:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T01:56:42.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T01:50:52.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump says Russia and Ukraine will pause fighting from Saturday through Monday. Both countries have agreed to his initiative, but the question is whether the ceasefire will hold.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"4a28004c-8e00-46cd-8d22-618c553148e8","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSourc