utin and Volodymyr Zelenskyy to suspend fighting for the duration.The ceasefire, set for May 9-11, pauses \"all kinetic activity\" from both sides and calls for a prisoner swap of 1,000 POWs from each country.\"Hopefully, it is the …","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"5efe8f9e-c445-4ebf-9cad-cec8d5802cce","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:362:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Russia and Ukraine have agreed to a three-day ceasefire, Trump says","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.katc.com/world/europe/russia-and-ukraine-have-agreed-to-a-three-day-ceasefire-trump-says","wireStoryId":"eccce101-2955-4bea-b97d-8d5a30e29638","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:362:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false}]},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T05:16:42.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T12:38:32.000Z","description":"U.S. President Donald Trump announced on Friday that Ukraine and Russia would enter into a three-day ceasefire as Russia commemorates Victory Day.The president wrote on social media that he directly asked both Vladimir Putin and Volodymyr Zelenskyy to suspend fighting for the duration.The ceasefire, set for May 9-11, pauses \"all kinetic activity\" from both sides and calls for a prisoner swap of 1,000 POWs from each country.\"Hopefully, it is the …","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"a047dd91-b523-441c-adc2-c8462e184851","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:423:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Russia and Ukraine have agreed to a three-day ceasefire","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.ktvq.com/world/europe/russia-and-ukraine-have-agreed-to-a-three-day-ceasefire-trump-says","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:423:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:38:07.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T12:00:00.000Z","description":"Ukraine and Russia have been at war for over four years following Russia’s full-scale invasion of the U.S. ally, which has had strained relations with the Trump administration.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"067a49c1-13f8-499a-8fb9-fcfea64fe2ea","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:131:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Ceasefire In Russia-Ukraine War—But Prior Truces Have Largely Failed","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.forbes.com/sites/antoniopequenoiv/2026/05/08/trump-announces-ceasefire-in-russia-ukraine-war-but-prior-truces-have-largely-failed/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:131:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T08:35:07.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T10:17:12.000Z","description":"Donald Trump announced on Friday a three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia from Saturday, saying he hopes that this truce will mark the \"start of the end\" of the conflict.","originalDescription":"Donald Trump a annoncé vendredi un cessez-le-feu de trois jours entre l’Ukraine et la Russie à partir de samedi, disant espérer que cette trêve signe le « début de la fin » du conflit.","lang":"fr","paywall":"no","refId":"99f6b4bb-63ce-4def-8437-c53bf2a19ba7","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:179:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"War in Ukraine: Trump Announces a Three-Day Ceasefire","originalTitle":"Guerre en Ukraine | Trump annonce un cessez-le-feu de trois jours","url":"https://www.lapresse.ca/international/europe/2026-05-08/guerre-en-ukraine/trump-annonce-un-cessez-le-feu-de-trois-jours.php","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:179:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:30:09.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T09:07:59.000Z","description":"The US president said both sides had agreed to halt fighting from May 9 to 11 and to exchange 1,000 prisoners each. Both Ukraine and Russia confirmed the ceasefire and prisoner exchange. Follow DW for more.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"51fe4141-7ea6-4c35-90ac-a9827315fa29","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:82:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces 3-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.dw.com/en/trump-announces-3-day-ceasefire-between-ukraine-and-russia/live-77091251","wireStoryId":"e3eecc2b-2fe7-476e-af1f-802add444cfd","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:82:sourceInfo","wireStories":[{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:09:45.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:54:27.000Z","description":"Zelensky said that “Red Square is less important to us than the lives of Ukrainian prisoners who can be brought home,\" referring to the implication that Ukraine wouldn't attack Russia's festive parade","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"9c8b30cf-2072-49dd-bb9c-402797e4aba0","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:374:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces 3-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.i24news.tv/en/news/international/ukraine-russia-war/artc-trump-announces-3-day-ceasefire-between-ukraine-and-russia","wireStoryId":"e3eecc2b-2fe7-476e-af1f-802add444cfd","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:374:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false}]},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T19:36:32.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T18:54:28.000Z","description":"Russian President Vladimir Putin stated on Saturday that Moscow has not yet received a formal proposal from Ukraine regarding the significant prisoner exchange recently announced by U.S. President Donald Trump. Despite the public nature of the plan, which suggests a large-scale humanitarian swap between the two warring nations, Putin indicated that the specific logistics and terms have not been communicated through official channels. Speaking to…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"16b818b5-1ca9-48d9-a697-234557e60e24","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:529:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"No Swap Proposal From Kyiv Yet","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://newscentraltv.com/no-swap-proposal-from-kyiv-yet-putin/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:529:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T16:48:26.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T15:08:01.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump announced on May 8, 2026, that Russia and Ukraine had agreed to a three-day ceasefire starting May 9. The temporary halt in fighting will last until May 11 and includes a major prisoner exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each side. Trump posted on Truth Social that he personally requested the ceasefire from Russian President Vladimir Putin and Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy, and both leaders agreed. He called it …","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"ea102675-850d-48f9-b866-097ca933428c","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:469:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Declares Himself the Hero Again as Russia-Ukraine Ce@sefire Finally Happens After 4 Years","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://startuppakistan.com.pk/trump-declares-himself-the-hero-again-as-russia-ukraine-cesefire-finally-happens-after-4-years/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:469:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T16:03:54.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T15:00:00.000Z","description":"U.S. President Donald Trump announced on Friday a three-day ceasefire in the Russia-Ukraine war, effective from May 9th to May 11th.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"cbd33867-896f-43c0-8096-1e78f9fef612","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:382:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Truce Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.jordannews.jo/Section-111/All/Trump-Announces-Three-Day-Truce-Between-Russia-and-Ukraine-51271","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:382:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T15:33:15.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T14:35:28.000Z","description":"By  DARLENE SUPERVILLESaturday May 9, 2026 President Donald Trump said Friday that Russia and Ukraine had accepted his call for a three-day ceasefire and a prisoner swap, casting the limited pause as a possible first step toward ending a war that has dragged on for years. Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy and Yuri Ushakov, Russian President […]","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"f1281c95-fc08-49fb-a9cd-e6418eb8a367","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:512:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump says Russia, Ukraine agree to 3-day ceasefire, prisoner swap","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://axadletimes.com/somalia/trump-says-russia-ukraine-agree-3-day-ceasefire-pr.html5","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:512:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T14:35:35.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T14:22:33.000Z","description":"Russia says that a peace agreement with Ukraine is still far from possible. The Kremlin spokesman's statement this Saturday takes place at a time when a large exchange of prisoners is expected between Moscow and Kiev.","originalDescription":"A Rússia diz que um acordo de paz com a Ucrânia está, ainda, muito longe de ser possível. A declaração do porta-voz do Kremlin, este sábado, acontece numa altura em que se prevê uma grande troca de prisioneiros entre Moscovo e Kiev.","lang":"pt","paywall":"no","refId":"14ee1294-2c4c-479c-95e0-917b130118a4","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:108:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Russia Pessimistic About Peace with Ukraine Despite Cease-Fire in Force","originalTitle":"Rússia pessimista sobre paz com Ucrânia apesar de cessar-fogo em vigor","url":"https://sicnoticias.pt/especiais/guerra-russia-ucrania/2026-05-09-video-russia-pessimista-sobre-paz-com-ucrania-apesar-de-cessar-fogo-em-vigor-6d73c30f","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:108:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T14:06:59.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T09:06:13.000Z","description":"Follow all information about the war in Ukraine, live via our live. The post Three Days of Ceasefire and an Exchange of Prisoners in Ukraine: Trump repeats that the end of the war is near appeared first on The Vif.","originalDescription":"Suivez toutes les informations sur la guerre en Ukraine, en direct via notre live. The post Trois jours de cessez-le-feu et un échange de prisonniers en Ukraine: Trump répète que la fin de la guerre est proche appeared first on Le Vif.","lang":"fr","paywall":"no","refId":"7a80d630-c9f6-4581-94b1-bcda6eaeab67","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:507:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Three Days of Ceasefire and an Exchange of Prisoners in Ukraine: Trump Repeats that the End of the War Is Near","originalTitle":"Trois jours de cessez-le-feu et un échange de prisonniers en Ukraine: Trump répète que la fin de la guerre est proche","url":"https://www.levif.be/international/ukraine/live/guerre_en_ukraine/trois-jours-de-cessez-le-feu-et-un-echange-de-prisonniers-en-ukraine-trump-repete-que-la-fin-de-la-guerre-est-proche-546137/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:507:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T09:00:53.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T08:59:48.000Z","description":"Washington: US President Donald Trump expressed hope that the three day ceasefire agreement between Russia and Ukraine, brokered by the United States...","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"99cf4f75-a55a-47bb-9118-bf349eefb8cd","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:447:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump hopes for 'big extension' of Russia-Ukraine ceasefire","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://thepeninsulaqatar.com/article/09/05/2026/trump-hopes-for-big-extension-of-russia-ukraine-ceasefire","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:447:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T09:04:35.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T08:54:03.000Z","description":"[»] Jump to Summary… A fresh diplomatic breakthrough may have opened a narrow path toward easing the brutal war between Donald Trump, Volodymyr Zelensky and Vladimir Putin, after all sides confirmed support for a temporary three-day ceasefire and a large prisoner exchange. The proposed pause in fighting is expected to run from May 9 to May 11, coinciding with Russia’s annual Victory Day celebrations. According to Trump, the agreement would also …","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"a0eb7071-4bf4-4475-8fef-507ebbc0f87d","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:471:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Donald Trump Secures Three Day Russia Ukraine Ceasefire Deal as Moscow Victory Day Talks Raise New Peace Hopes in Europe","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://tdpelmedia.com/donald-trump-secures-three-day-russia-ukraine-ceasefire-deal-as-moscow-victory-day-talks-raise-new-peace-hopes-in-europe/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:471:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T08:02:44.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T08:01:27.000Z","description":"President Donald Trump of the United States stated that it was through his efforts that the cease-fire between Ukraine and Russia was achieved between 9 and 11 May, and he allowed for a longer truce.","originalDescription":"Президент США Дональд Трамп заявил, что именно благодаря его усилиям удалось достичь прекращения огня между Украиной и Россией на период с 9 по 11 мая. Также он допустил возможность более длительного перемирия.","lang":"ru","paywall":"no","refId":"88f55bde-8bc5-4268-b2af-e7bd9fdfd60c","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:499:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"\"I Asked for This\": Trump Boasted that He Was the One Who Proposed a Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine.","originalTitle":"\"Это я попросил\": Трамп похвастался, что именно он предложил трехдневное прекращение огня между Россией и Украиной. Видео","url":"https://www.obozrevatel.com/politics-news/eto-ya-poprosil-tramp-pohvastalsya-chto-imenno-on-predlozhil-trehdnevnoe-prekraschenie-ognya-mezhdu-rossiej-i-ukrainoj-video.htm","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:499:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T07:50:07.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T07:45:54.000Z","description":"U.S. President Donald Trump announced that Russia and Ukraine have agreed to a three-day ceasefire from the 9th to the 11th. According to a report by Yonhap News, President Trump wrote on his social media platform, TruthSocial, on the 8th (local time), “There is scheduled to be a ceasefire in the war between Russia and Ukraine from May 9 to 11.” President Trump also added, “During the ceasefire, all military activities will be suspended, and bet…","originalDescription":"도널드 트럼프 미국 대통령이 러시아와 우크라이나가 오는 9일부터 11일까지 사흘간 휴전에 합의했다고 밝혔다. 연합뉴스 보도에 따르면 트럼프 대통령은 8일(현지시간) 자신의 SNS 트루스소셜에 “러시아와 우크라이나 간 전쟁에서 5월 9일부터 11일까지 휴전이 있을 예정”이라고 썼다. 트럼프 대통령은 또 “휴전 기간 동안 모든 군사 활동이 중단되고, 양국 간","lang":"ko","paywall":"no","refId":"1a294bc2-8b7e-467d-8742-afe8b0dd92de","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:299:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Surprisely Announces Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine… \"Exchange of 1,000 Prisoners Each\"","originalTitle":"트럼프, 러시아-우크라이나 사흘 휴전 전격 발표… \"포로 1천명씩 교환\"","url":"https://v.daum.net/v/20260509062043641","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:299:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T12:20:07.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T07:43:59.000Z","description":"Sat 09 May 2026: Russia and Ukraine confirmed Friday that they had agreed to a U.S.-brokered three-day ceasefire set for May 9-11. President Donald Trump said he hopes the truce will be extended beyond that window. Earlier on Truth Social, Trump announced the temporary halt in fighting and said the two sides, at war for […]","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"e651c961-a614-4007-bf0c-33a4f363947b","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:487:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"TRUMP ANNOUNCES 3-DAY CEASEFIRE IN RUSSIA-UKRAINE WAR, MAJOR POW SWAP","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://independentpress.cc/trump-announces-3-day-ceasefire-in-russia-ukraine-war-major-pow-swap/2026/05/09/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:487:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T10:25:28.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T07:19:17.000Z","description":"Donald Trump announced this Friday a three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine from Saturday. An announcement that comes as drone attacks continue, despite the unilateral truce decreed by Moscow before the 9-May celebrations.","originalDescription":"Donald Trump a annoncé ce vendredi un cessez-le-feu de trois jours entre la Russie et l’Ukraine à partir de samedi. Une annonce qui intervient alors que les attaques de drones se poursuivent, malgré la trêve unilatérale décrétée par Moscou avant les célébrations du 9-Mai.","lang":"fr","paywall":"no","refId":"6261b35c-5ca8-44aa-a245-15f41dd47d23","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:525:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"War in Ukraine: Donald Trump Announces Three-Day Truce · Global Voices","originalTitle":"Guerre en Ukraine : Donald Trump annonce une trêve de trois jours","url":"https://www.ici.fr/infos/international/guerre-en-ukraine-donald-trump-annonce-une-treve-de-trois-jours-3581630","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:525:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T14:29:34.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T06:49:00.000Z","description":"He said this during a conversation with journalists, reports RBK-Ukraine. “I asked for it, and President Putin agreed, Zelensky agreed, both without hesitation. And we have a short period of time when they will not kill people, that's very good,” the US president noted. Donald Trump also suggested that the ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia, announced on May 9-11, could be extended.","originalDescription":"Про це він сказав під час спілкування з журналістами, передає РБК-Україна. \"Це я попросив, і президент Путін погодився, Зеленський погодився, обидва без вагань. І у нас є невеликий проміжок часу, коли вони не вбиватимуть людей, це дуже добре\", - зазначив президент США.Дональд Трамп також припустив, що перемир’я між Україною та Росією, оголошене на 9-11 травня, може бути продовжене.","lang":"uk","paywall":"no","refId":"88fbf7dd-ace4-4f32-a9ff-8307b1297743","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:227:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Says He Has Initiated a Three-Day Ceasefire Between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":"Трамп заявив, що ініціював триденне припинення вогню між Україною та РФ","url":"https://espreso.tv/svit-tramp-zayaviv-shcho-same-vin-initsiyuvav-tridenne-pripinennya-vognyu-mizh-ukrainoyu-ta-rf","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:227:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T06:52:04.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T06:20:12.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump requested a suspension of combat operations for the duration of Russia's Victory Day celebrations.","originalDescription":"Yhdysvaltain presidentti Donald Trump pyysi taistelutoimien keskeyttämistä Venäjän voitonpäivän juhlallisuuksien ajaksi.","lang":"fi","paywall":"no","refId":"eda9f397-82d8-42a8-bfc2-fa5292c6c373","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:416:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Declares Ceasefire Between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":"Trump julisti Ukrainan ja Venäjän välille tulitauon","url":"https://www.kauppalehti.fi/uutiset/a/032ce555-2c1c-4b31-8a0f-0853120a3da6","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:416:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T10:56:03.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T06:16:54.000Z","description":"Washington: President Donald Trump said Friday that the leaders of Russia and Ukraine have agreed to his request for a three-day ceasefire and an exchange of prisoners, adding that such a halt to hostilities could be the beginning of the end of the long war between them. Trump announced on social media that the ceasefire would run Saturday through Monday. Saturday is Victory Day in Russia, a holiday that commemorates its victory over Nazi German…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"02c83d3a-5bd6-4019-9b3d-b5d6db0bd482","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:336:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces three-day ceasefire in Russia-Ukraine war, prisoner exchange - OrissaPOST","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.orissapost.com/trump-announces-three-day-ceasefire-in-russia-ukraine-war-prisoner-exchange/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:336:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T11:26:55.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T06:16:00.000Z","description":"Russia and Ukraine confirmed on Friday that they had accepted a three-day ceasefire brokered by the United States. But Donald Trump is hopeful that the ceasefire will hold beyond May 11.","originalDescription":"Oroszország és Ukrajna pénteken megerősítette, hogy elfogadták az Egyesült Államok által közvetített háromnapos tűzszünetet. Donald Trump azonban abban reménykedik, hogy május 11-ét követően is kitart majd a fegyvernyugvás.","lang":"hu","paywall":"no","refId":"e6c5d4a9-43bb-44a3-8b70-18fd647a899f","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:213:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"A Turning Point in the War Could Come: Trump Floats a Longer Ceasefire","originalTitle":"Fordulat jöhet a háborúban: Trump hosszabb fegyvernyugvást lebegtetett be","url":"https://www.portfolio.hu/global/20260509/fordulat-johet-a-haboruban-trump-hosszabb-fegyvernyugvast-lebegtetett-be-835680","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4