z-ukrayinoiu-ta-rf-pislia-11-travnia-3079568.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:185:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T17:07:00.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T04:24:00.000Z","description":"Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky confirmed the three-day ceasefire with Russia announced Friday, May 8, by Donald Trump.","originalDescription":"Le président ukrainien Volodymyr Zelensky a confirmé le cessez-le-feu de trois jours avec la Russie annoncé vendredi 8 mai par Donald Trump.","lang":"fr","paywall":"no","refId":"3c4fc7ed-3d0e-4389-84e7-cd9a9074da94","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:338:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Donald Trump Announced a Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"Donald Trump a annoncé un cessez-le-feu de trois jours entre la Russie et l’Ukraine","url":"https://www.virgule.lu/international/donald-trump-a-annonce-un-cessez-le-feu-de-trois-jours-entre-la-russie-et-lukraine/151296725.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:338:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T07:37:46.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T03:55:20.000Z","description":"The truce must last three days, from 9 to 11 May, accompanied by an extensive exchange of prisoners. Russia is organizing a military parade this 9 May to commemorate the end of the Second World War.","originalDescription":"La trêve doit durer trois jours, du 9 au 11 mai, et s’accompagne d’un vaste échange de prisonniers. La Russie organise ce 9 mai un défilé militaire pour commémorer la fin de la Seconde guerre mondiale.","lang":"fr","paywall":"no","refId":"7fdeb41f-a529-446f-8780-5eef6461bb14","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:377:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Stop Fire Between Ukraine and Russia After Donald Trump's Surprise Diplomatic Intervention","originalTitle":"Cessez-le-feu entre l’Ukraine et la Russie après “une intervention diplomatique surprise” de Donald Trump","url":"https://www.courrierinternational.com/article/treve-cessez-le-feu-entre-l-ukraine-et-la-russie-apres-une-intervention-diplomatique-surprise-de-donald-trump_243830","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:377:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T05:49:20.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T03:42:50.000Z","description":"Image – @FurkanGozukara, X. Moscow and Kiev have confirmed the truce. US President Donald Trump on Friday announced a three-day ceasefire and a major prisoner swap between Moscow and Kiev, expressing hopes the truce would become the “beginning of the end of a very long, deadly, and hard fought war.” Trump took to his Truth Social network to make the unexpected announcement. The US president said the ceasefire would be in place for May 9-11, with…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"dc6be959-fbf6-4e86-a0d1-8a631443f7d8","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:465:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump declares three-day Russia-Ukraine ceasefire","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://dailytelegraph.co.nz/news/trump-declares-three-day-russia-ukraine-ceasefire/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:465:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T08:57:21.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T03:39:13.000Z","description":"In a significant development amidst ongoing conflict, former U.S. President Donald Trump has announced a three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia. The unexpected declaration comes as both nations continue to grapple with intense hostilities, raising hopes for a temporary pause in violence. Euronews.com examines the implications of this announcement and the prospects for lasting peace in the region. Trump Initiates Temporary Ceasefire Betwe…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"1c0fcd1e-7a57-4250-bace-ad0c953a0f00","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:436:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Declares Historic Three-Day Ceasefire Between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.mondialnews.com/2026/05/09/trump-declares-historic-three-day-ceasefire-between-ukraine-and-russia/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:436:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T08:29:12.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T03:30:04.000Z","description":"Russia and Ukraine confirmed on Friday (8) that they agreed to a three-day cease-fire, mediated by the United States, which will run from 9 to 11 May, and US President Donald Trump said he hoped it would be extended. Trump's announcement of a temporary cease-fire on social networks earlier that day also reported that each country, involved in more than four years of conflict, would exchange a thousand prisoners of war. 我I would like to see a sig…","originalDescription":"A Rússia e a Ucrânia confirmaram nesta sexta-feira (8) que concordaram com um cessar-fogo de três dias, mediado pelos Estados Unidos, que vigorará de 9 a 11 de maio, e o presidente americano, Donald Trump, disse esperar que ele seja prorrogado. O anúncio do cessar-fogo temporário feito por Trump nas redes sociais, mais cedo naquele dia, também informou que cada país, envolvido em mais de quatro anos de conflito, trocaria mil prisioneiros de guer…","lang":"pt","paywall":"no","refId":"1b29a2a2-2b0d-49ac-b08c-3a66ce876481","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:54:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Expects to Extend Cease-Fire Agreed Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"Trump espera estender cessar-fogo acordado entre Rússia e Ucrânia","url":"https://www.cnnbrasil.com.br/internacional/trump-espera-estender-cessar-fogo-acordado-entre-russia-e-ucrania/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:54:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T05:44:28.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T02:35:48.000Z","description":"US President Trump announces a 3-day Russia-Ukraine ceasefire from May 9-11, 2026. Read the latest updates on peace negotiations and prisoner exchange plans.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"ba6cab50-f8da-4895-88b7-511dc21b94b9","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:125:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"‘I’d love to end it’: Trump pushes Russia-Ukraine war as his ‘10th peace deal’","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://english.mathrubhumi.com/news/world/trump-russia-ukraine-ceasefire-may-2026-kntuja6v","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:125:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T12:23:13.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T02:26:00.000Z","description":"WASHINGTON DC, May 9 – US President Donald Trump has announced a three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine, after both countries accused each other of violating separate ceasefires declared by each side to cover the celebrations of the Soviet Union’s victory over Nazi Germany. “This ceasefire will include a suspension of all kinetic activity, and also a prison swap of 1,000 prisoners from each country,” the US President said. Shortly afterw…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"c61a2975-0a2d-4cf5-b31b-61429b743e45","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:252:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump says Russia and Ukraine to observe three-day ceasefire","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.capitalfm.co.ke/news/2026/05/trump-says-russia-and-ukraine-to-observe-three-day-ceasefire/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:252:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T06:43:31.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T01:38:47.000Z","description":"Moscow: The ceasefire, which will remain in effect until May 11, is expected to include a halt to all military operations between the two sides, alongside a major prisoner exchange involving 1,000 prisoners from each country. The announcement comes amid continued tensions on the battlefield, with both Moscow and Kyiv accusing each other of violating separate ceasefires that had previously been declared independently. In a post shared on Truth So…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"d465737c-cc53-4d28-8bcb-23cece48b776","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:456:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Russia, Ukraine agree to 3-day truce from May 9","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.thearabianstories.com/2026/05/09/russia-ukraine-agree-to-3-day-truce-from-may-9/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:456:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T09:14:07.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T01:13:04.000Z","description":"Russia and Ukraine on Friday agreed to a three-day ceasefire and a swap of 1,000 prisoners, reported Xinhua.\n\"At the instruction of Russian President Vladimir Putin, I confirm that U.S. President Donald Trump's initiative regarding the ceasefire and an exchange of prisoners of war between Russia and Ukraine is acceptable to the Russian side,\" Russian presidential aide Yuri Ushakov told reporters.\n\"We received Russia's agreement to conduct a pris…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"54bbfd9d-0f85-44da-ae1a-8033d40570fe","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:268:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Ukraine, Russia agree to 3-day ceasefire, prisoner exchange","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.dailyfinland.fi/europe/49202/Ukraine-Russia-agree-to-3-day-ceasefire-prisoner-exchange","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:268:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T02:13:24.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T00:52:34.000Z","description":"Russia and Ukraine would have reached a preliminary three-day ceasefire agreement, mediated in the context of diplomatic efforts promoted by the United States, coinciding with the celebrations of Victory Day in Moscow, which commemorates the Soviet triumph in World War II. According to reports released by international media, the truce would be temporary and would enter into force from Saturday, as a gesture of reduced hostilities during a date …","originalDescription":"Rusia y Ucrania habrían alcanzado un acuerdo preliminar de alto al fuego de tres días, mediado en el contexto de gestiones diplomáticas impulsadas por Estados Unidos, coincidiendo con las celebraciones del Día de la Victoria en Moscú, que conmemora el triunfo soviético en la Segunda Guerra Mundial. De acuerdo con reportes difundidos por medios internacionales, la tregua tendría carácter temporal y entraría en vigor a partir del sábado, como un g…","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"84c3c1dd-dd5f-4a51-a5c2-03c9f7376d8d","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:477:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Temporary Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine Would Include Massive Exchange of Prisoners, According to International Reports","originalTitle":"Alto al fuego temporal entre Rusia y Ucrania incluiría intercambio masivo de prisioneros, según reportes internacionales","url":"https://lapagina.com.sv/internacionales/alto-al-fuego-temporal-entre-rusia-y-ucrania-incluiria-intercambio-masivo-de-prisioneros-segun-reportes-internacionales/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:477:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T03:21:05.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T23:31:14.000Z","description":"The truce, confirmed by both sides after a week of negotiations in Florida, includes a massive exchange of 1,000 prisoners of war on each side. Trump called this breakthrough “the beginning of the end” of a conflict that he has described as deadly and difficult, pointing out that definitive peace is getting closer and closer. The agreement guarantees that Ukraine will not attack the victory day parade in Moscow’s Red Square, while the Kremlin ag…","originalDescription":"El presidente de Estados Unidos, Donald Trump un acuerdo de alto al fuego de tres días entre Rusia y Ucrania, el cual entrará en vigor a partir de este sábado. La tregua, confirmada por ambos bandos tras una semana de negociaciones en Florida, incluye un intercambio masivo de 1.000 prisioneros de guerra por cada lado. Trump calificó este avance como «el principio del fin» de un conflicto que ha calificado de mortal y difícil, señalando que la pa…","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"b4ee7626-2b03-40ec-9e5e-92b6366a89d9","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:459:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Historical Truce Between Russia and Ukraine (19:30)","originalTitle":"Trump anuncia tregua histórica de tres días entre Rusia y Ucrania (19:30)","url":"https://www.eldiario.net/portal/2026/05/08/trump-anuncia-tregua-historica-de-tres-dias-entre-rusia-y-ucrania-1930/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:459:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T10:45:39.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T23:01:00.000Z","description":"The US President's request received the approval of Putin and Zelensky","originalDescription":"O pedido do presidente norte-americano recebeu a aprovação de Putin e Zelensky","lang":"pt","paywall":"no","refId":"77a3617b-c28c-44a9-a24b-4c12d3c67903","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:68:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Cease-Fire Between Russia and Ukraine in the Hope that It Will Be \"the Beginning of the End of a Deadly War\"","originalTitle":"Trump anuncia cessar-fogo de três dias entre Rússia e Ucrânia na esperança de que seja \"o início do fim de uma guerra mortífera\"","url":"https://cnnportugal.iol.pt/guerra/russia/trump-anuncia-cessar-fogo-de-tres-dias-entre-russia-e-ucrania-na-esperanca-de-que-seja-o-inicio-do-fim-de-uma-guerra-mortifera/20260509/69fe6aabd34e28842c83d30e","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:68:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T01:29:56.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T22:48:14.000Z","description":"The Kremlin reported having accepted the proposal of U.S. President Donald Trump on a truce with Ukraine between May 9 and 11 and an exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each side. “Following instructions from President Vladimir Putin, I confirm Russian acceptance of the initiative recently proposed by U.S. President Donald Trump on a ceasefire for the exchange of prisoners of war between Russia and Ukraine,” Yuri Ushakov, Russian presidential advis…","originalDescription":"El Kremlin informó haber aceptado la propuesta del presidente estadounidense, Donald Trump, sobre una tregua con Ucrania entre el 9 y el 11 de mayo y un intercambio de mil prisioneros de cada bando.“Siguiendo instrucciones del presidente Vladímir Putin, confirmo la aceptación por parte rusa de la iniciativa propuesta recientemente por el presidente estadounidense Donald Trump sobre un alto el fuego para el intercambio de prisioneros de guerra en…","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"9a9c7d8a-4606-4555-9090-fef7e7a19f42","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:167:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Moscow Accepts Donald Trump’s Proposal for a Truce with Ukraine From May 9-11","originalTitle":"Moscú acepta la propuesta de Donald Trump sobre una tregua con Ucrania del 9 al 11 de mayo","url":"https://diariocorreo.pe/mundo/rusia-moscu-acepta-la-propuesta-de-donald-trump-sobre-una-tregua-con-ucrania-del-9-al-11-de-mayo-ucrania-zelenski-noticia/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:167:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T16:21:26.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T22:31:42.000Z","description":"The president of the United States, Donald Trump, announced this Friday a three-day truce in the conflict between Russia and Ukraine while \"continuing the talks\" to reach a peace agreement. The president warned that this could be \"the beginning of the end of a very long, bloody and harshly waged war.\" \"I am pleased to announce a three-day ceasefire (9, 10 and 11 May) in the war between Russia and Ukraine. Russia celebrates Victory Day, as well a…","originalDescription":"El presidente de Estados Unidos, Donald Trump, anunció este viernes una tregua de tres días en el conflicto entre Rusia y Ucrania al tiempo que \"continúan las conversaciones\" para llegar a un acuerdo de paz.\nEl mandatario avizoró que esto pueda ser \"el principio del fin de una guerra muy larga, sangrienta y duramente librada\".\n\"Me complace anunciar un alto el fuego de tres días (9, 10 y 11 de mayo) en la guerra entre Rusia y Ucrania. En Rusia se…","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"0165f960-9e81-471d-92df-efa2722e1c65","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:461:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announced a Three-Day Truce Between Ukraine and Russia: “the Beginning of the End”","originalTitle":"Trump anunció una tregua de tres días entre Ucrania y Rusia: “el principio del fin”","url":"https://www.dataclave.com.ar/poder/trump-anuncio-una-tregua-de-tres-dias-entre-ucrania-y-rusia---el-principio-del-fin-_a69fe6313f246a73cfdd03d03","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:461:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T06:25:58.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T22:22:45.000Z","description":"The President of Russia, Vladimir Putin, accepted the initiative of his American counterpart, Donald Trump, on the extension of the ceasefire and the exchange of prisoners with Ukraine, between 9 and 11 May. “On behalf of the President of the Russian Federation, Vladimir Putin, I confirm that the Russian side accepts the initiative just proposed by the President of the United States, Donald Trump, concerning a ceasefire for the exchange of priso…","originalDescription":"El presidente de Rusia, Vladimir Putin, aceptó la iniciativa de su homólogo estadounidense, Donald Trump, sobre la extensión del alto al fuego y el intercambio de prisioneros con Ucrania, entre el 9 y 11 de mayo. «Por encargo del presidente de la Federación de Rusia, Vladímir Putin, confirmo que la parte rusa acepta la iniciativa que acaba de proponer el presidente de Estados Unidos, Donald Trump, relativa a un alto el fuego para el intercambio …","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"7b7a65ad-f247-4703-8993-bd1e5885b830","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:453:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Putin Accepts Truce with Ukraine Proposed by Trump","originalTitle":"Putin acepta tregua con Ucrania propuesta por Trump","url":"https://fusernews.com/putin-acepta-tregua-con-ucrania-propuesta-portrump/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:453:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T02:41:05.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T22:09:12.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump announced a three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine on May 9-10-11. The ceasefire, which came into effect before Victory Day celebrations, will halt all attacks and include a mutual exchange of 1,000 prisoners of war. Trump's statement, \"This could be the beginning of the end of the war,\" made headlines around the world.","originalDescription":"ABD Başkanı Donald Trump, Rusya ile Ukrayna arasında 9-10-11 Mayıs tarihlerinde üç günlük ateşkes ilan edileceğini açıkladı. Zafer Günü kutlamaları öncesi devreye giren ateşkes kararının tüm saldırıları durduracağı ve tarafların karşılıklı biner savaş esiri takası yapacağı belirtilirken, Trump’ın “Bu savaşın sonunun başlangıcı olabilir” sözleri dünya gündemine damga vurdu.","lang":"tr","paywall":"no","refId":"8c07ad40-9cf5-4c69-b8f8-3b9cba12552e","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:127:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Halts Russia-Ukraine War for 72 Hours!","originalTitle":"Trump’tan Rusya-Ukrayna savaşına 72 saatlik fren!","url":"https://www.ahaber.com.tr/dunya/2026/05/09/trumptan-rusya-ukrayna-savasina-72-saatlik-fren","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:127:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T23:25:28.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T22:00:16.000Z","description":"U.S. President Donald Trump reported that Vladimir Putin and Volodimir Zelenski agreed to a 9-11 May ceasefire in the conflict between Russia and Ukraine. The truce contemplates the total suspension of attacks and a... Full Note »","originalDescription":"El presidente de Estados Unidos, Donald Trump, informó que Vladímir Putin y Volodímir Zelenski acordaron un alto el fuego del 9 al 11 de mayo en el conflicto entre Rusia y Ucrania. La tregua contempla la suspensión total de ataques y un... Nota completa »","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"9a337720-f342-4ac3-a332-58aeadb9bcf9","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:438:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Temporary Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine · Global Voices","originalTitle":"Trump anuncia alto el fuego temporal entre Rusia y Ucrania","url":"https://www.notisistema.com/noticias/trump-anuncia-alto-el-fuego-temporal-entre-rusia-y-ucrania/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:438:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T07:34:43.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T21:46:00.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump announced a three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine on Friday to mark Victory Day over Nazi Germany. According to the president, the ceasefire will include a suspension of all military activity and a prisoner exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each country. \nRussia had already announced a unilateral ceasefire on Tuesday, in time for the Victory Day parade that will be marked on a very limited scale tomorrow due to …","originalDescription":"נשיא ארצות הברית דונלד טראמפ הכריז היום (שישי) על הפסקת אש בת שלושה ימים בין רוסיה לאוקראינה, וזאת לרגל ציון יום הניצחון על גרמניה הנאצית. לדברי הנשיא, הפסקת האש תכלול השעיה של כל הפעילות הצבאית וחילופי שבויים של 1,000 אסירים מכל מדינה. \nרוסיה כבר הודיעה על הפסקת אש חד-צדדית שלשום, לרגל מצעד יום הניצחון שיצויין מחר באופן מצומצם מאוד בשל ההתקפות הרוסיות. מנגד, אוקראינה אתגרה את מוסקבה בתחילת השבוע כשהודיעה גם היא על הפסקת אש חד-צדדית משלה. \nלמרות…","lang":"he","paywall":"no","refId":"fec87677-2fa3-416d-be10-e99e15be2f8a","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:233:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"On the Occasion of Victory Day over Nazi Germany: 3-Day Ceasefire in the Ukrainian War","originalTitle":"לרגל יום הניצחון על גרמניה הנאצית: הפסקת אש בת 3 ימים במלחמת אוקראינה - וואלה חדשות","url":"https://news.walla.co.il/item/3836545","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:233:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T22:37:56.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T21:43:08.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump said that this weekend there will be a pause in the war between Russia and Ukraine in the framework of the commemorations for Victory Day. And it is that the Republican president gave this news through his social network, Truth Social, that this agreement contemplates the total suspension of military activities between both nations and will also be the exchange of a thousand prisoners for each country. Photo: Social net…","originalDescription":"El presidente de EU, Donald Trump, aseguró que este fin de semana va a haber una pausa en la guerra entre Rusia y Ucrania en el marco de las conmemoraciones por el Día de la Victoria. Y es que el presidente republicano dio esta noticia por medio de su red social, Truth Social, que este acuerdo contempla la suspensión total de actividades militares entre ambas naciones y también se dará el intercambio de mil prisioneros por cada país. Foto: Redes…","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"d6aa3a61-12ee-4aa7-8778-6b47c3bc8771","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:473:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Three Days Without War: Trump Says He Convinced Russia and Ukraine to Stop Conflict · Global Voices","originalTitle":"Tres días sin guerra: Trump asegura que convenció a Rusia y Ucrania de pausar el conflicto","url":"https://www.sopitas.com/noticias/alto-guerra-rusia-ucrania-trump/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:473:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T01:08:01.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T21:42:16.000Z","description":"U.S. President Donald Trump said Friday that his counterparts from Russia, Vladimir Putin, and Ukraine, Volodimir Zelenski, have agreed on a ceasefire between May 9 and 11, which includes suspending all attacks and an exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each country.\"I am pleased to announce that there will be a three-day ceasefire (9, 10 and 11 May) in the war between Russia and Ukraine. The celebration in Russia is on the occasion of Victory Day;…","originalDescription":"El presidente de EE. UU., Donald Trump, aseguró este viernes que sus homólogos de Rusia, Vladímir Putin, y de Ucrania, Volodímir Zelenski, han acordado un alto el fuego entre el 9 y el 11 de mayo que incluye suspender todo ataque y un intercambio de 1.000 prisioneros de cada país.\"Me complace anunciar que habrá un alto el fuego de tres días (9, 10 y 11 de mayo) en la guerra entre Rusia y Ucrania. La celebración en Rusia es con motivo del Día de …","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"b06c3405-2055-4ca2-b2d4-40ce33bfdd69","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:218:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Donald Trump Says Putin and Zelenski Have Agreed to a May 9-11 Ceasefire · Global Voices","originalTitle":"Donald Trump dice que Putin y Zelenski han acordado un alto el fuego del 9 al 11 de mayo","url":"https://rpp.pe/mundo/actualidad/trump-dice-que-putin-y-zelenski-han-acordado-un-alto-el-fuego-del-9-al-11-de-mayo-noticia-1687602","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:218:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T21:30:34.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T21:29:38.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump announced on Friday (May 8) that Russia and Ukraine have agreed to a three-day ceasefire and a large-scale prisoner exchange over the weekend.","originalDescription":"美國總統川普（特朗普）週五（5月8日）宣布，俄羅斯與烏克蘭已同意在週末實施為期三天的停火，並進行大規模換俘。","lang":"zh","paywall":"no","refId":"787ebe97-b26a-47b9-b0ad-5437f09d1f64","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:26:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine; Large-Scale Prisoner Exchange Between the Two Countries","originalTitle":"川普宣布俄烏停火三天 兩國大規模換俘 | 特朗普 | 普京 | 澤連斯基","url":"https://www.epochtimes.com/b5/26/5/8/n14759789.htm","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:26:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T23:13:40.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T21:28:00.000Z","description":"A ceasefire will be established on May 9, 10 and 11, and 1,000 prisoners of war will be exchanged.","originalDescription":"Prekid vatre biće uspostavljen 9, 10. i 11. maja, biće razmijenjeno po 1.000 ratnih zarobljenika","lang":"hr","paywall":"no","refId":"eb8b87a9-0759-47d8-a05c-f630d0b9e753","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:101:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Zelensky Confirmed the American Announcement About the Ceasefire and the Exchange of Prisoners, the Kremlin Agreed to the Proposal","originalTitle":"Zelenski potvrdio američku objavu o prekidu vatre i razmjeni zarobljenika, Kremlj pristao na predlog","url":"https://www.vijesti.me/svijet/evropa/807825/zelenski-potvrdio-americku-objavu-o-prekidu-vatre-i-razmjeni-zarobljenika-kremlj-pristao-na-predlog","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:101:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T23:03:41.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T21:20:25.000Z","description":"The President of the United States, Donald Trump, announced this Friday, May 8, a three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine, accepted by his counterparts Vladimir Putin and Volodimir Zelenski, respectively, in what he described as \"the beginning of the end of the war.\" \"I am pleased to announce that there will be a three-day ceasefire (9, 10 and 11 May) in the war between Russia and Ukraine. The celebration in Russia is for Victory Day, but…","originalDescription":"El presidente de los Estados Unidos, Donald Trump, anunció este viernes, 8 de mayo, un alto el fuego de tres días entre Rusia y Ucrania, aceptado por sus homólogos Vladímir Putin y Volodímir Zelenski, respectivamente, en lo que calificó como «el comienzo del fin de la guerra».   «Me complace anunciar que habrá un alto el fuego de tres días (9, 10 y 11 de mayo) en la guerra entre Rusia y Ucrania. La celebración en Rusia es por el Día de la Victor…","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"ecaf4b7a-f12b-47a5-940c-3e6dfdf5c535","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:381:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announced a Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine, Would Be “the Beginning of the End of the War”","originalTitle":"Trump anunció un alto el fuego entre Rusia y Ucrania, sería «el comienzo del fin de la guerra»","url":"https://caraotadigital.net/eeuu/trump-anuncio-un-alto-el-fuego-entre-rusia-y-ucrania-seria-el-comienzo-del-fin-de-la-guerra/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:381:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T22:24:07.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T21:16:31.000Z","description":"(The Lion) — Russia and Ukraine have agreed to a three-day ceasefire from Saturday to Monday, President Donald Trump announced Friday on Truth Social. Trump said he requested the ceasefire and it will include “a suspension of all kinetic activity, and also a prison swap of 1,000 prisoners from each Country.” “I am pleased to announce that there will be a THREE DAY CEASEFIRE (May 9th, 10th, and 11th) in the War between Russia and Ukraine. The Cel…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"0fac3217-6fec-4ae9-923e-ec39ac7aa93d","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articl