Trump anuncia un alto el fuego de tres días entre Ucrania y","url":"https://tvperu.gob.pe/noticias/internacionales/donald-trump-anuncia-un-alto-el-fuego-de-tres-dias-entre-ucrania-y-rusia","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:517:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T00:22:52.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T20:58:25.000Z","description":"President Donald Trump announced this Friday that Russia and Ukraine agreed to a three-day ceasefire in the ongoing war between the two countries, which, he said, will include a cessation of fighting and a large-scale prisoner exchange. The truce will extend from this Saturday, May 9, the original date of the festivity, until Monday 11. While the U.S. president said it is carried out mainly on Russian territory, he clarified that for Ukrainians …","originalDescription":"El presidente Donald Trump anunció este viernes que Rusia y Ucrania acordaron un alto el fuego de tres días en la guerra en curso entre ambos países, el cual, según dijo, incluirá un cese de los combates y un intercambio de prisioneros a gran escala. La tregua se extenderá desde este sábado, 9 de mayo, fecha original de la festividad, hasta el lunes 11. Si bien el presidente estadounidense indicó que se lleva a cabo principalmente en territorio …","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"d73c9616-a8cf-41d4-a264-2a4066d3bd5d","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:478:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announced a Three-Day Ceasefire in Russia’s War with Ukraine","originalTitle":"Trump anunció un cese al fuego de tres días en la guerra de Rusia con Ucrania","url":"https://www.conclusion.com.ar/internacionales/trump-anuncio-un-cese-al-fuego-de-tres-dias-en-la-guerra-de-rusia-con-ucrania/05/2026/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:478:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T21:04:47.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T20:50:31.000Z","description":"American President Donald Trump announced ”a three-day ceasefire (9, 10 and 11 May) in the war between Russia and Ukraine”. In his Truth Social Trump stated that ”Victory Day is celebrated in Russia, but also in Ukraine, since both countries played an important role in the Second World War”. What does the truce involve? Trump […]","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"61b16bf0-af57-46bb-a549-d7034c7f5ff2","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:445:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Ukraine-Russia, Trump announces truce: how long it lasts and what it foresees","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://observatorial.com/news/world/1715486/ukraine-russia-trump-announces-truce-how-long-it-lasts-and-what-it-foresees/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:445:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T00:36:28.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T20:42:51.000Z","description":"Russia and Ukraine will maintain a three-day ceasefire since Saturday, as announced by U.S. President Donald Trump, who...","originalDescription":"Rusia y Ucrania mantendrán desde este sábado un alto el fuego de tres días, según ha anunciado el presidente de Estados Unidos, Donald Trump, que h...","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"2f049b3b-90b5-4cab-81af-69a5831876d0","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:363:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Russia and Ukraine Agree on a Three-Day Truce and a Massive Exchange of Prisoners","originalTitle":"Rusia y Ucrania pactan una tregua de tres días y un canje masivo de prisioneros","url":"https://www.naiz.eus/es/info/noticia/20260508/rusia-y-ucrania-pactan-una-tregua-de-tres-dias-y-un-canje-de-prisioneros","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:363:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T21:02:15.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T20:41:09.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump declared on Friday a threeday ceasefire reached between Russia and Ukraine that includes a suspension of all kinetic activity and a swap of 1,000 prisoners from each Country. On Truth Social, Trump said, “I am pleased to announce that there will be a THREE DAY CEASEFIRE (May 9th, 10th, and 11th) in the War between Russia and Ukraine. The Celebration in Russia is for Victory Day but, likewise, in Ukraine, because they we…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"4535e7cd-9e3b-466c-bb55-f5af19ae93bd","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:457:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces three-day ceasefire between Russia, Ukraine - Times Kuwait","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://timeskuwait.com/trump-announces-three-day-ceasefire-between-russia-ukraine/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:457:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T23:35:26.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T20:40:04.000Z","description":"According to US President Donald Trump, Russia and Ukraine have been convinced of a three-day ceasefire that will begin on Saturday, which will include the suspension of all fighting and the exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each side, Trump wrote on Truth Social. The request had been made by him. He was Kremlin chief Vladimir Putin and Ukrainian president [...]","originalDescription":"US-Präsident Donald Trump hat nach eigenen Angaben Russland und die Ukraine von einer ab Samstag geltenden dreitägigen Waffenruhe überzeugt. Diese werde die Aussetzung aller Kampfhandlungen sowie den Austausch von 1.000 Gefangenen jeder Seite umfassen, schrieb Trump auf Truth Social. Die Bitte sei von ihm vorgebracht worden. Er sei Kremlchef Wladimir Putin und dem ukrainischen Präsidenten […]","lang":"de","paywall":"no","refId":"b2fb721c-3a8b-4b48-a2f0-f48e893e6687","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:458:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire in the Ukraine War","originalTitle":"Trump kündigt dreitägige Waffenruhe im Ukraine-Krieg an","url":"https://www.suedtirolnews.it/politik/trump-kuendigt-dreitaegige-waffenruhe-im-ukraine-krieg-an","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:458:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T08:34:35.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T20:30:57.000Z","description":"Donald Trump announced this Friday, May 8, 2026 a three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia from Saturday, accompanied by an exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each country. Moscow and Volodymyr Zelensky confirmed the agreement, but the drone attacks were still going on this Friday.","originalDescription":"Donald Trump a annoncé ce vendredi 8 mai 2026 un cessez-le-feu de trois jours entre l’Ukraine et la Russie à partir de samedi, accompagné d’un échange de 1.000 prisonniers de chaque pays. Moscou et Volodymyr Zelensky ont confirmé l’accord, mais les attaques de drones se poursuivaient encore ce vendredi.","lang":"fr","paywall":"no","refId":"bceeb3be-94a5-44b7-b488-4f69447db5c0","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:419:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"\"Let's Hope This Is the Beginning of the End of a Very Long War\": Donald Trump Announces a Three-Day Ceasefire and an Exchange of 1,000 Prisoners Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"« Espérons que ce soit le début de la fin d’une guerre très longue » : Donald Trump annonce un cessez-le-feu de trois jours et un échange de 1.000 prisonniers entre la Russie et l’Ukraine","url":"https://www.nicematin.com/societe/conflits/esperons-que-ce-soit-le-debut-de-la-fin-d-une-guerre-tres-longue-donald-trump-annonce-un-cessez-le-feu-de-trois-jours-et-un-echange-de-1-000-prisonniers-entre-la-russie-et-l-ukraine-10679934","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:419:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T05:08:17.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T20:28:23.000Z","description":"WASHINGTON (Agencies) : President Donald Trump said Friday that the leaders of Russia and Ukraine have agreed to his request for a three-day ceasefire and an exchange of prisoners, adding that such a halt to hostilities could be the “beginning of the end” of the long war between them. Trump announced on social media that the ceasefire would run Saturday through Monday. Saturday is Victory Day in Russia, a holiday that commemorates its victory ov…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"2a10d0f8-cc1d-4825-b276-6efb92936a9d","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:417:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces three-day Ukraine-Russia ceasefire, prisoner swap","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://thefrontierpost.com/trump-announces-three-day-ukraine-russia-ceasefire-prisoner-swap/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:417:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:45:44.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T20:21:20.000Z","description":"Red Square is less important than the lives of Ukrainian prisoners: Zelensky confirmed the three-day truce and the Minister of Foreign Affairs President Zelensky confirmed the May 9-11 truce and the exchange of prisoners in the format of 1000 to 1000. Agreement reached for\nMediation by the United States.","originalDescription":"Красна площа менш важлива, ніж життя українських полонених: Зеленський підтвердив триденне перемир'я та обмінПрезидент Зеленський підтвердив перемир'я 9-11 травня та обмін полоненими у форматі 1000 на 1000. Домовленості досягнуто за\nпосередництва США.","lang":"uk","paywall":"no","refId":"e1f22ac7-3ca0-420b-bee0-56289cc67240","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:209:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Red Square Is Less Important than the Lives of Ukrainian Prisoners: Zelensky Confirms Three-Day Truce and Exchange","originalTitle":"Красна площа менш важлива, ніж життя українських полонених: Зеленський підтвердив триденне перемир'я та обмін","url":"https://unn.ua/news/krasna-ploshcha-mensh-vazhlyva-nizh-zhyttia-ukrainskykh-polonenykh-zelenskyi-pidtverdyv-trydenne-peremyria-ta-obmin","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:209:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T05:54:02.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T20:16:01.000Z","description":"U.S. President Donald Trump announced a three-day ceasefire agreement between Russia and Ukraine. \"I am pleased to announce that there will be a three-day ceasefire—on May 9, 10 and 11—in the war between Russia and Ukraine. The celebration in Russia is for Victory Day, but also in Ukraine, because they were also a big part and an important factor in the Second World War,\" said U.S. President in Truth Social. The U.S. President said that during t…","originalDescription":"El presidente de Estados Unidos, Donald Trump, anunció un acuerdo de alto el fuego entre Rusia y Ucrania por tres días. \n\"Me complace anunciar que habrá un alto el fuego de tres días —el 9, 10 y 11 de mayo— en la guerra entre Rusia y Ucrania. La celebración en Rusia es por el Día de la Victoria, pero también en Ucrania, porque ellos también fueron una gran parte y un factor importante de la Segunda Guerra Mundial\", expresó el mandatario norteame…","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"34d297a3-e55e-4607-be60-f62744b004e4","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:397:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Donald Trump Announced a Three-Day Truce Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"Donald Trump anunció una tregua de tres días entre Rusia y Ucrania","url":"https://www.cba24n.com.ar/internacionales/donald-trump-anuncio-una-tregua-de-tres-dias-entre-rusia-y-ucrania-_a69fe42ebe04f5abb9f1c8c56","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:397:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T23:54:13.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T20:15:00.000Z","description":"Vladimir Putin's advisor Yuri Ushakov announced that Russia has accepted Donald Trump's initiative to establish a ceasefire with Ukraine on May 9-11.","originalDescription":"Doradca Władimira Putina Jurij Uszakow poinformował, że Rosja zaakceptowała inicjatywę Donalda Trumpa ws. zawieszenia broni z Ukrainą w dniach 9-11 maja.","lang":"pl","paywall":"no","refId":"7f2e1b8f-ca90-4f36-b667-7dc4720fdc01","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:170:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"\"Trump's Initiative Acceptable to Russia.\" The Kremlin Confirms","originalTitle":"\"Inicjatywa Trumpa akceptowalna dla Rosji\". Kreml potwierdza","url":"https://dorzeczy.pl/swiat/884620/wojna-na-ukrainie-kreml-zgodzil-sie-na-rozejm-ogloszony-przez-trumpa.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:170:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T01:22:08.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T20:08:25.000Z","description":"President Donald Trump announced a three day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine beginning on May 9, saying the pause would include a halt to all kinetic activity and a prisoner exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each side.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"6b1f9dab-728c-4b4b-bdfe-629bf22a67d8","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:496:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three Day Russia Ukraine Ceasefire","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://anash.org/trump-announces-three-day-russia-ukraine-ceasefire/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:496:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T21:55:25.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T20:04:30.000Z","description":"Washington — President Trump on Friday announced Russia and Ukraine will swap 1,000 prisoners as a part of a three-day ceasefire for the observation of Victory Day in Russia this weekend.  Russia and Ukraine previously announced separate ceasefires on different days, so the timeline isn’t entirely clear. Mr. Trump said the temporary ceasefire will suspend all kinetic activity Saturday through Monday. In statements, Ukraine and Russia appeared to…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"61a94b98-3236-4acc-b83d-d38311edb0f9","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:531:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces prisoner swap in 3-day Russia-Ukraine ceasefire","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.us-inquirer.com/story/trump-announces-prisoner-swap-in-3-day-russia-ukraine-ceasefire/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:531:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T23:28:57.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:59:48.000Z","description":"U.S. President Donald Trump said Friday that the presidents of Russia and Ukraine accepted his request for a three-day ceasefire and an exchange of prisoners, adding that such a pause in hostilities could be the “beginning of the end” of the long war between the two.","originalDescription":"El mandatario estadounidense Donald Trump afirmó el viernes que los presidentes de Rusia y Ucrania aceptaron su solicitud de un alto el fuego de tres días y un intercambio de prisioneros, y añadió que una pausa así en las hostilidades podría ser el “comienzo del fin” de la larga guerra entre ambos.","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"16622077-30b1-4386-8f9a-7e38119fdce9","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:184:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Says Russia and Ukraine Accepted His Request for a Three-Day Truce and Exchange of Prisoners","originalTitle":"Trump dice que Rusia y Ucrania aceptaron su pedido de tregua de 3 días y canje de presos","url":"https://www.independentespanol.com/noticias/mundo/europa/trump-dice-que-rusia-y-ucrania-aceptaron-su-pedido-de-tregua-de-3-dias-y-canje-de-presos-b2973339.html","wireStoryId":"d4c1dc9f-f76f-4732-ba69-82034fc8cbe9","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:184:sourceInfo","wireStories":[{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T17:47:11.000Z","date":"2026-05-09T16:41:46.000Z","description":"Washington (AP) – U.S. President Donald Trump said Friday that the presidents of Russia and Ukraine had accepted his request for a three-day ceasefire and prisoner exchange, adding that such a pause in hostilities could be the “beginning of the end” of the long war between the two countries. Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky confirmed the agreement. There was no comment from Russian President Vladimir Putin or the Kremlin. Trump announced o…","originalDescription":"Washington (AP) – El mandatario estadounidense Donald Trump afirmó el viernes que los presidentes de Rusia y Ucrania aceptaron su solicitud de un alto el fuego de tres días y un intercambio de prisioneros, y añadió que una pausa así en las hostilidades podría ser el “comienzo del fin” de la larga guerra entre ambos. El presidente ucraniano Volodimir Zelensky confirmó el acuerdo. No hubo comentarios del presidente ruso Vladimir Putin ni del Kreml…","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"633a5971-6dfe-4bf6-a1de-e3b0d6b93e88","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:429:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Says Russia and Ukraine Accepted His Request for a Three-Day Truce and Exchange of Prisoners","originalTitle":"Trump dice que Rusia y Ucrania aceptaron su pedido de tregua de 3 días y canje de presos","url":"https://diariosanrafael.com.ar/trump-dice-que-rusia-y-ucrania-aceptaron-su-pedido-de-tregua-de-3-dias-y-canje-de-presos/","wireStoryId":"d4c1dc9f-f76f-4732-ba69-82034fc8cbe9","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:429:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false}]},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T01:30:10.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:56:30.000Z","description":"Donald Trump announced Friday, May 8, 2026 a three-day truce between Russia and Ukraine from Saturday, accompanied by an exchange of 1,000 prisoners per camp, hoping to see in this break \"the beginning of the...","originalDescription":"Donald Trump a annoncé vendredi 8 mai 2026 une trêve de trois jours entre la Russie et l’Ukraine à partir de samedi, assortie d’un échange de 1 000 prisonniers par camp, espérant voir dans cette pause \"le début de la...","lang":"fr","paywall":"no","refId":"265844c2-8faf-43ac-a274-2b8674b020c7","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:328:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"War in Ukraine: Trump Announces a Three-Day Ceasefire and an Exchange of 2,000 Prisoners, \"the Beginning of the End\" of the Conflict?","originalTitle":"Guerre en Ukraine : Trump annonce un cessez-le-feu de 3 jours et un échange de 2 000 prisonniers, \"le début de la fin\" du conflit ?","url":"https://www.midilibre.fr/2026/05/08/guerre-en-ukraine-trump-annonce-un-cessez-le-feu-de-3-jours-et-un-echange-de-2-000-prisonniers-le-debut-de-la-fin-du-conflit-13362529.php","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:328:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T01:55:55.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:45:34.000Z","description":"Russia accepted the initiative of US President Donald Trump on an armistice with Ukraine from 9 to 11 May and with an exchange of prisoners with Kiev during this interval, Kremlin councillor Iuri Usakov said Friday. Trump announced on Friday on online social networks that there will be a three-day armistice [...]","originalDescription":"Rusia a acceptat inițiativa președintelui american, Donald Trump, privind un armistițiu cu Ucraina în perioada 9 – 11 mai și cu efectuarea unui schimb de prizonieri cu Kievul în acest interval, a declarat vineri consilierul Kremlinului, Iuri Ușakov. Trump a anunțat vineri pe rețelele de socializare online că va exista un armistițiu de trei zile […]","lang":"ro","paywall":"no","refId":"899c947b-7317-43d5-a0ff-ed9270135662","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:399:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Russia Claims Trump's Proposal on a Three-Day Truce with Ukraine Has Been Accepted by the Rador Press Agency","originalTitle":"Rusia afirmă că a acceptat propunerea lui Trump privind un armistiţiu de trei zile cu Ucraina | Agenția de presă Rador","url":"https://www.rador.ro/2026/05/08/rusia-afirma-ca-a-acceptat-propunerea-lui-trump-privind-un-armistitiu-de-trei-zile-cu-ucraina/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:399:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T01:04:27.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:45:00.000Z","description":"The agreement also includes a massive exchange of prisoners.","originalDescription":"El acuerdo tambi�n incluir� un intercambio masivo de prisioneros.","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"2e28c7db-b94e-47cb-99e2-5d3ce521ceaf","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:378:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announced a Truce Between Russia and Ukraine: \"It May Be the Beginning of the End of the War\"","originalTitle":"Trump anunció una tregua entre Rusia y Ucrania: \"Puede ser el principio del fin de la guerra\"","url":"https://www.somosjujuy.com.ar/internacionales/trump-anuncio-una-tregua-rusia-ucrania-puede-ser-principio-fin-guerra-n117651","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:378:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:52:24.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:42:24.000Z","description":"This article summarizes the most important events of the Ukrainian war from Friday, May 8, 2026. This is the 1534th day of the war. Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyi confirms the US announcement of a three-day ceasefire with Russia. Zelenskyi said on the messaging service Telegram that a ceasefire has been agreed to from May 9 to 11 through the US.","originalDescription":"Tähän artikkeliin on koottu Ukrainan sodan keskeisimmät tapahtumat perjantailta 8. toukokuuta 2026. Kyseessä on sodan 1534. päivä. Ukrainan presidentti Volodymyr Zelenskyi vahvistaa Yhdysvaltojen ilmoituksen kolmen päivän tulitauosta Venäjän kanssa. Zelenskyi kertoi viestipalvelu Telegramissa, että Yhdysvaltojen välityksellä on sovittu tulitauosta 9.–11. toukokuuta.","lang":"fi","paywall":"no","refId":"3bcb045a-c920-482c-9a0e-de150a3707be","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:135:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Zelensky Makes Surprise Announcement Before Victory Day","originalTitle":"Zelenskyiltä yllätysilmoitus ennen voitonpäivää","url":"https://www.iltalehti.fi/ulkomaat/a/8d259f2c-3548-43f3-b566-4e28e922d1b9","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:135:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:11:33.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:39:00.000Z","description":"Ceasefire in days of celebration of the end of World War II, from 9 to 11 May, provides for the exchange of a thousand prisoners on each side. Agreement was by the United States and announced by Donald Trump.","originalDescription":"Cessar-fogo em dias de comemoração do fim da II Guerra Mundial, de 9 a 11 de Maio, prevê troca de mil prisioneiros de cada lado. Acordo foi pelos Estados Unidos e anunciado por Donald Trump.","lang":"pt","paywall":"no","refId":"ff0837d4-4029-48d1-bb1e-dfda2d9f6e56","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:76:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Russia and Ukraine Reach Agreement for Three-Day Truce and Prisoner Exchange","originalTitle":"Rússia e Ucrânia chegam a acordo para trégua de três dias e troca de prisioneiros","url":"https://www.publico.pt/2026/05/08/mundo/noticia/russia-ucrania-chegam-acordo-tregua-tres-dias-troca-prisioneiros-2174098","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:76:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T07:09:20.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:35:17.000Z","description":"Editor’s Note:It’s Friday, 10 pm in Kyiv, and as our team prepares to take shelter during a threatening weekend, the news of a ceasefire is breaking. This is personal for us, and we always keep you in the loop, no matter what.If you support our on-the-ground journalism, subscribe to read our stories without any restrictions.Subscribe for Free!Tip jar! Russian Federal Guard Service (FSO) officers patrol central Moscow on May 5, 2026, in front of …","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"a67d8590-085b-418f-9353-aa1a390fee03","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:527:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"NEWSFLASH: Trump declares a 3-day Ukraine-Russia ceasefire","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.counteroffensive.news/p/newsflash-trump-declares-a-3-day","wireStoryId":null,"sourceI