así como la …","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"3d3e9dcc-78d4-4f37-a855-304372fc28a1","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:519:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Truce Between Ukraine and Russia · Global Voices","originalTitle":"Trump anuncia tregua de tres días entre Ucrania y Rusia","url":"https://www.tcsahora.com/trump-anuncia-tregua-de-tres-dias-entre-ucrania-y-rusia/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:519:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:56:20.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:29:52.000Z","description":"The US President announces a suspension of hostilities accompanied by an exchange of prisoners, while the two sides continue their strikes. Donald Trump announced on Friday a three-day ceasefire agreement between Ukraine and Russia, which is due to enter into force on Saturday. The leader of the White House expressed the hope that this break [...] The Trump article imposes a three-day truce between Kiev and Moscow appeared first on Le Singulier.","originalDescription":"Le président américain annonce une suspension des hostilités accompagnée d’un échange de prisonniers, tandis que les deux camps poursuivent leurs frappes. Donald Trump a dévoilé vendredi un accord de cessez-le-feu de trois jours entre l’Ukraine et la Russie, qui doit entrer en vigueur samedi. Le chef de la Maison-Blanche a exprimé l’espoir que cette pause […] L’article Trump impose une trêve de trois jours entre Kiev et Moscou est apparu en prem…","lang":"fr","paywall":"no","refId":"8afa7d12-4869-4bf5-9af3-31a7e8d152a7","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:452:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Imposes a Three-Day Truce Between Kiev and Moscow","originalTitle":"Trump impose une trêve de trois jours entre Kiev et Moscou","url":"https://lesinguliersete.fr/trump-impose-une-treve-de-trois-jours-entre-kiev-et-moscou/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:452:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:01:56.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:27:54.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump said Friday that his counterparts from Russia, Vladimir Putin, and Ukraine, Volodimir Zelenski, have agreed to a ceasefire between May 9 and 11, which includes suspending all attacks and an exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each country. “I am pleased to announce that there will be a [...] Trump entry says that Putin and Zelenski agree to a ceasefire from May 9 to 11 was first published in Information Focus.","originalDescription":"El presidente de EEUU, Donald Trump, aseguró este viernes que sus homólogos de Rusia, Vladímir Putin, y de Ucrania, Volodímir Zelenski, han acordado un alto el fuego entre el 9 y el 11 de mayo que incluye suspender todo ataque y un intercambio de 1.000 prisioneros de cada país. «Me complace anunciar que habrá un […] La entrada Trump dice que Putin y Zelenski acuerdan un alto el fuego del 9 al 11 de mayo se publicó primero en Foco Informativo.","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"85bc227f-10aa-4497-9eed-26b6b09e52c1","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:295:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Says Putin and Zelenski Agree to Ceasefire May 9-11 - Information Focus","originalTitle":"Trump dice que Putin y Zelenski acuerdan un alto el fuego del 9 al 11 de mayo - Foco Informativo","url":"https://focoinformativo.site/trump-dice-que-putin-y-zelenski-acuerdan-un-alto-el-fuego-del-9-al-11-de-mayo/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:295:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T11:37:15.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:23:31.000Z","description":"A little more than a week after the telephone conversation he had with Vladimir Putin, Donald Trump announced this Friday a three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine on the occasion of the celebration of Victory Day, celebrated annually by the Kremlin in commemoration of the victory against the Nazis during the Second World War: “We are getting closer and closer to the end of the conflict”.\nThe truce will run from this Saturday, May 9 and t…","originalDescription":"A poco más de una semana de la conversación telefónica que mantuvo con Vladimir Putin, Donald Trump anunció este viernes un cese al fuego de tres días entre Rusia y Ucrania con motivo de la celebración del Día de la Victoria, festejado anualmente por el Kremlin en conmemoración de la victoria ante los nazis durante la Segunda Guerra Mundial: \"Nos acercamos cada vez más al fin del conflicto\".\nLa tregua se extenderá desde este sábado, 9 de mayo y …","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"b1d86aa5-5ecc-4f00-8a8e-a019572b568c","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:393:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announced a Three-Day Ceasefire in Russia's War with Ukraine: “We Are Nearing the End of the Conflict”","originalTitle":"Trump anunció un cese al fuego de tres días en la guerra de Rusia con Ucrania: \"Nos acercamos al fin del conflicto\"","url":"https://elcanciller.com/internacional/trump-anuncio-un-cese-al-fuego-de-tres-dias-en-la-guerra-de-rusia-con-ucrania---nos-acercamos-al-fin-del-conflicto-_a69fe315138106afd31ee108b","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:393:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T21:06:58.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:20:00.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump announced that a three-day truce had been agreed in the war between Ukraine and Russia and stated that there would be another exchange of war weapons.","originalDescription":"Američki predsednik Donald Tramp saopštio je da dogovoreno trodnevno primirje u ratu između Ukrajine i Rusije i naveo da će doći do još jedne razmene ratnih zar","lang":"sr","paywall":"no","refId":"8c9bf2f8-db56-475d-92e5-9b81d8d40933","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:87:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump: Agreed Three-Day Truce in Ukraine","originalTitle":"Tramp: Dogovoreno trodnevno primirje u Ukrajini","url":"https://n1info.rs/svet/tramp-dogovoreno-trodnevno-primirje-u-ukrajini/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:87:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T21:55:39.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:18:19.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump announced on Friday a three-day ceasefire in the Russian war of aggression against Ukraine. Kiev and Moscow confirmed the information. In addition, the two states will exchange 1,000 prisoners of war.","originalDescription":"US-Präsident Donald Trump hat am Freitag eine dreitägige Waffenruhe im russischen Angriffskrieg gegen die Ukraine verkündet. Kiew und Moskau bestätigten die Angaben. Zudem werden die beiden Staaten 1.000 Kriegsgefangene austauschen.","lang":"de","paywall":"no","refId":"7be545b3-6fac-4d5f-93f9-02b3c1710ade","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:104:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Ukraine: Three-Day Ceasefire Announced","originalTitle":"Ukraine: Dreitägige Waffenruhe angekündigt","url":"https://orf.at/stories/3429298/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:104:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T00:42:06.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:15:27.000Z","description":"Donald Trump has announced a three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine starting May 9th. A prisoner exchange is also to be part of the agreement.","originalDescription":"Donald Trump hat eine dreitägige Feuerpause zwischen Russland und Ukraine ab dem 9. Mai angekündigt. Teil der Vereinbarung soll auch ein Gefangenenaustausch sein.","lang":"de","paywall":"no","refId":"ef88a7b4-fd21-477c-b371-a9196fe54b93","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:309:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine – Kyiv and Moscow Confirm","originalTitle":"Trump kündigt dreitägige Waffenruhe zwischen Russland und Ukraine an – Kiew und Moskau bestätigen","url":"https://www.epochtimes.de/politik/ausland/trump-ab-samstag-dreitaegige-waffenruhe-zwischen-russland-und-ukraine-a5484765.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:309:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T02:23:34.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:12:07.000Z","description":"Ukraine and Russia have agreed to a three-day ceasefire to mark Victory Day. The truce, scheduled for May 9, 10 and 11, has been accepted by Ukrainian and Russian presidents Volodymyr Zelensky and Vladimir Putin. US President Donald Trump announced the agreement, which was later confirmed by the Ukrainian president. Trump explained in a message on social media that the agreement includes the suspension of all military activity and an exchange of…","originalDescription":"Ucraïna i Rússia han acordat un alto-el-foc de tres dies amb motiu del Dia de la Victòria. La treva, prevista per als dies 9, 10 i 11 de maig, ha estat acceptada pels presidents ucraïnès i rus, Volodímir Zelenski i Vladímir Putin. El president dels Estats Units, Donald Trump, ha anunciat el pacte, que més tard ha estat confirmat pel president ucraïnès. Trump ha explicat en un missatge a les xarxes socials que l’acord inclou la suspensió de tota …","lang":"ca","paywall":"no","refId":"34501e1c-43f4-41e4-8143-c2cb6d30be6a","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:306:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Ukraine and Russia Agree to a Three-Day Ceasefire for Victory Day","originalTitle":"Ucraïna i Rússia pacten un alto-el-foc de tres dies pel Dia de la Victòria","url":"https://www.vilaweb.cat/noticies/alto-foc-russia-ucraina-dia-victoria/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:306:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:51:56.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:10:22.000Z","description":"Moscow confirmed an exchange of prisoners with Kiev. The post Stop it three days between Moscow and Kiev appeared first on Business.","originalDescription":"Moscou a confirmé un échange de prisonniers avec Kiev. The post Cessez-le feu de trois jours entre Moscou et Kiev appeared first on Les Affaires.","lang":"fr","paywall":"no","refId":"918ebb30-6bb3-499f-bf91-97d06a1a75a2","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:468:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Stop the Three-Day Fire Between Moscow and Kiev","originalTitle":"Cessez-le feu de trois jours entre Moscou et Kiev","url":"https://www.lesaffaires.com/secteurs/monde/cessez-le-feu-de-trois-jours-entre-moscou-et-kiev/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:468:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T23:31:48.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:05:47.000Z","description":"","originalDescription":null,"lang":"ru","paywall":"no","refId":"5cb21bde-06f7-46a8-9e28-117de934b63c","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:408:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announced a Three-Day Truce and a Large-Scale Exchange of Prisoners Between Russia and Ukraine.","originalTitle":"Трамп объявил о трехдневном перемирии и масштабном обмене пленными между Россией и Украиной. Москва и Киев поддержали предложение — Новая газета Европа","url":"https://novayagazeta.eu/articles/2026/05/08/tramp-obiavil-o-trekhdnevnom-peremirii-i-masshtabnom-obmene-plennymi-mezhdu-rossiei-i-ukrainoi-news","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:408:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T02:32:04.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:05:00.000Z","description":"US President Trump announced that Russia and Ukraine have agreed on a three-day temporary ceasefire and a reciprocal exchange of 1,000 prisoners of war.","originalDescription":"ABD Başkanı Trump yaptığı açıklamada Rusya ile Ukrayna'nın 3 günlük geçici ateşkes ve karşılıklı 1000 esir asker değişimi üzerine anlaştıklarını belirtti","lang":"tr","paywall":"no","refId":"f721d2b9-728a-4406-bd60-ce381dd44eda","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:39:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announced It! Russia and Ukraine Have Reached an Agreement.","originalTitle":"Trump açıkladı! Rusya ve Ukrayna anlaştı","url":"https://www.aydinlik.com.tr/haber/trump-acikladi-rusya-ve-ukrayna-anlasti-576327","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:39:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T00:22:43.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:03:20.000Z","description":"They agree to exchange a thousand imprisoned soldiers; Russia will conduct its victory day military parade","originalDescription":"Acuerdan el intercambio de mil soldados presos; Rusia llevara a cabo su desfile militar del Día de la Victoria","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"bc620874-6694-45b9-9889-ec93f3e8df0a","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:522:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Russia and Ukraine Accept Truce From 9 to 11 May Mediated by Washington - The Sun of Mexico News, Sports, Gossip, Columns","originalTitle":"Rusia y Ucrania aceptan tregua del 9 al 11 de mayo mediada por Washington - El Sol de México | Noticias, Deportes, Gossip, Columnas","url":"https://oem.com.mx/elsoldemexico/mundo/rusia-y-ucrania-aceptan-tregua-del-9-al-11-de-mayo-mediada-por-washington-29882658","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:522:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T01:49:07.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T19:00:00.000Z","description":"The US President said that Russia and Ukraine have agreed on a three-day ceasefire. Trump added that he made this proposal himself, and Putin and Zelenskiy agreed. “This ceasefire will include the suspension of all hostilities, as well as the exchange of prisoners — 1,000 from each side [...] The celebration in Russia is associated with Victory Day, but also in Ukraine, as it also played a significant role in World War II,” the American leader w…","originalDescription":"Президент США заявил, что Россия и Украина договорились о прекращении огня на трое суток. Трамп добавил, что сам внес это предложение, а Путин с Зеленским согласились. „ «Это прекращение огня будет включать в себя приостановку всех боевых действий, а также обмен пленными — по 1000 с каждой стороны. [...] Празднование в России связано с Днем Победы, но также и в Украине, поскольку она тоже сыграла значительную роль во Второй мировой войне», — нап…","lang":"ru","paywall":"no","refId":"3fe7bc14-8d75-420c-8351-3fe81cd87fcc","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:524:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Moscow and Kiev Confirmed Trump's Ceasefire From May 9 to May 11. Zelenskiy Said He Did This for the Sake of Exchanging Prisoners — Novaya Gazeta","originalTitle":"Москва и Киев подтвердили объявленное Трампом прекращение огня с 9 по 11 мая. Зеленский заявил, что пошел на это ради обмена пленными — Новая газета","url":"https://novayagazeta.ru/articles/2026/05/08/moskva-i-kiev-podtverdili-obiavlennoe-trampom-prekrashchenie-ognia-s-9-po-11-maia-zelenskii-zaiavil-chto-poshel-na-eto-radi-obmena-plennymi-news","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:524:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:13:36.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:56:59.000Z","description":"The ceasefire and prisoner swap may signal a shift towards diplomatic resolutions, potentially influencing future peace negotiations and market optimism. The post Russia, Ukraine agree to three-day ceasefire with prisoner swap appeared first on Crypto Briefing.","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"17d86a95-cd0e-404e-99e0-bf43d0faba27","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:425:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Russia, Ukraine agree to three-day ceasefire with prisoner swap","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://cryptobriefing.com/russia-ukraine-agree-to-three-day-ceasefire-with-prisoner-swap/","wireStoryId":"8bd0747f-ec52-47fc-b821-0808e9622b29","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:425:sourceInfo","wireStories":[{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T08:43:35.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T23:45:42.000Z","description":"The post Russia, Ukraine agree to three-day ceasefire with prisoner swap appeared on BitcoinEthereumNews.com. ## Market Snapshot The market “Russia x Ukraine ceasefire by June 30, 2026?” currently shows a 59% YES probability. The announcement of a three-day ceasefire with a prisoner swap has increased this from 8% just 24 hours ago. The “Russia x Ukraine ceasefire by May 31, 2026?” market also rose to 52% YES. ## Key Takeaways – The announcement…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"48c7e9bf-2e30-4d56-9856-cbf965161213","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:203:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Russia, Ukraine agree to three-day ceasefire with prisoner swap","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://bitcoinethereumnews.com/tech/russia-ukraine-agree-to-three-day-ceasefire-with-prisoner-swap/","wireStoryId":"8bd0747f-ec52-47fc-b821-0808e9622b29","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:203:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false}]},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T06:47:15.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:55:55.000Z","description":"An exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each country has been agreed","originalDescription":"Se ha acordado un intercambio de 1.000 prisioneros de cada país","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"579d1177-9d1d-4516-8e27-eeabdc5569c9","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:312:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Zelenski Confirms a Truce Agreement with Russia From 9 to 11 May with US Mediation","originalTitle":"Zelenski confirma un acuerdo de tregua con Rusia del 9 al 11 de mayo con mediación de EEUU","url":"https://www.elprogreso.es/articulo/mundo/zelenski-confirma-acuerdo-tregua-rusia-9-11-mayo-mediacion-eeuu/202605082055551968688.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:312:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T21:46:39.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:53:28.000Z","description":"Moscow has agreed to Donald Trump's ceasefire initiative. The Russian president's foreign policy adviser and the US president both announced that a three-day ceasefire would be in place.","originalDescription":"Moszkva beleegyezett Donald Trump tűzszüneti kezdeményezésébe. Az orosz elnök külpolitikai tanácsadója és az amerikai elnök is közölte, háromnapos tűzszünet jön.","lang":"hu","paywall":"no","refId":"a456d88a-1cf7-447e-a371-778899a2d309","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:74:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Has Arranged: the Guns in Ukraine Will Fall Silent for Three Days, Moscow and Kiev Have Both Agreed to the Ceasefire","originalTitle":"Trump elintézte: három napra elnémulnak a fegyverek Ukrajnában, Moszkva és Kijev is beleegyezett a fegyverszünetbe","url":"https://magyarnemzet.hu/kulfold/2026/05/oroszorszag-tuzszunetet-hirdetett","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:74:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T05:35:36.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:51:57.000Z","description":"Donald Trump announces that he has obtained the agreement of Vladimir Putin and Volodimir Zelenski for a three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine, scheduled between 9 and 11 May.","originalDescription":"Donald Trump anunță că a obținut acordul lui Vladimir Putin și Volodimir Zelenski pentru o încetare a focului de trei zile între Rusia și Ucraina, programată între 9 și 11 mai.","lang":"ro","paywall":"no","refId":"a193d8b9-5ac3-4053-a0f4-875fdd1bfbe2","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:52:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Donald Trump Says He Convinced Putin and Zelenski to Accept a Three-Day Truce","originalTitle":"Donald Trump spune că i-a convins pe Putin și Zelenski să accepte un armistițiu de trei zile","url":"https://adevarul.ro/stiri-externe/sua/donald-trump-spune-ca-i-a-convins-pe-putin-si-2528373.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:52:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T23:54:49.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:50:56.000Z","description":"A three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia will begin on Saturday, President Donald Trump said on social media on Friday. According to Trump, both Russia and Ukraine have agreed to the ceasefire.","originalDescription":"Ukrainan ja Venäjän välillä alkaa lauantaina kolmen päivän tulitauko, kertoi presidentti Donald Trump sosiaalisessa mediassa perjantaina. Trumpin mukaan sekä Venäjä että Ukraina ovat suostuneet tulitaukoon.","lang":"fi","paywall":"sometimes","refId":"c9273825-5b61-45b2-a619-cbc4fbb9008b","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:224:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump: Ukraine and Russia Have Agreed to a Three-Day Ceasefire","originalTitle":"Trump: Ukraina ja Venäjä ovat suostuneet kolmen päivän tulitaukoon","url":"https://www.ts.fi/a/6977459","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:224:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:00:46.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:47:49.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump on Friday announced on social media that there would be a three-day ceasefire in the war between Russia âand Ukraine from May 9 until May 11. Moscow and Kyiv have both accused each other of violating ceasefires that each has separately declared. Trump said in a Truth Social post that the pause will include a suspension of all kinetic activity, and also a prison swap of 1 000 prisoners from each country. “Hopefully, it i…","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"8618e5b1-bb90-468a-9958-5d95c225b3a6","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:357:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announces three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia - SABC News - Breaking news, special reports, world, business, sport coverage of all South African current events. Africa's news leader.","originalTitle":null,"url":"https://www.sabcnews.com/sabcnews/trump-announces-three-day-ceasefire-between-ukraine-and-russia/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:357:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T00:33:03.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:47:25.000Z","description":"US President Donal Trump announced the conclusion of a three-day truce between Russia and Ukraine. The deal will be valid until Monday, May 11th, including. The announcement was made by the leader of the White House on Friday, May 8th, on the Truth Social network.","originalDescription":"Președintele american Donal Trump a anunțat încheierea unui armistițiu de trei zile între Rusia și Ucraina. Înțelegerea va fi valabilă până luni, 11 mai, inclusiv. Anunțul a fost făcut de liderul de la Casa Albă vineri, 8 mai, pe rețeaua Truth Social.","lang":"ro","paywall":"no","refId":"18e6ce44-422f-4977-894a-337c82fb190d","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:345:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Three-Day Cease-Fire Between Russia and Ukraine. Donald Trump: \"It Will Also Include an Exchange of prisoners.\"","originalTitle":"Încetare a focului de trei zile între Rusia și Ucraina. Donald Trump: „Va include și un schimb de prizonieri”","url":"https://radiomoldova.md/p/76094","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:345:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:44:06.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:45:00.000Z","description":"In the Ukraine war, there has been no significant progress. Now, among other things, the US President announces a temporary ceasefire.","originalDescription":"Im Ukraine-Krieg gab es zuletzt keine merklichen Fortschritte. Nun verkündet der US-Präsident unter anderem eine temporäre Waffenruhe.","lang":"de","paywall":"no","refId":"beb568ee-a776-4af6-af07-2d5d2a3db90e","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:173:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three Day Ceasefire in the Ukraine War","originalTitle":"Trump verkündet dreitägige Waffenruhe im Ukraine-Krieg","url":"https://www.wort.lu/international/trump-verkuendet-dreitaegige-waffenruhe-im-ukraine-krieg/151279755.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:173:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T16:38:20.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:44:37.000Z","description":"It will be to celebrate Victory Day, for the end of World War II.","originalDescription":"Será para celebrar el Día de la Victoria, por el fin de la Segunda Guerra Mundial.","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"20c5bc56-fe7c-4310-aef8-01d3d7728f4c","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:137:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire and Exchange of Prisoners Russia-Ukraine · Global Voices","originalTitle":"Trump anuncia alto al fuego de tres días e intercambio de prisioneros Rusia-Ucrania","url":"https://aristeguinoticias.com/0805/mundo/trump-anuncia-alto-al-fuego-de-tres-dias-e-intercambio-de-prisioneros-rusia-ucrania/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:137:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T22:56:14.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:42:20.000Z","description":"\"This request was made directly by me, and I very much appreciate the consent of President Vladimir Putin and President Volodymyr Zelensky,\" the US president said.","originalDescription":"\"Prośba ta została zgłoszona bezpośrednio przeze mnie i bardzo doceniam zgodę prezydenta Władimira Putina oraz prezydenta Wołodymyra Zełenskiego\" — poinformował prezydent USA.","lang":"pl","paywall":"no","refId":"01762f8a-0085-496a-89e1-19250f98c343","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:256:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"War in Ukraine. Donald Trump Announces \"Cease and Desist From All Military Operations\"","originalTitle":"Wojna w Ukrainie. Donald Trump ogłasza \"wstrzymanie wszelkich działań zbrojnych\"","url":"https://businessinsider.com.pl/wiadomosci/zawieszenie-broni-w-wojnie-w-ukrainie-donald-trump-oglosil-szczegoly/bsd784n","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:256:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T02:14:37.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:41:00.000Z","description":"This truce, which will extend from 9 to 11 May, will include the suspension of all war activity, as well as an exchange of 1,000 prisoners of war on each side, wrote US President Donald Trump on the Social Truth network.","originalDescription":"Esta tregua, que se extenderá del 9 al 11 de mayo, incluirá la suspensión de toda actividad bélica, así como un intercambio de 1.000 prisioneros de guerra por cada parte, escribió el presidente de EEUU, Donald Trump, en la red Truth Social.","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"4051d8e1-38da-4b41-aa38-8ef90d254299","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:433:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Claims that Russia and Ukraine Would Have Agreed to a Three-Day Ceasefire","originalTitle":"Trump afirma que Rusia y Ucrania habrían acordado un alto el fuego de 3 días","url":"https://noticiaslatam.lat/20260508/trump-afirma-que-rusia-y-ucrania-habrian-acordado-un-alto-el-fuego-de-3-dias-1173383588.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:433:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:57:05.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:40:59.000Z","description":"U.S. President Donald Trump on Friday announced a three-day ceasefire in the Russia-Ukraine war from May 9th to 11th, saying both Moscow and Kyiv had agreed to halt all military activity and swap 1,000 prisoners each. “This request was made directly by me,” Trump wrote on his Truth Social account, adding that he appreciated the agreement of both Russian President Vladimir Putin and Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy to the terms. The pause …","originalDescription":null,"lang":"en","paywall":"no","refId":"2a6ce630-a8df-49a2-8201-51952ba21d2c","s