broni-i-wymiane-jencow-na-dzien-zwyciestwa/rdm4hys","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:373:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:52:03.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:36:21.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump announced on the Truth Social network that there will be a three-day ceasefire in the war between Russia and Ukraine from May 9 to 11. In addition to the ceasefire, there will be a 1,000-for-1,000 prisoner exchange.","originalDescription":"Прэзыдэнт ЗША Дональд Трамп заявіў у сацсетцы Truth Social, што ў вайне паміж Расеяй і Ўкраінай будзе трохдзённае перамір’е з 9 да 11 траўня. Апроч спыненьня агню, адбудзецца абмен палоннымі ў фармаце 1000 на 1000.","lang":"be","paywall":"no","refId":"88ce1c0a-5d31-4045-a663-cf7fb0fb819b","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:418:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump: Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine Will Be on May 9-11, 2,000 Prisoners Will Be Exchanged","originalTitle":"Трамп: перамір’е паміж Расеяй і Ўкраінай будзе 9—11 траўня, пройдзе абмен 2000 палонных","url":"https://www.svaboda.org/a/33752892.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:418:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T10:25:32.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:36:00.000Z","description":"WASHINGTON. US President Donald Trump, according to his own statements, convinced Russia and Ukraine of a third ceasefire from tomorrow's Saturday.","originalDescription":"WASHINGTON. US-Pr�sident Donald Trump hat nach eigenen Angaben Russland und die Ukraine von einer ab dem morgigen Samstag geltenden dreit�gigen Waffenruhe �berzeugt.","lang":"de","paywall":"no","refId":"ef822022-41e1-4eb2-899f-3d7c5b88c5e4","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:99:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announced Three-Day Ceasefire in Ukraine","originalTitle":"Trump verkündete dreitägige Waffenruhe in der Ukraine","url":"https://www.nachrichten.at/politik/aussenpolitik/trump-verkuendete-dreitaegige-waffenruhe-in-der-ukraine;art391,4169331","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:99:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:07:01.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:33:02.000Z","description":"U.S. President Donald Trump announced a three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine on Friday, May 9-11, marking the anniversary of the end of World War II. He announced that the ceasefire would also include the exchange of a total of 2,000 prisoners. \"I am pleased to announce that there will be a THREE-DAY ARMISTATE in the war between Russia and Ukraine (May 9, 10, and 11). The article, \"Trump Declares a Three-Day Armistice Between Russia an…","originalDescription":"Prezydent USA Donald Trump ogłosił w piątek trzydniowe zawieszenie broni między Rosją i Ukrainą w dniach 9-11 maja w związku z rocznicą zakończenia II wojny światowej. Zapowiedział, że rozejm obejmie też wymianę łącznie 2 tys. więźniów. „Z przyjemnością ogłaszam, że w wojnie między Rosją a Ukrainą nastąpi TRZYDNIOWE ZAWIESZENIE BRONI (9, 10 i 11 maja). Artykuł Trump ogłosił trzydniowy rozejm między Rosją i Ukrainą w dniach 9-11 maja pochodzi z s…","lang":"pl","paywall":"no","refId":"d0647d4a-c38d-40e3-ba55-a6363eb1447c","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:389:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Declared a Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine From May 9-11","originalTitle":"Trump ogłosił trzydniowy rozejm między Rosją i Ukrainą w dniach 9-11 maja","url":"https://misyjne.pl/trump-oglosil-trzydniowy-rozejm-miedzy-rosja-i-ukraina-w-dniach-9-11-maja/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:389:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:12:36.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:32:00.000Z","description":"President Vladimir Zelensky confirmed the statement of US President Donald Trump on the ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia from May 9 to 11.","originalDescription":"Президент Володимир Зеленський підтвердив заяву президента США Дональда Трампа про перемир’я України з РФ із 9 до 11 травня.","lang":"uk","paywall":"no","refId":"fe02f0fc-fba2-477a-a945-5e278d0af618","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:272:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"“Red Square Is Less Important to us.” Zelensky Confirmed the Three-Day Truce with Russia and Announced the Exchange of Prisoners 1000 for 1000","originalTitle":"«Красна площа для нас менш важлива». Зеленський підтвердив триденне перемир’я з РФ і анонсував обмін полоненими 1000 на 1000","url":"https://nv.ua/ukr/world/geopolitics/zelenskiy-podtverdil-peremirie-s-rf-i-obyavil-ob-obmene-plennymi-1000-na-100-50606458.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:272:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T00:06:06.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:29:00.000Z","description":"A three-day truce provides for the cessation of all hostilities as well as the exchange of 1,000 prisoners of war on each side.","originalDescription":"Трехдневное перемирие предусматривает прекращение всех боевых действий, а также обмен 1000 военнопленных с каждой стороны.","lang":"ru","paywall":"no","refId":"c5ff98fb-9231-430b-81af-44b5fdc4ad1b","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:58:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Declared a Truce Between Ukraine and the Russian Federation","originalTitle":"Трамп объявил перемирие между Украиной и РФ","url":"https://korrespondent.net/world/4877244-tramp-obiavyl-peremyrye-mezhdu-ukraynoi-y-rf","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:58:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:09:06.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:25:37.000Z","description":"","originalDescription":null,"lang":"fr","paywall":"no","refId":"882d3e4d-8dfc-4e15-800d-4e6d7308ef2b","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:385:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"A Ceasefire and an Exchange of Prisoners: Donald Trump Announces a Truce in the War in Ukraine","originalTitle":"Un cessez-le-feu et un échange de prisonniers : Donald Trump annonce une trêve dans la guerre en Ukraine","url":"https://www.parismatch.com/actu/international/un-cessez-le-feu-et-un-echange-de-prisonniers-donald-trump-annonce-une-treve-dans-la-guerre-en-ukraine-268789","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:385:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:42:34.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:25:00.000Z","description":"Washington - There will be a three-day ceasefire in the war in Ukraine, US President Donald Trump announced today. According to his statement on the social network Truth Social, it is to last from May 9 to 11. The ceasefire will include an exchange of 1,000 prisoners on each side. Trump believes this is the beginning of the end of this war, which Moscow started in February 2022. Zelensky confirmed the agreement on X and expressed his expectation…","originalDescription":"Washington - Ve válce na Ukrajině bude třídenní příměří, oznámil dnes americký prezident Donald Trump. Trvat má podle jeho vyjádření na sociální síti Truth Social od 9. do 11. května. Součástí klidu zbraní bude výměna 1000 zajatců na každé straně. Trump věří, že to je začátek konce této války, kterou Moskva zahájila v únoru 2022. Zelenskyj na X dohodu potvrdil a vyjádřil očekávání, že Spojené státy zajistí, aby ji Rusko dodrželo. Moskva posléze …","lang":"cs","paywall":"no","refId":"8a860a22-ef09-4eb7-bf73-e10edb10b8b1","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:194:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump: There Will Be a Three-Day Ceasefire in the War in Ukraine, Prisoner Exchange Expected | ČeskéNoviny.cz","originalTitle":"Trump: Ve válce na Ukrajině bude třídenní příměří, čeká se výměna zajatců | ČeskéNoviny.cz","url":"https://www.ceskenoviny.cz/zpravy/2822958","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:194:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:50:46.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:24:20.000Z","description":"Donald Trump announces a surprising ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine. Moscow and Kiev have so far lacked confirmation.","originalDescription":"Donald Trump verkündet eine überraschende Waffenruhe zwischen Russland und der Ukraine. Aus Moskau und Kiew fehlt bislang eine Bestätigung.","lang":"de","paywall":"no","refId":"37cabfa1-f22c-44a0-aebe-1644d44fcd8b","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:355:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Ceasefire Between Ukraine & Russia – \"Applying Personally\"","originalTitle":"Trump verkündet Waffenruhe zwischen Ukraine & Russland – „Antrag persönlich gestellt“","url":"https://www.otz.de/politik/article411945274/trump-verkuendet-dreitaegige-waffenruhe-zwischen-ukraine-und-russland.html","wireStoryId":"fb624334-eafa-4bcb-8587-535bc79bcdef","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:355:sourceInfo","wireStories":[{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T21:22:44.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:50:52.000Z","description":"Donald Trump announces a surprising ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine. Now Moscow and Kiev have confirmed this.","originalDescription":"Donald Trump verkündet eine überraschende Waffenruhe zwischen Russland und der Ukraine. Nun wurde das auch von Moskau und Kiew bestätigt.","lang":"de","paywall":"no","refId":"a0b818cb-3465-480a-a9a5-560104469943","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:298:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Ceasefire Between Ukraine & Russia – \"Applying Personally\"","originalTitle":"Trump verkündet Waffenruhe zwischen Ukraine & Russland – „Antrag persönlich gestellt“","url":"https://www.abendblatt.de/politik/article411945274/trump-verkuendet-dreitaegige-waffenruhe-zwischen-ukraine-und-russland.html","wireStoryId":"fb624334-eafa-4bcb-8587-535bc79bcdef","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:298:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:14:49.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:50:52.000Z","description":"Donald Trump announces a surprising ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine. Moscow and Kiev have so far lacked confirmation.","originalDescription":"Donald Trump verkündet eine überraschende Waffenruhe zwischen Russland und der Ukraine. Aus Moskau und Kiew fehlt bislang eine Bestätigung.","lang":"de","paywall":"no","refId":"7df0aa23-8813-4999-a2ad-8baadf0e6db1","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:361:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Ceasefire Between Ukraine & Russia – \"Applying Personally\"","originalTitle":"Trump verkündet Waffenruhe zwischen Ukraine & Russland – „Antrag persönlich gestellt“","url":"https://www.tlz.de/politik/article411945274/trump-verkuendet-dreitaegige-waffenruhe-zwischen-ukraine-und-russland.html","wireStoryId":"fb624334-eafa-4bcb-8587-535bc79bcdef","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:361:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:43:24.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:50:52.000Z","description":"Donald Trump announces a surprising ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine. Moscow and Kiev have so far lacked confirmation.","originalDescription":"Donald Trump verkündet eine überraschende Waffenruhe zwischen Russland und der Ukraine. Aus Moskau und Kiew fehlt bislang eine Bestätigung.","lang":"de","paywall":"no","refId":"1a4fdb91-f14f-4f3c-8ce8-f3ffcb3fb9bc","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:366:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Ceasefire Between Ukraine & Russia – \"Applying Personally\"","originalTitle":"Trump verkündet Waffenruhe zwischen Ukraine & Russland – „Antrag persönlich gestellt“","url":"https://www.wr.de/politik/article411945274/trump-verkuendet-dreitaegige-waffenruhe-zwischen-ukraine-und-russland.html","wireStoryId":"fb624334-eafa-4bcb-8587-535bc79bcdef","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:366:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:55:17.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:50:52.000Z","description":"Donald Trump announces a surprising ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine. Moscow and Kiev have so far lacked confirmation.","originalDescription":"Donald Trump verkündet eine überraschende Waffenruhe zwischen Russland und der Ukraine. Aus Moskau und Kiew fehlt bislang eine Bestätigung.","lang":"de","paywall":"no","refId":"e3a9cca8-9493-433d-b45d-d1ae9e886e4f","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:379:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Ceasefire Between Ukraine & Russia – \"Applying Personally\"","originalTitle":"Trump verkündet Waffenruhe zwischen Ukraine & Russland – „Antrag persönlich gestellt“","url":"https://www.ikz-online.de/politik/article411945274/trump-verkuendet-dreitaegige-waffenruhe-zwischen-ukraine-und-russland.html","wireStoryId":"fb624334-eafa-4bcb-8587-535bc79bcdef","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:379:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false}]},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T16:53:12.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:23:41.000Z","description":"\"I am happy to report a three-day cease-fire (9, 10 and 11 May) in the war between Russia and Ukraine: Russia celebrates Victory Day, but it is also important in Ukraine, because it also played a significant role in World War II. This cease-fire will include the suspension of all hostilities, as well as the exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each country,\" the President of the United States wrote on May 8 on his social network True Social.","originalDescription":"\"С радостью сообщаю о трехдневном прекращении огня (9, 10 и 11 мая) в войне между Россией и Украиной. В России празднуют День победы, но и в Украине это тоже важно, поскольку она также сыграла значительную роль во Второй мировой войне. Это прекращение огня будет включать в себя приостановку всех боевых действий, а также обмен пленными по 1000 человек из каждой страны\", – написал президент США 8 мая в своей соцсети Truth Social.\nПо словам Трампа,…","lang":"ru","paywall":"no","refId":"1f542e2f-304a-4603-9b90-dfecdd02aed9","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:282:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Donald Trump Declared a Truce in the War of Russia and Ukraine From 9 to 11 May.","originalTitle":"Дональд Трамп объявил о перемирии в войне России и Украины с 9 по 11 мая","url":"https://www.currenttime.tv/a/donald-tramp-obyavil-o-peremirii/33752887.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:282:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T21:37:18.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:23:14.000Z","description":"Am Kader vun der Wafferou geif et och zu engem Austausch vun 1,000 Prisoner seen beide Länner kommen.","originalDescription":"Am Kader vun der Wafferou géif et och zu engem Austausch vun 1.000 Prisonéier vu béide Länner kommen.","lang":"fr","paywall":"no","refId":"442657ed-4dd7-4194-90cc-fdb85040798b","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:172:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Russland-Ukrain-Konflikt: Donald Trump Announced Wafferou Vun Dräi Deeg","originalTitle":"Russland-Ukrain-Konflikt: Donald Trump annoncéiert Wafferou vun dräi Deeg","url":"https://www.rtl.lu/news/international/donald-trump-annonceiert-wafferou-vun-drai-deeg-1592713170","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:172:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T23:39:54.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:23:12.000Z","description":"Putin and Zelena supported this initiative on 8 May 2026","originalDescription":"Путин и Зеленский поддержали эту инициативу — 8 мая 2026","lang":"ru","paywall":"no","refId":"3f3eb721-5f12-4c92-acf2-81c91d8495b5","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:476:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Declared a Truce Between Russia and Ukraine From 9 to 11 May","originalTitle":"Трамп заявил о перемирии между Россией и Украиной с 9 по 11 мая","url":"https://istories.media/news/2026/05/08/tramp-zayavil-o-peremirii-mezhdu-rossiey-i-ukrainoy-s-9-po-11-maya/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:476:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T22:01:28.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:23:00.000Z","description":"Donald Trump announced that Vladimir Putin and Volodymyr Zelensky have agreed to a temporary ceasefire. Hostilities will cease for several days.","originalDescription":"Donald Trump poinformował, że Władimir Putin i Wołodymyr Zełenski zgodzili się na tymczasowy rozejm. Działania wojenne zostaną wstrzymane na kilka dni.","lang":"pl","paywall":"no","refId":"87cfd735-1ead-4091-8fad-e01db8cd689e","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:254:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announced a Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine. He Indicated How Long It Would Last.","originalTitle":"Trump ogłosił rozejm między Rosją a Ukrainą. Wskazał, ile potrwa","url":"https://www.wprost.pl/swiat/12325440/trump-oglosil-rozejm-miedzy-rosja-a-ukraina-wskazal-ile-potrwa.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:254:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:44:15.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:23:00.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump announced a three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine on his Truth Social media account today. He wrote that it will be in effect from Saturday to Monday. It is also expected to include an exchange of 1,000 prisoners between the two sides.","originalDescription":"Ameriški predsednik Donald Trump je danes na svojem družbenem omrežju Truth Social naznanil tridnevno prekinitev ognja med Rusijo in Ukrajino. Kot je zapisal, bo ta veljala od sobote do ponedeljka. Vključevala naj bi tudi izmenjavo po tisoč ujetnikov med stranema.","lang":"sl","paywall":"no","refId":"cee557f1-67f2-4c44-adde-c5dc9bfe451f","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:156:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Donald Trump Declares Ceasefire in Ukraine","originalTitle":"Donald Trump razglasil premirje v Ukrajini","url":"https://siol.net/novice/svet/donald-trump-razglasil-tridnevno-premirje-med-rusijo-in-ukrajino-putin-in-zelenski-se-strinjata-691068","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:156:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T23:16:31.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:21:55.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump announced on Friday (8/5) that there will be a three-day ceasefire in the war between Russia and Ukraine, which will take effect from May 9 to 11. Trump made the announcement in a post on Truth Social, which he said includes a suspension of all military action by both sides as well as the exchange of 1,000 prisoners of war from each country. He added that day by day “we are getting closer and closer to ending the confli…","originalDescription":"Ο πρόεδρος των ΗΠΑ, Ντόναλντ Τραμπ ανακοίνωσε την Παρασκευή (8/5) ότι θα ισχύσει τριήμερη κατάπαυση του πυρός στον πόλεμο μεταξύ Ρωσίας και Ουκρανίας, η οποία θα τεθεί σε ισχύ από τις 9 έως τις 11 Μαΐου. Ο Τραμπ έκανε τη συγκεκριμένη ανακοίνωση σε ανάρτησή του στο Truth Social, στην οποία αναφέρει ότι περιλαμβάνει αναστολή όλων των πολεμικών ενεργειών και από τις δύο πλευρές καθώς και ανταλλαγή 1.000 αιχμαλώτων πολέμου από κάθε χώρα. Παράλληλα υ…","lang":"el","paywall":"no","refId":"cb95a39c-15d2-4017-9f04-aff80d2071db","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:215:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire Between Ukraine and Russia — Moscow and Kiev Confirm","originalTitle":"Ο Τραμπ ανακοίνωσε τριήμερη κατάπαυση του πυρός μεταξύ Ουκρανίας και Ρωσίας – Το επιβεβαιώνουν Μόσχα και Κίεβο","url":"https://www.ertnews.gr/eidiseis/diethni/o-tramp-anakoinose-triimeri-katapaysi-tou-pyros-metaksy-oukranias-kai-rosias-to-epivevaionoun-mosxa-kai-kievo/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:215:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:34:31.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:20:28.000Z","description":"USA's president Donald Trump sier det blir våpenhvile mellom Russia og Ukraina i helgen. Det bekrefter både president Zelenskyj og Kreml.","originalDescription":"USAs president Donald Trump sier det blir våpenhvile mellom Russland og Ukraina i helgen. Det bekrefter både president Zelenskyj og Kreml.","lang":"de","paywall":"no","refId":"8df45436-93e5-486e-8352-dec9055cfbf2","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:168:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Zelenskyj Bekrefter Tre Dagers våpenhvile Mellom Russia Og Ukraina","originalTitle":"Zelenskyj bekrefter tre dagers våpenhvile mellom Russland og Ukraina","url":"https://www.aftenposten.no/verden/i/43b3VV/zelenskyj-bekrefter-tre-dagers-vaapenhvile-mellom-russland-og-ukraina","wireStoryId":"63771251-9579-41c2-a273-73734e8e6e04","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:168:sourceInfo","wireStories":[{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:38:35.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:24:43.000Z","description":"Donald Trump sier det skal være en tre dager lang våpenhvile mellom Ukraina og Russia, 9, 10. og 11. mai, skriver Reuters. Dette bekrefter også Ukrainas president Volodymyr Zelenskyj. Russiske myndigheter har også akseptert våpenhvilen, skriver det statlige russiske nyhetsbyrået Tass. – Jeg takker USAs president og hans team for their effective diplomaatiske deltakelse. Vi forventer at USA sikrer at the rusiske siden overholder avtalene, skriver…","originalDescription":"Donald Trump sier det skal være en tre dager lang våpenhvile mellom Ukraina og Russland, 9., 10. og 11. mai, skriver Reuters.\nDette bekrefter også Ukrainas president Volodymyr Zelenskyj. Russiske myndigheter har også akseptert våpenhvilen, skriver det statlige russiske nyhetsbyrået Tass.\n– Jeg takker USAs president og hans team for deres effektive diplomatiske deltakelse. Vi forventer at USA sikrer at den russiske siden overholder avtalene, skri…","lang":"de","paywall":"no","refId":"272cd997-2266-4806-88aa-5d524a16dc7d","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:102:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Zelenskyj Bekrefter Tre Dagers våpenhvile Mellom Russia Og Ukraina","originalTitle":"Zelenskyj bekrefter tre dagers våpenhvile mellom Russland og Ukraina","url":"https://www.nrk.no/nyheter/zelenskyj-bekrefter-tre-dagers-vapenhvile-mellom-russland-og-ukraina-1.17877380","wireStoryId":"63771251-9579-41c2-a273-73734e8e6e04","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:102:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false}]},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T22:45:07.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:20:00.000Z","description":"The ceasefire will last three days. However, the American president announced that talks are underway to end the conflict. \"Every day we are getting closer to a resolution,\" he argued.","originalDescription":"Zawieszenie broni będzie trwało trzy dni. Amerykański prezydent zapowiedział jednak, że prowadzone są rozmowy na temat zakończenia konfliktu. \"Z każdym dniem jesteśmy coraz bliżej rozwiązania\" - przekonywał.","lang":"pl","paywall":"no","refId":"5de1585d-fb88-493f-ba21-a87f039ffb31","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:234:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Declares Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine. \"I Hope This Is the Beginning of the End\"","originalTitle":"Trump ogłasza rozejm między Rosją i Ukrainą. \"Mam nadzieję, że to początek końca\"","url":"https://wiadomosci.gazeta.pl/polityka/7,198013,32779407,trump-oglasza-rozejm-miedzy-rosja-i-ukraina-mam-nadzieje.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:234:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T21:18:48.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:18:53.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump announces a three-day truce between Russia and Ukraine during 9-11 May. On 9 May there is the military parade of Victory Day in Russia, for which Putin had previously requested an truce with Ukraine, and it is also Europe Day. \"I am pleased to announce that there will be an ANCENT [...] Source","originalDescription":"Președintele american Donald Trump anunță un armistițiu de 3 zile între Rusia și Ucraina, în perioada 9-11 mai. Pe 9 mai are loc parada militară de Ziua Victoriei în Rusia, pentru care Putin ceruse anterior un armistițiu cu Ucraina, și, totodată, este și Ziua Europei. „Sunt încântat să anunț că va exista o ÎNCETARE A […]\nSource","lang":"ro","paywall":"no","refId":"a5f9b743-12c4-4a41-9d8b-a02f1785d0fc","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:276:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Truce Between Russia and Ukraine on 9-11 May","originalTitle":"Trump anunță armistițiu între Rusia și Ucraina, pe 9-11 mai","url":"https://alephnews.ro/guvern/trump-anunta-un-armistitiu-de-3-zile-intre-rusia-si-ucraina-in-perioada-9-11-mai-aceasta-solicitare-a-fost-facuta-direct-de-mine-si-apreciez-ca-a-fost-acceptata-de-putin-si-zelenski/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:276:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:10:22.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:18:12.000Z","description":"There will be a temporary ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine from Saturday through Monday, Donald Trump announced on Friday. According to the American president, talks are taking place and the end of the war is \"getting closer every day\".","originalDescription":"Er komt van zaterdag tot en met maandag een tijdelijk staakt-het-vuren tussen Rusland en Oekraïne, meldt Donald Trump vrijdag. Volgens de Amerikaanse president vinden er gesprekken plaats en komt het einde van de oorlog \"elke dag dichterbij\".","lang":"nl","paywall":"no","refId":"61bd7f5e-cc71-4387-b62a-0b20df2aea6d","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:180:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire in Ukraine, Takes Effect Saturday","originalTitle":"Trump kondigt driedaags staakt-het-vuren aan in Oekraïne, gaat zaterdag in","url":"https://www.nu.nl/spanningen-oekraine/6395199/trump-kondigt-driedaags-staakt-het-vuren-aan-in-oekraine-gaat-zaterdag-in.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:180:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:22:46.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:18:00.000Z","description":"In his social network, the President of the United States indicated that the three sides of industry should be involved in the exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each country.","originalDescription":"Na sua rede social, o Presidente dos EUA indicou que as tr�guas ter�o in�cio no s�bado e envolver�o a troca de 1.000 prisioneiros de cada pa�s.","lang":"pt","paywall":"no","refId":"b830dace-d1c2-4ff0-aa8a-dc5f93342332","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:204:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Cease-Fire Between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":"Trump anuncia cessar-fogo de três dias entre Ucrânia e Rússia","url":"https://www.jornaldenegocios.pt/economia/europa/invasao-da-ucrania/detalhe/trump-anuncia-cessar-fogo-de-tres-dias-entre-ucrania-e-russia","wireStoryId":"2d396aa5-2132-452e-934a-6990ca97731e","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:204:sourceInfo","wireStories":[{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:22:38.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:39:08.000Z","description":"In his social network, the President of the United States indicated that the three sides of industry should be involved in the exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each country.","originalDescription":"Na sua rede social, o Presidente dos EUA indicou que as tr�guas ter�o in�cio no s�bado e envolver�o a troca de 1.000 prisioneiros de cada pa�s.","lang":"pt","paywall":"no","refId":"303a0878-5f10-4d4e-8bf7-da315bfe6aed","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:414:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Cease-Fire Between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":"Trump anuncia cessar-fogo de três dias entre Ucrânia e Rússia","url":"https://www.sabado.pt/mundo/detalhe/trump-anuncia-cessar-fogo-de-tres-dias-entre-ucrania-e-russia","wireStoryId":"2d396aa5-2132-452e-934a-6990ca97731e","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:414:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false}]},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:39:19.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:18:00.000Z","description":"At the request of US President Donald Trump, a ceasefire will be in effect in the war between Russia and Ukraine from May 9 to 11, the White House chief announced on the Truht Social social network on Friday. The ceasefire is also expected to include a suspension of \"all kinetic activity\" and an exchange of 1,000 prisoners, TASR writes.","originalDescription":"Na žiadosť amerického prezidenta Donalda Trumpa bude vo vojne medzi Ruskom a Ukrajinou v dňoch 9. až 11. mája platiť prímerie, oznámil šéf Bieleho domu v piatok na sociálnej sieti Truht Social. Prímerie má tiež zahŕňať pozastavenie „všetkej kinetickej aktivity“ a výmenu po 1000 zajatcov, píše TASR.","lang":"sk","paywall":"no","refId":"79659ca4-90dc-48b5-a6e8-f150d4b2749c","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:175:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Donald Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"Donald Trump oznámil trojdňové prímerie medzi Ruskom a Ukrajinou","url":"https://www.aktuality.sk/clanok/lts1TgP/donald-trump-oznamil-trojdnove-primerie-medzi-ruskom-a-ukrajinou/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:175:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:28:15.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:18:00.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump has announced the conclusion of a three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine. The agreement will be valid until Monday, inclusive.","originalDescription":"Președintele american Donal Trump a anunțat încheierea unui armistițiu de trei zile între Rusia și Ucraina. Înțelegerea va fi valabilă până luni, inclusiv.","lang":"ro","paywall":"no","refId":"83f66e83-9920-43e4-b6d1-86d9b1a62624","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:79:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine. The Announcement Was Made by Donald Trump","originalTitle":"Armistițiu de trei zile între Rusia și Ucraina. Anunțul a fost făcut de Donald Trump","url":"https://observatornews.ro/extern/armistitiu-de-trei-zile-intre-rusia-si-ucraina-anuntul-a-fost-facut-de-donald-trump-653973.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:79:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T23:13:25.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:17:12.000Z","description":"Reede, 8 May Ukrainas on käimas Venemaa algatatud täiemahulise sõja 1535. päev. Venemaa esitas Armeeniale ettenheiteid selle eest, et riik võõrustas sel nädalal Ukraina presidenti Volodõmõr Zelenskõid Euroopa Poliitilise Ühenduse tippkohtumisel.","originalDescription":"Reede, 8. mai. Ukrainas on käimas Venemaa algatatud täiemahulise sõja 1535. päev. Venemaa esitas Armeeniale etteheiteid selle eest, et riik võõrustas sel nädalal Ukraina presidenti Volodõmõr Zelenskõid Euroopa Poliitilise Ühenduse tippkohtumisel.","lang":"et","paywall":"no","refId":"12542e6d-1409-4175-bb60-142a74875f0d","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:219:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"BLOG | Trump Declares Three-Day Ceasefire Between Ukraine and Russia","originalTitle":"BLOGI | Trump kuulutas välja kolmepäevase relvarahu Ukraina ja Venemaa vahel","url":"https://www.ohtuleht.ee/1157268/blogi-trump-kuulutas-valja-kolmepaevase-relvarahu-ukraina-ja-venemaa-vahel","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:219:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T23:01:40.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:17:00.000Z","description":"The US President announced a three-day truce between Ukraine and Russia. He wrote about this on social media. “I am happy to announce the introduction of a three-day truce from May 9 to May 11 in the “conflict” between Russia and Ukraine. In Russia, this holiday is dedicated to Victory Day,” Trump said. He explained that the truce would include the cessation of all hostilities, as well as the exchange of prisoners — 1,000 people from each countr…","originalDescription":"Президент США объявил о трехдневном перемирии между Украиной и Россией. Об этом он написал в соцсети. \"Я рад объявить о введении трехдневного перемирия с 9 по 11 мая в \"конфликте\" между Россией и Украиной. В России этот праздник посвящен Дню победы\", – заявил Трамп. Он пояснил, что перемирие будет включать прекращение всех боевых действий, а также обмен пленными — по 1000 человек из каждой страны. \nВАС ЗАИНТЕРЕСУЕТ \nВ Польше считают \"абсурдом\" п…","lang":"ru","paywall":"no","refId":"c516a561-8abe-4de6-ba1c-4da836d0ed60","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:48:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announced a Three-Day Truce Between Ukraine and the Russian Federation","originalTitle":"Трамп анонсировал перемирие между Украиной и РФ на три дня","url":"https://zn.ua/usa/tramp-anonsiroval-peremirie-mezhdu-ukrainoj-i-rf-na-tri-dnja.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:48:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T13:53:36.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:14:56.000Z","description":"President Donald Trump of the United States announced that there would be a three-day truce between Russia and Ukraine from 9 to 11 May, on the occasion of Victory Day, about which he wrote on the Truth Social social network.","originalDescription":"Президент США Дональд Трамп заявил, что с 9 по 11 мая между Россией и Украиной будет действовать трехдневное перемирие, приуроченное ко Дню Победы. Об этом он написал в соцсети Truth Social.","lang":"ru","paywall":"no","refId":"c69f4a22-4db5-494e-965d-1d19b3456bb6","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:225:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announced a Three-Day Truce Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"Трамп объявил о трехдневном перемирии между Россией и Украиной","url":"https://rtvi.com/news/tramp-obyavil-o-trehdnevnom-peremirii-mezhdu-rossiej-i-ukrainoj/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:225:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:18:37.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:14:35.000Z","description":"Trump: Three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine \nThis is what US President Donald Trump wrote on TruthSocial on Friday evening. The ceasefire will last May 9, 10 and 11. – The celebration in Russia is for Victory Day, but likewise in Ukraine, because they were also a big part and factor in World War II, he wrote further. According to the president, the ceasefire will include a suspension of all kinetic activity, in addition to a prisoner e…","originalDescription":"Trump: Tre dager våpenhvile mellom Russland og Ukraina \nDet skriver USAs president Donald Trump på TruthSocial fredag kveld. Våpenhvilen varer 9, 10 og 11 mai. – Feiringen i Russland er for seiersdagen, men på samme måte i Ukraina, fordi de også var en stor del og faktor i andre verdenskrig, skriver han videre. Våpenhvilen vil ifølge presidenten inkludere en suspensjon av all kinetisk aktivitet, i tillegg til en fangebytte av 1000 fanger fra hve…","lang":"no","paywall":"no","refId":"f6b1fea1-aa54-45e1-b3d9-4f3179e43574","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:237:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump: Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"Trump: Tre dager våpenhvile mellom Russland og Ukraina","url":"https://www.nettavisen.no/nyheter/trump-kunngjores-tredagers-vapenhvile/s/5-95-3028156","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:237:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:27:17.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:14:00.000Z","description":"There will be a three-day ceasefire in the war in Ukraine, US President Donald Trump announced on Friday. According to his statement on the social network Truth Social, it will last from May 9 to 11. The ceasefire will include an exchange of 1,000 prisoners on each side. Trump believes this is the beginning of the end of this war, which Moscow started in February 2022.","originalDescription":"Ve válce na Ukrajině bude třídenní příměří, oznámil v pátek americký prezident Donald Trump. Trvat má podle jeho vyjádření na sociální síti Truth Social od 9. do 11. května. Součástí klidu zbraní bude výměna 1000 zajatců na každé straně. Trump věří, že to je začátek konce této války, kterou Moskva zahájila v únoru 2022.","lang":"cs","paywall":"no","refId":"c49ccfee-08c9-42e8-874f-b8c69ed0edc4","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:290:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire in Ukraine War. There Will Also Be a Prisoner Exchange","originalTitle":"Trump oznámil třídenní příměří ve válce na Ukrajině. Bude i výměna zajatců","url":"https://www.denik.cz/ze_sveta/valka-na-ukrajine-donald-trump-primeri-vymena-zajatcu.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:290:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:25:48.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:13:20.000Z","description":"The US President announced on his Truth Social network a three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia. Confirmed by Kiev and Moscow, this truce will begin this Saturday, May 9 to end Monday, May 11, and will include a new prisoner exchange.","originalDescription":"Le président américain a annoncé sur son réseau Truth Social un cessez-le-feu de trois jours entre Ukraine et Russie. Confirmée par Kiev et Moscou, cette trêve débutera ce samedi 9 mai pour prendre fin lundi 11 mai, et inclura un nouvel échange de prisonniers.","lang":"fr","paywall":"no","refId":"8e824f16-fc65-46c6-8317-5cc9f82a56f7","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:486:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"War in Ukraine: Donald Trump Announces a Three-Day Ceasefire From Saturday Between Kiev and Moscow","originalTitle":"Guerre en Ukraine : Donald Trump annonce un cessez-le-feu de trois jours à partir de samedi entre Kiev et Moscou","url":"https://www.ouest-france.fr/europe/ukraine/guerre-en-ukraine-donald-trump-annonce-un-cessez-le-feu-de-trois-jours-a-partir-de-demain-entre-kiev-et-moscou-d07cf0bc-4b08-11f1-aaad-3dc0b7ad690d","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:486:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:31:47.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:13:20.000Z","description":"For more than four years Ukraine has been defending itself against the Russian war of aggression, peace efforts have been unsuccessful so far. Follow all developments in our live blog.","originalDescription":"Seit mehr als vier Jahren verteidigt sich die Ukraine gegen den russischen Angriffskrieg, Friedens­bemühungen verliefen bisher erfolglos. Verfolgen Sie alle Entwicklungen in unserem Liveblog.","lang":"de","paywall":"no","refId":"e683df1b-e7d6-446f-a4a1-3d5cc6e7044f","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:201:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Ukraine War in the Liveticker: Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire","originalTitle":"Ukraine-Krieg im Liveticker: Trump verkündet dreitägige Waffenruhe","url":"https://www.lvz.de/politik/ukraine-krieg-im-liveticker-trump-verkuendet-dreitaegige-waffenruhe-HE2HCGE6JQFTFWLUN43NO5POI4.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:201:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T20:18:36.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:12:00.000Z","description":"Ukraine and Russia have agreed to a three-day ceasefire, US President Donald Trump announces. In addition, 1,000 prisoners from each country will be exchanged.","originalDescription":"Ukraina och Ryssland är överens om en vapenvila i tre dagar, meddelar USA:s president Donald Trump. Dessutom ska 1 000 fångar från vardera land utväxlas.","lang":"sv","paywall":"no","refId":"a76930ca-80dc-410e-b9bd-9c2c464e3b67","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:285:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump: Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"Trump: Vapenvila mellan Ryssland och Ukraina","url":"https://www.hd.se/varlden/trump-vapenvila-mellan-ryssland-och-ukraina/","wireStoryId":"38a97698-045f-42c1-8c7d-e0800dc2ca63","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:285:sourceInfo","wireStories":[{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T21:41:48.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:12:00.000Z","description":"Ukraine and Russia have agreed to a three-day ceasefire, US President Donald Trump announces. In addition, 1,000 prisoners from each country will be exchanged.","originalDescription":"Ukraina och Ryssland är överens om en vapenvila i tre dagar, meddelar USA:s president Donald Trump. Dessutom ska 1 000 fångar från vardera land utväxlas.","lang":"sv","paywall":"no","refId":"94a32810-fe93-46d9-ae66-9cbcc9be622e","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:283:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump: Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"Trump: Vapenvila mellan Ryssland och Ukraina","url":"https://www.sydsvenskan.se/varlden/trump-vapenvila-mellan-ryssland-och-ukraina/","wireStoryId":"38a97698-045f-42c1-8c7d-e0800dc2ca63","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:283:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T16:04:34.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:18:42.000Z","description":"President Volodymyr Zelenskyj is in charge of the Ukrainian military order to join the military parade in Moskva and Helgen. Russland bekrefter tre dagers våpenhvile.","originalDescription":"President Volodymyr Zelenskyj har gitt ukrainske styrker ordre om å ikke angripe militærparaden i Moskva i helgen. Russland bekrefter tre dagers våpenhvile.","lang":"no","paywall":"no","refId":"81f4fbfc-1069-4818-b07f-ef1c5e5045e4","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:322:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump: Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"Trump: Våpenhvile mellom Russland og Ukraina","url":"https://www.smp.no/nyheter/n/aJvJq4/trump-det-blir-tre-dagers-vaapenhvile-mellom-russland-og-ukraina","wireStoryId":"38a97698-045f-42c1-8c7d-e0800dc2ca63","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:322:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false}]},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:44:49.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:12:00.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump said, \"I am proud to announce that a three-day ceasefire will be declared between Russia and Ukraine on May 9-10-11. This ceasefire will include the suspension of all kinetic activities and will also include an exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each country.\"","originalDescription":"ABD Başkanı Donald Trump, \"Rusya-Ukrayna arasında 9-10-11 Mayıs tarihlerinde 3 günlük ateşkes ilan edileceğini duyurmaktan gurur duyuyorum. Bu ateşkes, bütün kinetik faaliyetlerin askıya alınmasını kapsayacak ve aynı zamanda iki ülke de biner kişilik esir takası gerçekleştirecek\" dedi.","lang":"tr","paywall":"no","refId":"c7b6027d-c601-4b98-900d-c133050e4247","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:66:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump announced... a 3-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine.","originalTitle":"Trump açıkladı... Rusya ve Ukrayna'dan 3 günlük ateşkes","url":"https://www.aksam.com.tr/dunya/abd-baskani-donald-trump-rusya-ukrayna-arasinda-9-10-11-mayis-tarihlerinde-3-gunluk-bir-at/haber-1665550","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:66:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:37:34.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:11:10.000Z","description":"The ceasefire coincides with Victory Day in Russia, marking the victory over Nazi Germany in World War II.","originalDescription":"Våbenhvile falder sammen med sejrsdagen i Rusland, hvor sejren over Nazityskland i Anden Verdenskrig markeres","lang":"da","paywall":"no","refId":"eed3cbe1-175f-46ce-89b6-7c777c635201","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:93:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Confirms: Ukraine and Russia Will Maintain Ceasefire for Three Days","originalTitle":"Trump bekræfter: Ukraine og Rusland holder våbenhvile i tre dage","url":"https://ekstrabladet.dk/nyheder/Udland/trump-bekraefter-ukraine-og-rusland-holder-vaabenhvile-i-tre-dage/11172294","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:93:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:19:47.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:10:51.000Z","description":"US President Trump announced the introduction of a three-day truce between Russia and Ukraine on May 9, 10 and 11 and the exchange of prisoners","originalDescription":"Американський президент Трамп заявив про запровадження триденного перемир’я між Росією та Україною 9, 10 та 11 травня та обмін полоненими","lang":"uk","paywall":"no","refId":"d6b5712e-c070-41b8-abbc-04cbb0217fff","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:281:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announced the Introduction of a Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine on May 9, 10 and 11 and Announced a New Exchange of Prisoners","originalTitle":"Трамп заявив про запровадження перемир’я між РФ і Україною 9, 10 та 11 травня й ананосував новий обмін полоненими","url":"https://babel.ua/news/126834-tramp-zayaviv-pro-zaprovadzhennya-tridennogo-peremir-ya-mizh-rf-ta-ukrajinoyu-9-10-ta-11-travnya","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:281:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T00:34:37.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:10:35.000Z","description":"Trump announces three-day ceasefire. Zelensky reacts - RMF24.pl - Donald Trump announced a three-day ceasefire between Russia and Ukraine on Friday, effective May 9-11. The US President announced that it was his proposal, which was accepted","originalDescription":"Trump ogłasza trzydniowy rozejm. Zełenski reaguje - RMF24.pl - Donald Trump ogłosił w piątek trzydniowy rozejm między Rosją a Ukrainą, obowiązujący w dniach 9-11 maja. Prezydent Stanów Zjednoczonych poinformował, że była to jego propozycja, na którą","lang":"pl","paywall":"no","refId":"d0e2d767-e387-4284-b722-19465547d76b","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:271:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"Trzydniowy rozejm między Rosją a Ukrainą","url":"https://www.rmf24.pl/raporty/raport-wojna-z-rosja/news-trump-oglasza-trzydniowy-rozejm-zelenski-reaguje,nId,8081043","wireStoryId":"f0e7f5f8-bd4c-42b8-a709-c3ba03ab274c","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:271:sourceInfo","wireStories":[{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T21:13:29.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:28:34.000Z","description":"20:28 In the war between Russia and Ukraine, weapons will rest for the next three days. This was announced by US President Trump and confirmed by Kyiv and Moscow. There will also be a moulting...","originalDescription":"20:28 In de oorlog tussen Rusland en Oekraïne zullen de wapens de komende drie dagen rusten. Dat heeft de Amerikaanse president Trump aangekondigd en wordt bevestigd door Kiev en Moskou. Ook komt er een rui...","lang":"nl","paywall":"no","refId":"be714ece-b98a-46fd-a867-305e4de9f889","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:273:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"Driedaagse wapenstilstand tussen Rusland en Oekraïne","url":"https://www.tijd.be/r/t/1/id/10659861","wireStoryId":"f0e7f5f8-bd4c-42b8-a709-c3ba03ab274c","sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:273:sourceInfo","isOriginatingWireSrc":false}]},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T18:18:40.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:10:18.000Z","description":"The American president claims on Friday evening that the war is soon over.","originalDescription":"Den amerikanske presidenten hevder fredag kveld at krigen snart er over.","lang":"no","paywall":"sometimes","refId":"f6712128-a132-4efb-b576-96eb3d319baf","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:146:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine","originalTitle":"Trump annonserer våpenhvile mellom Russland og Ukraina","url":"https://www.vg.no/nyheter/i/zOMOVw/trump-annonserer-vaapenhvile-mellom-russland-og-ukraina","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:146:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T04:18:36.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T18:09:59.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump announced a three-day truce in the war between Ukraine and Russia and announced the exchange of prisoners.","originalDescription":"Президент США Дональд Трамп оголосив про триденне перемир'я у війні між Україною та РФ і анонсував обмін полоненими.","lang":"uk","paywall":"no","refId":"d7baf534-1fd2-4138-8bc1-0fd1c0f47210","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:331:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announced a Three-Day Truce on May 9-11 with the Consent of Zelensky and Putin","originalTitle":"Трамп оголосив триденне перемир’я 9-11 травня за згоди Зеленського і Путіна","url":"https://www.eurointegration.com.ua/news/2026/05/8/7237218/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:331:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T22:13:20.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T17:44:00.000Z","description":"Russia and Ukraine will have a three-day truce between May 9th and 11th in the war that has been ongoing since 2022, as announced this Friday, May 8th, by US President Donald Trump. According to the US leader, the truce will also include an exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each country. Through the social network Truth Social, the US president stated that the ceasefire request was made directly by him: “I hope this is the beginning of the end of…","originalDescription":"Rússia e Ucrânia terão, entre os dias 9 e 11 de maio, uma trégua de três dias na guerra que acontece desde 2022, segundo foi anunciado nesta sexta-feira, 8, pelo presidente dos Estados Unidos, Donald Trump. Ainda de acordo com o líder estadunidense, a trégua contará também com uma troca de mil prisioneiros de cada país.Por meio da rede social Truth Social, o presidente dos EUA afirmou que o pedido de cessar-fogo foi feito diretamente por ele: “E…","lang":"pt","paywall":"no","refId":"bc0faecd-c352-4f81-844d-451ad0900b4d","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:247:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire Between Russia and Ukraine; Understand","originalTitle":"Trump anuncia cessar-fogo de três dias entre Rússia e Ucrânia; entenda","url":"https://atarde.com.br/mundo/trump-anuncia-cessar-fogo-de-tres-dias-entre-russia-e-ucrania-entenda-1388323","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:247:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T17:15:10.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T16:43:32.000Z","description":"Russians and Ukrainians shattered the first day of the 48-hour unilateral ceasefire declared by the Kremlin to commemorate the 81st anniversary of the Red Army's victory over Nazi Germany with attacks and accusations. Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky directly accused Moscow on Friday of violating its own ceasefire, which Kyiv never joined. Meanwhile, the Russian Defense Ministry claimed its attacks were a response to enemy violations. For …","originalDescription":"Rusos y ucranianos hicieron añicos con ataques y acusaciones la primera jornada de la tregua unilateral de 48 horas declarada por el Kremlin para conmemorar el 81 aniversario de la victoria del Ejército Rojo sobre la Alemania nazi. El presidente ucraniano, Volodímir Zelenski, acusó directamente este viernes a Moscú de violar su propio alto el fuego, al que no se sumó Kiev en ningún momento. Mientras, el Ministerio de Defensa ruso se escudó en qu…","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"8f61fb75-92e9-41e5-a33f-7db81014024d","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:359:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"#World:Russia and Ukraine Shatter Victory Day Truce with Attacks and Accusations #FVDigital","originalTitle":"#Mundo:Rusia y Ucrania hacen añicos la tregua del Día de la Victoria con ataques y acusaciones #FVDigital","url":"https://fvdigital.do/mundorusia-y-ucrania-hacen-anicos-la-tregua-del-dia-de-la-victoria-con-ataques-y-acusaciones-fvdigital/","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:359:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:42:29.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T16:27:00.000Z","description":"The President of Ukraine, Volodimir Zelenski, confirmed on Friday (8) a three-day ceasefire with Russia as part of the efforts of the United States to negotiate the end of the war between the two countries, in progress for more than four years. Read more (05/08/2026","originalDescription":"O presidente da Ucr�nia, Volodimir Zelenski, confirmou nesta sexta-feira (8) um cessar-fogo de tr�s dias com a R�ssia como parte dos esfor�os dos Estados Unidos para negociar o fim da guerra entre os dois pa�ses, em curso h� mais de quatro anos.\nLeia mais (05/08/2026","lang":"pt","paywall":"no","refId":"eb40d499-a1d4-4400-817a-3542faf8c0ce","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:139:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Ukraine and Russia Wake up Three Days Truce","originalTitle":"Ucrânia e Rússia acordam trégua de três dias - 08/05/2026 - Mundo","url":"https://redir.folha.com.br/redir/online/emcimadahora/rss091/*https://www1.folha.uol.com.br/mundo/2026/05/ucrania-e-russia-acordam-tregua-de-tres-dias-apos-mediacao-de-trump.shtml","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:139:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T00:19:48.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T15:41:02.000Z","description":"“This request was made directly by me, and I greatly appreciate your acceptance by President Vladimir Putin and President Volodymyr Zelenskyy. I hope it will be the beginning of the end of a very long, bloody and harshly waged war,” said the American.","originalDescription":"“Esta solicitud fue presentada directamente por mí, y agradezco enormemente su aceptación por parte del presidente Vladimir Putin y el presidente Volodymyr Zelenskyy. Espero que sea el principio del fin de una guerra muy larga, sangrienta y duramente librada\", aseguró el estadunidense.","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"85d35855-66e5-443c-b8eb-bcc2722f15b9","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:183:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announces \"A Ceasefire\" Between Russia and Ukraine May 9-11","originalTitle":"Trump anuncia \"un alto el fuego\" entre Rusia y Ucrania del 9 al 11 de mayo","url":"https://www.proceso.com.mx/internacional/2026/5/8/trump-anuncia-un-alto-el-fuego-entre-rusia-ucrania-del-al-11-de-mayo-373698.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:183:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:06:27.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T12:44:00.000Z","description":"Washington, United States. U.S. President Donald Trump announced a three-day ceasefire between Ukraine and Russia starting on Saturday. Russia maintains unilateral truce for May 9 Moscow had previously announced a unilateral truce on the occasion of the May 9 commemorations in Russia. \"Let us hope it will be the beginning of the end of a very long, deadly and difficult war.\" Trump wrote on his Truth Social platform, stating that the truce would …","originalDescription":"Washington, Estados Unidos. El presidente estadounidense Donald Trump anunció un alto el fuego de tres días entre Ucrania y Rusia a partir del sábado. Rusia mantiene tregua unilateral por 9 de mayo Moscú ya había anunciado previamente una tregua unilateral con motivo de las conmemoraciones del 9 de mayo en Rusia. \n\"Esperemos que sea el principio del fin de una guerra muy larga, mortífera y difícil\". Escribió Trump en su plataforma Truth Social, …","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"bddb49ba-75cd-42ac-9278-dc1a40c4a803","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:364:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Donald Trump Announces Three-Day Ceasefire Between Ukraine and Russia · Global Voices","originalTitle":"Donald Trump anuncia alto el fuego de tres días entre Ucrania y Rusia","url":"https://udgtv.com/noticias/donald-trump-anuncia-alto-el-fuego-entre-ucrania-y-rusia/315767","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:364:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-09T00:22:26.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T12:00:00.000Z","description":"The Kremlin reported Friday having accepted the proposal of U.S. President Donald Trump on a truce with Ukraine between May 9 and 11 and an exchange of 1,000 prisoners from each side. \"Following instructions from President Vladimir Putin, I confirm Russia's acceptance of the initiative recently proposed by U.S. President Donald Trump on a ceasefire for the exchange of prisoners of war between Russia and Ukraine,\" Yuri Ushakov, Russian presidenti…","originalDescription":"El Kremlin informó este viernes haber aceptado la propuesta del presidente estadounidense, Donald Trump, sobre una tregua con Ucrania entre el 9 y el 11 de mayo y un intercambio de mil prisioneros de cada bando. \n\"Siguiendo instrucciones del presidente Vladímir Putin, confirmo la aceptación por parte rusa de la iniciativa propuesta recientemente por el presidente estadounidense Donald Trump sobre un alto el fuego para el intercambio de prisioner…","lang":"es","paywall":"no","refId":"a05a5120-766e-4368-a960-7276e7fb8694","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:460:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Moscow Accepts the Proposed Truce with Ukraine From 9 to 11 May","originalTitle":"Moscú acepta la propuesta de tregua con Ucrania del 9 al 11 de mayo","url":"https://www.elsiglodetorreon.com.mx/noticia/2026/moscu-acepta-la-propuesta-de-tregua-con-ucrania-del-9-al-11-de-mayo.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:460:sourceInfo"},{"articleId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-08T19:57:55.000Z","date":"2026-05-08T12:00:00.000Z","description":"US President Donald Trump announced a three-day truce between Ukraine and Russia on May 9, 10 and 11. And also announced the exchange of prisoners 1000 for 1000. He reported this on his social network.\n“I am pleased to announce that a three-day ceasefire will be declared in the war between Russia and Ukraine (May 9, 10 and 11). In Russia, this holiday is dedicated to Victory Day, but also in Ukraine, because it also played an important role in W…","originalDescription":"Президент США Дональд Трамп оголосив триденне перемир'я між Україною та рф – 9, 10 та 11 травня. А також анонсував обмін полоненими 1000 на 1000. Про це він повідомив у своїй соцмережі.\n\"Я радий повідомити, що у війні між росією та Україною буде оголошено триденне перемир'я (9, 10 та 11 травня). У росії це свято присвячене Дню Перемоги, але так само і в Україні, позаяк вона також відіграла важливу роль у Другій світовій війні\", – написав Трамп.\n…","lang":"uk","paywall":"no","refId":"6baeb273-12ae-4ba8-93c6-a2d8ad5069a0","sortData":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:articleSources:516:sortData","specialIcon":null,"title":"Trump Announced a Three-Day Truce Between Ukraine and Russia and Announced the Exchange of Prisoners From 1000 to 1000","originalTitle":"Трамп оголосив про триденне перемир'я між Україною та рф і анонсував обмін полоненими 1000 на 1000 – подробиці","url":"https://www.5.ua/polityka/tramp-oholosyv-pro-trydenne-peremyria-mizh-ukrainoiu-ta-rf-i-anonsuvav-obmin-polonenymy-1000-na-1000-podrobytsi-375845.html","wireStoryId":null,"sourceInfo":"$86:props:children:0:props:children:4:props:children:0:props:art